    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003ePalmer shared an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7sUMYaJNCc/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram video\u003c/a\u003e of herself dancing with the singer and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/11/02/dance-moms-reunion-special-jojo-siwa-cast-members/71419544007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Dance Mom\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/11/02/dance-moms-reunion-special-jojo-siwa-cast-members/71419544007/\"\u003es\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; alum Saturday ahead of a Pride Month performance. The ladies playfully whipped their arms to a groovy dance beat. \u0026#34;Get up here! Let\u0026#39;s dance,\u0026#34; Palmer lip-synced in the video.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73951452007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e“When you (and) @itsjojosiwa are both performing at Pittsburgh Pride and need a (little) dance warm up 😂😂😂\u0026#34; Palmer wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Mary Walrath-Holdridge, Brendan Morrow and Ralphie Aversa, USA TODAY\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

contentBody:
{
  "contentBody": [{
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73766397007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/05/26/katy-perry-returns-las-vegas-resorts-world-residency/9927676002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKaty Perry\u003c/a\u003e is celebrating \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/nation/2024/06/01/pride-month-explained/73937777007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePride Month\u003c/a\u003e with a dash of sass.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn Saturday, the popstar marked the first day of the monthlong LGBTQ celebration with an edited video of a recent commencement speech given by NFL player \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/2024/05/16/harrison-butker-speech-internet-nfl-celebs-react/73713932007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eHarrison Butker\u003c/a\u003e. The Kansas City Chiefs kicker drew controversy earlier this month for his remarks, some of which took aim at the LGBTQ community and \u0026#34;dangerous gender ideologies.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe revised clip, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/C7sSJyovXU7/?igsh\u003ddGg4ZDljdDRoYTI4\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eshared to Perry\u0026#39;s Instagram\u003c/a\u003e, splices Butker\u0026#39;s comments to sound like he was showing support for the LGBTQ community. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The road ahead is bright, things are changing, society is shifting and people young and old are embracing diversity, equity and inclusion,\u0026#34; Butker says in the edited video. \u0026#34;With that said, I want to say happy Pride Month to all of you.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73951463007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u0026#34;Firework\u0026#34; singer concluded the post with a message for her LGBTQ fans.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Fixed this for my girls, my graduates, and my gays — you can do anything, congratulations and happy pride 🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍⚧️ 🧡\u0026#34; Perry wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eCheck out how other stars are celebrating Pride and showing their love for the LGBTQ community.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "35626395"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJessica Madsen shares pride for same-sex relationship\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eJessica Madsen kicked off Pride Month with a joyful update on her love life.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/05/17/nicola-coughlan-bridgerton-season-3-interview/73725101007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Bridgerton\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; star shared a series of LGBTQ imagery in an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7qtJkwMu4h/?img_index\u003d1\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram post\u003c/a\u003e Saturday, including a GIF of herself wearing a colorful tie-dye top and rainbow-colored jewel makeup.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;In love with a woman, loud about it and proud about it! 🌈\u0026#34; Madsen wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73951462007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAdele shows support for Pride Month by calling out concert heckler\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/02/adele-calls-out-las-vegas-concertgoer-pride-sucks/73947470007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eAdele\u003c/a\u003e slammed an audience member who shouted, \u0026#34;Pride sucks!\u0026#34;, during a recent performance in her \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/02/27/adele-postpones-las-vegas-residency-march-dates-illness/72765401007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLas Vegas concert residency\u003c/a\u003e, according to a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/dellyfromdablok/status/1797110056028139671\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003evideo shared on social m\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/dellyfromdablok/status/1797110056028139671\"\u003eedia\u003c/a\u003e Saturday.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn the clip, the British pop singer initially appeared taken aback after being interrupted by the heckler but grew angry after realizing what they had said.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Did you come to my (expletive) show and just say that Pride sucks?\u0026#34; an incensed Adele asked. \u0026#34;Are you (expletive) stupid?\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe crowd erupted in cheers after the 16-time Grammy winner told this \u0026#34;ridiculous\u0026#34; concertgoer, \u0026#34;You\u0026#39;ve got nothing nice to say, shut up, all right?\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;Shut up!\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/02/adele-calls-out-las-vegas-concertgoer-pride-sucks/73947470007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAdele calls out \u0026#39;stupid\u0026#39; concertgoer for shouting \u0026#39;Pride sucks\u0026#39; at her show\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAdam Lambert rocks out at WeHo Pride\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/10/adam-lambert-changes-pronoun-whataya-want-from-me/73627292007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eAdam Lambert\u003c/a\u003e made Tinseltown sparkle with queer magic.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/05/02/every-american-idol-winner-ranked-worst-best/9617596002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;American Idol\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; alum took the stage at WeHo Pride and rocked out in a black sheer top, sleek leather jacket and matching pants for the performance, which included the premiere of Lambert’s new song \u0026#34;Lube.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;WeHo Pride, you all brought the fire! 😈\u0026#34; Lambert \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7sggT5x3Rf/?img_index\u003d1\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewrote on Instagram\u003c/a\u003e. \u0026#34;It was amazing to perform \u0026#39;Lube\u0026#39; live for the first time. Your energy was electrifying!\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73951458007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/28/adam-lambert-interview/73733086007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMay interview with USA TODAY\u003c/a\u003e, Lambert reflected on the political pushback faced by the LGBTQ community.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I think people are scared of confidence and scared of pride and scared of what they don\u0026#39;t understand,\u0026#34; Lambert said. \u0026#34;I feel sorry for those that are controlled by that kind of fear.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eAdam Lambert: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/28/adam-lambert-interview/73733086007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSinger talks Pride, announces new EP \u0026#39;Afters\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eKeke Palmer joins JoJo Siwa for Pride Month dance\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/03/12/keke-palmer-jimmy-fallon-password-season-2-celebrity-guests/72941293007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKeke Palmer\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/health-wellness/2024/04/10/jojo-siwa-music-video-hate-bullies-online-response/73275764007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJoJo Siwa\u003c/a\u003e make for a funky double rainbow.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003ePalmer shared an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7sUMYaJNCc/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram video\u003c/a\u003e of herself dancing with the singer and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/11/02/dance-moms-reunion-special-jojo-siwa-cast-members/71419544007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Dance Mom\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/11/02/dance-moms-reunion-special-jojo-siwa-cast-members/71419544007/\"\u003es\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; alum Saturday ahead of a Pride Month performance. The ladies playfully whipped their arms to a groovy dance beat. \u0026#34;Get up here! Let\u0026#39;s dance,\u0026#34; Palmer lip-synced in the video.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73951452007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e“When you (and) @itsjojosiwa are both performing at Pittsburgh Pride and need a (little) dance warm up 😂😂😂\u0026#34; Palmer wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Mary Walrath-Holdridge, Brendan Morrow and Ralphie Aversa, USA TODAY\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73142590007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMother Monster is expecting ... you to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/elections/voter-guide/2024-11-05\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ego to the polls\u003c/a\u003e this November.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFollowing recent speculation that \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/08/lady-gaga-hbo-concert-film-trailer/73616823007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLady Gaga\u003c/a\u003e is pregnant, the pop singer addressed the rumor in a playful \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@ladygaga/video/7376784960625085742?lang\u003den\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTikTok video\u003c/a\u003e posted Monday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eSpeculation about whether the \u0026#34;Born This Way\u0026#34; singer is expecting emerged when she was photographed over the weekend attending wedding festivities for her sister Natali Germanotta in Maine, according to photos shared by \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.thesun.co.uk/tvandshowbiz/28284584/lady-gaga-pregnant-bump-wedding-sister/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Sun\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eGaga’s TikTok response featured the singer showing off her black winged eyeliner for the camera, set to a sassy audio clip that said, “I am the aesthetic. I don’t have to find an aesthetic; I am the aesthetic.”\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73988562007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe 10-second clip was also overlaid with text that contained an election-themed message for Gaga’s fans — plus an apparent reference to another pop superstar.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e“Not pregnant ― just down bad cryin at the gym,” the text in the video read in what appeared to be a reference to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/health-wellness/2024/06/03/jason-sudeikis-taylor-swift-marriage-joke-matters/73958121007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTaylor Swift\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#39;s song “Down Bad” off her new \u0026#34;T\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/04/19/taylor-swift-tortured-poets-department-review/73342235007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eortured Poets Department\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; album.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe message continued: “Register to vote at \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.headcount.org/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewww.headcount.org\u003c/a\u003e.”\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.headcount.org/about-headcount/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eHeadCount\u003c/a\u003e is an organization that promotes voter registration by establishing nonpartisan registration drives across various live events, including concerts and music festivals.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;I\u0026#39;m so excited\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/08/lady-gaga-hbo-concert-film-trailer/73616823007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eLady Gaga reveals trailer for Chromatica Ball concert film on HBO\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "2512743"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eGaga posted a similar message across her social platforms with a slightly different video. \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/ladygaga/status/1798179011962798421\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eOn X\u003c/a\u003e and in her \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/ladygaga/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram Story\u003c/a\u003e, she posted a clip of herself winking at the camera.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Not pregnant… REGISTER TO VOTE or check if you’ve already registered EASILY at headcount.org,\u0026#34; she wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eGaga’s TikTok message follows the release of her HBO concert special \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/08/lady-gaga-hbo-concert-film-trailer/73616823007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e“Gaga Chromatica Ball,”\u003c/a\u003e a film that pays tribute to the popstar’s 2022 \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/08/09/lady-gaga-u-s-chromatica-ball-tour-singer-defends-gay-marriage-abortion/10266229002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eChromatica Ball tour\u003c/a\u003e. She\u0026#39;s scheduled to be \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/19/lady-gaga-jazz-and-piano-dates/73034602007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eback in Las Vegas\u003c/a\u003e this summer for another round of her \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/music/2018/08/07/lady-gaga-announces-las-vegas-residency-dates/921890002/\"\u003eJazz \u0026amp; Piano residency\u003c/a\u003e at MGM Grand\u0026#39;s Dolby Live amphitheater.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73142590007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMother Monster is expecting ... you to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/elections/voter-guide/2024-11-05\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ego to the polls\u003c/a\u003e this November.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFollowing recent speculation that \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/08/lady-gaga-hbo-concert-film-trailer/73616823007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLady Gaga\u003c/a\u003e is pregnant, the pop singer addressed the rumor in a playful \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@ladygaga/video/7376784960625085742?lang\u003den\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTikTok video\u003c/a\u003e posted Monday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eSpeculation about whether the \u0026#34;Born This Way\u0026#34; singer is expecting emerged when she was photographed over the weekend attending wedding festivities for her sister Natali Germanotta in Maine, according to photos shared by \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.thesun.co.uk/tvandshowbiz/28284584/lady-gaga-pregnant-bump-wedding-sister/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Sun\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eGaga’s TikTok response featured the singer showing off her black winged eyeliner for the camera, set to a sassy audio clip that said, “I am the aesthetic. I don’t have to find an aesthetic; I am the aesthetic.”\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73988562007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe 10-second clip was also overlaid with text that contained an election-themed message for Gaga’s fans — plus an apparent reference to another pop superstar.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e“Not pregnant ― just down bad cryin at the gym,” the text in the video read in what appeared to be a reference to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/health-wellness/2024/06/03/jason-sudeikis-taylor-swift-marriage-joke-matters/73958121007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTaylor Swift\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#39;s song “Down Bad” off her new \u0026#34;T\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/04/19/taylor-swift-tortured-poets-department-review/73342235007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eortured Poets Department\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; album.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe message continued: “Register to vote at \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.headcount.org/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewww.headcount.org\u003c/a\u003e.”\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.headcount.org/about-headcount/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eHeadCount\u003c/a\u003e is an organization that promotes voter registration by establishing nonpartisan registration drives across various live events, including concerts and music festivals.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;I\u0026#39;m so excited\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/08/lady-gaga-hbo-concert-film-trailer/73616823007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eLady Gaga reveals trailer for Chromatica Ball concert film on HBO\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "2512743"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eGaga posted a similar message across her social platforms with a slightly different video. \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/ladygaga/status/1798179011962798421\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eOn X\u003c/a\u003e and in her \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/ladygaga/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram Story\u003c/a\u003e, she posted a clip of herself winking at the camera.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Not pregnant… REGISTER TO VOTE or check if you’ve already registered EASILY at headcount.org,\u0026#34; she wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eGaga’s TikTok message follows the release of her HBO concert special \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/08/lady-gaga-hbo-concert-film-trailer/73616823007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e“Gaga Chromatica Ball,”\u003c/a\u003e a film that pays tribute to the popstar’s 2022 \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/08/09/lady-gaga-u-s-chromatica-ball-tour-singer-defends-gay-marriage-abortion/10266229002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eChromatica Ball tour\u003c/a\u003e. She\u0026#39;s scheduled to be \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/19/lady-gaga-jazz-and-piano-dates/73034602007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eback in Las Vegas\u003c/a\u003e this summer for another round of her \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/music/2018/08/07/lady-gaga-announces-las-vegas-residency-dates/921890002/\"\u003eJazz \u0026amp; Piano residency\u003c/a\u003e at MGM Grand\u0026#39;s Dolby Live amphitheater.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

contentBody:
{
  "contentBody": [{
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73142590007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eMother Monster is expecting ... you to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/elections/voter-guide/2024-11-05\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ego to the polls\u003c/a\u003e this November.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eFollowing recent speculation that \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/08/lady-gaga-hbo-concert-film-trailer/73616823007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLady Gaga\u003c/a\u003e is pregnant, the pop singer addressed the rumor in a playful \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@ladygaga/video/7376784960625085742?lang\u003den\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTikTok video\u003c/a\u003e posted Monday.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eSpeculation about whether the \u0026#34;Born This Way\u0026#34; singer is expecting emerged when she was photographed over the weekend attending wedding festivities for her sister Natali Germanotta in Maine, according to photos shared by \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.thesun.co.uk/tvandshowbiz/28284584/lady-gaga-pregnant-bump-wedding-sister/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Sun\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eGaga’s TikTok response featured the singer showing off her black winged eyeliner for the camera, set to a sassy audio clip that said, “I am the aesthetic. I don’t have to find an aesthetic; I am the aesthetic.”\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73988562007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe 10-second clip was also overlaid with text that contained an election-themed message for Gaga’s fans — plus an apparent reference to another pop superstar.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e“Not pregnant ― just down bad cryin at the gym,” the text in the video read in what appeared to be a reference to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/health-wellness/2024/06/03/jason-sudeikis-taylor-swift-marriage-joke-matters/73958121007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTaylor Swift\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#39;s song “Down Bad” off her new \u0026#34;T\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/04/19/taylor-swift-tortured-poets-department-review/73342235007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eortured Poets Department\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; album.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe message continued: “Register to vote at \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.headcount.org/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewww.headcount.org\u003c/a\u003e.”\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.headcount.org/about-headcount/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eHeadCount\u003c/a\u003e is an organization that promotes voter registration by establishing nonpartisan registration drives across various live events, including concerts and music festivals.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;I\u0026#39;m so excited\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/08/lady-gaga-hbo-concert-film-trailer/73616823007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eLady Gaga reveals trailer for Chromatica Ball concert film on HBO\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "2512743"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eGaga posted a similar message across her social platforms with a slightly different video. \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/ladygaga/status/1798179011962798421\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eOn X\u003c/a\u003e and in her \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/ladygaga/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram Story\u003c/a\u003e, she posted a clip of herself winking at the camera.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Not pregnant… REGISTER TO VOTE or check if you’ve already registered EASILY at headcount.org,\u0026#34; she wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eGaga’s TikTok message follows the release of her HBO concert special \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/08/lady-gaga-hbo-concert-film-trailer/73616823007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e“Gaga Chromatica Ball,”\u003c/a\u003e a film that pays tribute to the popstar’s 2022 \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/08/09/lady-gaga-u-s-chromatica-ball-tour-singer-defends-gay-marriage-abortion/10266229002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eChromatica Ball tour\u003c/a\u003e. She\u0026#39;s scheduled to be \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/19/lady-gaga-jazz-and-piano-dates/73034602007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eback in Las Vegas\u003c/a\u003e this summer for another round of her \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/music/2018/08/07/lady-gaga-announces-las-vegas-residency-dates/921890002/\"\u003eJazz \u0026amp; Piano residency\u003c/a\u003e at MGM Grand\u0026#39;s Dolby Live amphitheater.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74015335007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eIn a new series \u003cstrong\u003eUSA TODAY’s The Essentials\u003c/strong\u003e, celebrities share what fuels their lives.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eSummer is already sending out good vibrations because \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/books/2023/10/24/john-stamos-memoir-interview-if-you-would-have-told-me/71225020007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/books/2023/10/24/john-stamos-memoir-interview-if-you-would-have-told-me/71225020007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJohn Stamos\u003c/a\u003e is hitting the road with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/24/beach-boys-disney-documentary-interview/73779855007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/24/beach-boys-disney-documentary-interview/73779855007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Beach Boys.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/12/21/john-stamos-dui-drinking-sobriety/71998141007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eStamos,\u003c/a\u003e 60, will play drums and guitar with the band through September on The Endless Summer Gold Tour, which marks the 50th anniversary of the Beach Boys\u0026#39; classic \u0026#34;Endless Summer\u0026#34; album. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The Beach Boys mean summer to me,\u0026#34; says Stamos who has been jamming with the band since the 19-year-old \u0026#34;General Hospital\u0026#34; star was pulled on stage for a concert. The self-described \u0026#34;wanna-be Beach Boy\u0026#34; Stamos even enthusiastically bongoed in the classic 1988 \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dfJWmbLS2_ec\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dfJWmbLS2_ec\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Kokomo\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e video. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003ePerforming timeless songs in front of screaming fans is the ultimate energizer for the already-animated Stamos. But the bestselling author of his 2023 memoir \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/24/beach-boys-disney-documentary-interview/73779855007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/24/beach-boys-disney-documentary-interview/73779855007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;If You Would Have Told Me\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e has learned to appreciate how important good rest is on the road.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJoin our Watch Party! \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSign up to receive USA TODAY\u0026#39;s movie and TV recommendations right in your inbox\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;When I first toured, they were all older than me. You\u0026#39;d meet in the hotel lobby before the concert and everyone was like, \u0026#39;How did you sleep?\u0026#39; I\u0026#39;d be like, \u0026#39;What do you even mean? I slept,\u0026#39;\u0026#34; Stamos recalls. \u0026#34;Now I\u0026#39;m like the first one to ask, \u0026#39;Did you sleep OK?\u0026#39;\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eStamos shares his essential Beach Boys song, his hair secrets and more.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73929187007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s the top Beach Boys song? John Stamos weighs in\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eStamos has lifelong respect for the entire catalog of the band from Hawthorne, California, founded by Brian, Carl, and Dennis Wilson, their cousin Mike Love and their friend Al Jardine. But Stamos reckons \u0026#34;God Only Knows\u0026#34; (by Brian Wilson and Tony Asher) \u0026#34;is a perfect song.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;There\u0026#39;s not many perfect songs. \u0026#34;Something\u0026#34; by the Beatles is perfect. But \u0026#34;God Only Knows\u0026#34; is perfect, too,\u0026#34; he says.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73967513007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJohn Stamos, son Billy stay in touch with onstage FaceTime calls\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBeing on the road means being away from his wife \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/entertainthis/2018/02/04/reports-john-stamos-married-man/305383002/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/entertainthis/2018/02/04/reports-john-stamos-married-man/305383002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eCaitlin McHugh Stamos\u003c/a\u003e and son Billy, 6. But Stamos, who became a first-time dad at 54, keeps in touch with FaceTime video calls, including when he\u0026#39;s rocking the drums on stage.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;People make fun of my selfie stick, but I use it to hit FaceTime for like four songs and just keep playing,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;Most of the time, he\u0026#39;ll be like, \u0026#39;I gotta go, dad.\u0026#39; He\u0026#39;s a character. He\u0026#39;s the light in my life, the reason I wake up in the morning.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "7228232002"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "71967673007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWhen John Stamos has a stage fail in front of Adam Sandler, he just keeps rocking \u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eStage mishaps happen in live shows. Stamos plays through them, like when he went full throttle after hearing Adam Sandler was in attendance.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m showing off, running across the stage. I hit this cord and I go flying, landing on my guitar. But I got up and kept going,\u0026#34; says Stamos, who says the audience didn\u0026#39;t notice. \u0026#34;Adam Sandler comes backstage, and I go, \u0026#39;God, I wiped out.\u0026#39; And he was like, \u0026#39;What are you talking about?\u0026#39; You just keep going.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Like anything in life, you just dust yourself off and get back to it,\u0026#34; says Stamos. He took his own advice after ripping his pants at the April Stagecoach Festival in front of 80,000 people (and didn\u0026#39;t have time to repair the wardrobe malfunction). \u0026#34;I was wearing white underpants luckily under white pants. Most of the time, people don\u0026#39;t even notice. It\u0026#39;s taken me so long to learn this lesson.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73977670007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJohn Stamos\u0026#39; hair is iconic: Styling it is a Ronco Showtime miracle\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAdmit it, we all envy John Stamos\u0026#39; hair. How does he work it? Stamos says his \u0026#39;do is as fuss-free as the famed \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dGG43jyZ65R8\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eRonco Showtime Rotisserie \u0026amp; BBQ\u003c/a\u003e from the classic infomercial.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;You just set it and forget it,\u0026#34; says Stamos quoting the famed Ronco \u0026#39;80s pitch.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHis use of styling products earned him the nickname \u0026#34;mud\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Full House\u0026#34; star Dave Coulier. While Stamos vows to start his own line, he says it doesn\u0026#39;t take much. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74015334007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Honestly, if I put a little water in (my hair), I\u0026#39;ve got stuff in here from the \u0026#39;90s that reactivates. So that\u0026#39;s part of it,\u0026#34; he says.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe heroic hair \u0026#34;knows when it\u0026#39;s showtime,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;I\u0026#39;ll look in the mirror and be like, \u0026#39;Yeeeeah, it\u0026#39;s showtime!\u0026#39;\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74012789007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJohn Stamos\u0026#39; lesson from \u0026#39;Full House\u0026#39; co-star Bob Saget\u0026#39;s death\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eStamos is still deeply emotionally impacted by the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2022/02/09/bob-saget-family-says-star-died-head-trauma-after-possible-fall/6729034001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eFebruary 2022\u003c/a\u003e death of his friend and \u0026#34;Full House\u0026#34; co-star Bob Saget. Last month, he celebrated the late comedian\u0026#39;s 65th birthday by posting a \u0026#34;Full House\u0026#34; reunion photo on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7F3GJgJcUb/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7MYQayrfHD/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e taken the day after Saget\u0026#39;s funeral, which included Mary-Kate and Ashley Olsen.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Bob was the one who kept us all together, he was the glue,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;It still hurts. He was just plucked out of our lives.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "83038134"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eJust before the comedian\u0026#39;s death, Stamos enjoyed a reunion with Saget and their wives. The two expressed their love for each other and took a final picture together. The whole tragedy taught Stamos to make his feelings known.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;You just never think that\u0026#39;s going to be the last time with someone. But you just don\u0026#39;t know,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;That\u0026#39;s why you tell everybody you love him and care about them. That you\u0026#39;re proud of them. Call your mom.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "7044543001"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"presto-h2 marker\"\u003eSummer is all kid-filled parties and getting hosed down\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"marker\"\u003eFor Stamos, summer is all about working the pizza oven for friends. \u0026#34;But parties are different now,\u0026#34; says Stamos. who has been sober since 2015. \u0026#34;Nowadays, there\u0026#39;s a lot of kids running, laughing and throwing water balloons.\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"marker\"\u003eBilly is the water culprit who surprise attacks with a hose when his father comes home from work.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"marker\"\u003e\u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m so tired and he\u0026#39;s just waiting behind the bush with a hose,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;The joy he gets out of spraying his poor dad. I just love it. That\u0026#39;s summer to me.\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis interview has been edited for length and clarity.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74015335007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eIn a new series \u003cstrong\u003eUSA TODAY’s The Essentials\u003c/strong\u003e, celebrities share what fuels their lives.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eSummer is already sending out good vibrations because \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/books/2023/10/24/john-stamos-memoir-interview-if-you-would-have-told-me/71225020007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/books/2023/10/24/john-stamos-memoir-interview-if-you-would-have-told-me/71225020007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJohn Stamos\u003c/a\u003e is hitting the road with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/24/beach-boys-disney-documentary-interview/73779855007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/24/beach-boys-disney-documentary-interview/73779855007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Beach Boys.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/12/21/john-stamos-dui-drinking-sobriety/71998141007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eStamos,\u003c/a\u003e 60, will play drums and guitar with the band through September on The Endless Summer Gold Tour, which marks the 50th anniversary of the Beach Boys\u0026#39; classic \u0026#34;Endless Summer\u0026#34; album. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The Beach Boys mean summer to me,\u0026#34; says Stamos who has been jamming with the band since the 19-year-old \u0026#34;General Hospital\u0026#34; star was pulled on stage for a concert. The self-described \u0026#34;wanna-be Beach Boy\u0026#34; Stamos even enthusiastically bongoed in the classic 1988 \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dfJWmbLS2_ec\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dfJWmbLS2_ec\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Kokomo\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e video. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003ePerforming timeless songs in front of screaming fans is the ultimate energizer for the already-animated Stamos. But the bestselling author of his 2023 memoir \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/24/beach-boys-disney-documentary-interview/73779855007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/24/beach-boys-disney-documentary-interview/73779855007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;If You Would Have Told Me\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e has learned to appreciate how important good rest is on the road.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJoin our Watch Party! \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSign up to receive USA TODAY\u0026#39;s movie and TV recommendations right in your inbox\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;When I first toured, they were all older than me. You\u0026#39;d meet in the hotel lobby before the concert and everyone was like, \u0026#39;How did you sleep?\u0026#39; I\u0026#39;d be like, \u0026#39;What do you even mean? I slept,\u0026#39;\u0026#34; Stamos recalls. \u0026#34;Now I\u0026#39;m like the first one to ask, \u0026#39;Did you sleep OK?\u0026#39;\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eStamos shares his essential Beach Boys song, his hair secrets and more.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73929187007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s the top Beach Boys song? John Stamos weighs in\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eStamos has lifelong respect for the entire catalog of the band from Hawthorne, California, founded by Brian, Carl, and Dennis Wilson, their cousin Mike Love and their friend Al Jardine. But Stamos reckons \u0026#34;God Only Knows\u0026#34; (by Brian Wilson and Tony Asher) \u0026#34;is a perfect song.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;There\u0026#39;s not many perfect songs. \u0026#34;Something\u0026#34; by the Beatles is perfect. But \u0026#34;God Only Knows\u0026#34; is perfect, too,\u0026#34; he says.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73967513007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJohn Stamos, son Billy stay in touch with onstage FaceTime calls\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBeing on the road means being away from his wife \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/entertainthis/2018/02/04/reports-john-stamos-married-man/305383002/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/entertainthis/2018/02/04/reports-john-stamos-married-man/305383002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eCaitlin McHugh Stamos\u003c/a\u003e and son Billy, 6. But Stamos, who became a first-time dad at 54, keeps in touch with FaceTime video calls, including when he\u0026#39;s rocking the drums on stage.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;People make fun of my selfie stick, but I use it to hit FaceTime for like four songs and just keep playing,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;Most of the time, he\u0026#39;ll be like, \u0026#39;I gotta go, dad.\u0026#39; He\u0026#39;s a character. He\u0026#39;s the light in my life, the reason I wake up in the morning.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "7228232002"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "71967673007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWhen John Stamos has a stage fail in front of Adam Sandler, he just keeps rocking \u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eStage mishaps happen in live shows. Stamos plays through them, like when he went full throttle after hearing Adam Sandler was in attendance.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m showing off, running across the stage. I hit this cord and I go flying, landing on my guitar. But I got up and kept going,\u0026#34; says Stamos, who says the audience didn\u0026#39;t notice. \u0026#34;Adam Sandler comes backstage, and I go, \u0026#39;God, I wiped out.\u0026#39; And he was like, \u0026#39;What are you talking about?\u0026#39; You just keep going.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Like anything in life, you just dust yourself off and get back to it,\u0026#34; says Stamos. He took his own advice after ripping his pants at the April Stagecoach Festival in front of 80,000 people (and didn\u0026#39;t have time to repair the wardrobe malfunction). \u0026#34;I was wearing white underpants luckily under white pants. Most of the time, people don\u0026#39;t even notice. It\u0026#39;s taken me so long to learn this lesson.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73977670007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJohn Stamos\u0026#39; hair is iconic: Styling it is a Ronco Showtime miracle\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAdmit it, we all envy John Stamos\u0026#39; hair. How does he work it? Stamos says his \u0026#39;do is as fuss-free as the famed \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dGG43jyZ65R8\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eRonco Showtime Rotisserie \u0026amp; BBQ\u003c/a\u003e from the classic infomercial.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;You just set it and forget it,\u0026#34; says Stamos quoting the famed Ronco \u0026#39;80s pitch.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHis use of styling products earned him the nickname \u0026#34;mud\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Full House\u0026#34; star Dave Coulier. While Stamos vows to start his own line, he says it doesn\u0026#39;t take much. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74015334007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Honestly, if I put a little water in (my hair), I\u0026#39;ve got stuff in here from the \u0026#39;90s that reactivates. So that\u0026#39;s part of it,\u0026#34; he says.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe heroic hair \u0026#34;knows when it\u0026#39;s showtime,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;I\u0026#39;ll look in the mirror and be like, \u0026#39;Yeeeeah, it\u0026#39;s showtime!\u0026#39;\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74012789007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJohn Stamos\u0026#39; lesson from \u0026#39;Full House\u0026#39; co-star Bob Saget\u0026#39;s death\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eStamos is still deeply emotionally impacted by the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2022/02/09/bob-saget-family-says-star-died-head-trauma-after-possible-fall/6729034001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eFebruary 2022\u003c/a\u003e death of his friend and \u0026#34;Full House\u0026#34; co-star Bob Saget. Last month, he celebrated the late comedian\u0026#39;s 65th birthday by posting a \u0026#34;Full House\u0026#34; reunion photo on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7F3GJgJcUb/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7MYQayrfHD/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e taken the day after Saget\u0026#39;s funeral, which included Mary-Kate and Ashley Olsen.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Bob was the one who kept us all together, he was the glue,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;It still hurts. He was just plucked out of our lives.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "83038134"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eJust before the comedian\u0026#39;s death, Stamos enjoyed a reunion with Saget and their wives. The two expressed their love for each other and took a final picture together. The whole tragedy taught Stamos to make his feelings known.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;You just never think that\u0026#39;s going to be the last time with someone. But you just don\u0026#39;t know,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;That\u0026#39;s why you tell everybody you love him and care about them. That you\u0026#39;re proud of them. Call your mom.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "7044543001"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"presto-h2 marker\"\u003eSummer is all kid-filled parties and getting hosed down\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"marker\"\u003eFor Stamos, summer is all about working the pizza oven for friends. \u0026#34;But parties are different now,\u0026#34; says Stamos. who has been sober since 2015. \u0026#34;Nowadays, there\u0026#39;s a lot of kids running, laughing and throwing water balloons.\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"marker\"\u003eBilly is the water culprit who surprise attacks with a hose when his father comes home from work.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"marker\"\u003e\u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m so tired and he\u0026#39;s just waiting behind the bush with a hose,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;The joy he gets out of spraying his poor dad. I just love it. That\u0026#39;s summer to me.\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis interview has been edited for length and clarity.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

contentBody:
{
  "contentBody": [{
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74015335007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eIn a new series \u003cstrong\u003eUSA TODAY’s The Essentials\u003c/strong\u003e, celebrities share what fuels their lives.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eSummer is already sending out good vibrations because \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/books/2023/10/24/john-stamos-memoir-interview-if-you-would-have-told-me/71225020007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/books/2023/10/24/john-stamos-memoir-interview-if-you-would-have-told-me/71225020007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJohn Stamos\u003c/a\u003e is hitting the road with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/24/beach-boys-disney-documentary-interview/73779855007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/24/beach-boys-disney-documentary-interview/73779855007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Beach Boys.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/12/21/john-stamos-dui-drinking-sobriety/71998141007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eStamos,\u003c/a\u003e 60, will play drums and guitar with the band through September on The Endless Summer Gold Tour, which marks the 50th anniversary of the Beach Boys\u0026#39; classic \u0026#34;Endless Summer\u0026#34; album. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The Beach Boys mean summer to me,\u0026#34; says Stamos who has been jamming with the band since the 19-year-old \u0026#34;General Hospital\u0026#34; star was pulled on stage for a concert. The self-described \u0026#34;wanna-be Beach Boy\u0026#34; Stamos even enthusiastically bongoed in the classic 1988 \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dfJWmbLS2_ec\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dfJWmbLS2_ec\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Kokomo\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e video. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003ePerforming timeless songs in front of screaming fans is the ultimate energizer for the already-animated Stamos. But the bestselling author of his 2023 memoir \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/24/beach-boys-disney-documentary-interview/73779855007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/24/beach-boys-disney-documentary-interview/73779855007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;If You Would Have Told Me\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e has learned to appreciate how important good rest is on the road.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJoin our Watch Party! \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSign up to receive USA TODAY\u0026#39;s movie and TV recommendations right in your inbox\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;When I first toured, they were all older than me. You\u0026#39;d meet in the hotel lobby before the concert and everyone was like, \u0026#39;How did you sleep?\u0026#39; I\u0026#39;d be like, \u0026#39;What do you even mean? I slept,\u0026#39;\u0026#34; Stamos recalls. \u0026#34;Now I\u0026#39;m like the first one to ask, \u0026#39;Did you sleep OK?\u0026#39;\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eStamos shares his essential Beach Boys song, his hair secrets and more.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73929187007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWhat\u0026#39;s the top Beach Boys song? John Stamos weighs in\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eStamos has lifelong respect for the entire catalog of the band from Hawthorne, California, founded by Brian, Carl, and Dennis Wilson, their cousin Mike Love and their friend Al Jardine. But Stamos reckons \u0026#34;God Only Knows\u0026#34; (by Brian Wilson and Tony Asher) \u0026#34;is a perfect song.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;There\u0026#39;s not many perfect songs. \u0026#34;Something\u0026#34; by the Beatles is perfect. But \u0026#34;God Only Knows\u0026#34; is perfect, too,\u0026#34; he says.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73967513007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJohn Stamos, son Billy stay in touch with onstage FaceTime calls\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eBeing on the road means being away from his wife \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/entertainthis/2018/02/04/reports-john-stamos-married-man/305383002/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/entertainthis/2018/02/04/reports-john-stamos-married-man/305383002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eCaitlin McHugh Stamos\u003c/a\u003e and son Billy, 6. But Stamos, who became a first-time dad at 54, keeps in touch with FaceTime video calls, including when he\u0026#39;s rocking the drums on stage.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;People make fun of my selfie stick, but I use it to hit FaceTime for like four songs and just keep playing,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;Most of the time, he\u0026#39;ll be like, \u0026#39;I gotta go, dad.\u0026#39; He\u0026#39;s a character. He\u0026#39;s the light in my life, the reason I wake up in the morning.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "7228232002"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "71967673007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWhen John Stamos has a stage fail in front of Adam Sandler, he just keeps rocking \u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eStage mishaps happen in live shows. Stamos plays through them, like when he went full throttle after hearing Adam Sandler was in attendance.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m showing off, running across the stage. I hit this cord and I go flying, landing on my guitar. But I got up and kept going,\u0026#34; says Stamos, who says the audience didn\u0026#39;t notice. \u0026#34;Adam Sandler comes backstage, and I go, \u0026#39;God, I wiped out.\u0026#39; And he was like, \u0026#39;What are you talking about?\u0026#39; You just keep going.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Like anything in life, you just dust yourself off and get back to it,\u0026#34; says Stamos. He took his own advice after ripping his pants at the April Stagecoach Festival in front of 80,000 people (and didn\u0026#39;t have time to repair the wardrobe malfunction). \u0026#34;I was wearing white underpants luckily under white pants. Most of the time, people don\u0026#39;t even notice. It\u0026#39;s taken me so long to learn this lesson.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73977670007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJohn Stamos\u0026#39; hair is iconic: Styling it is a Ronco Showtime miracle\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eAdmit it, we all envy John Stamos\u0026#39; hair. How does he work it? Stamos says his \u0026#39;do is as fuss-free as the famed \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dGG43jyZ65R8\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eRonco Showtime Rotisserie \u0026amp; BBQ\u003c/a\u003e from the classic infomercial.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;You just set it and forget it,\u0026#34; says Stamos quoting the famed Ronco \u0026#39;80s pitch.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eHis use of styling products earned him the nickname \u0026#34;mud\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Full House\u0026#34; star Dave Coulier. While Stamos vows to start his own line, he says it doesn\u0026#39;t take much. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74015334007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Honestly, if I put a little water in (my hair), I\u0026#39;ve got stuff in here from the \u0026#39;90s that reactivates. So that\u0026#39;s part of it,\u0026#34; he says.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe heroic hair \u0026#34;knows when it\u0026#39;s showtime,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;I\u0026#39;ll look in the mirror and be like, \u0026#39;Yeeeeah, it\u0026#39;s showtime!\u0026#39;\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74012789007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJohn Stamos\u0026#39; lesson from \u0026#39;Full House\u0026#39; co-star Bob Saget\u0026#39;s death\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eStamos is still deeply emotionally impacted by the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2022/02/09/bob-saget-family-says-star-died-head-trauma-after-possible-fall/6729034001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eFebruary 2022\u003c/a\u003e death of his friend and \u0026#34;Full House\u0026#34; co-star Bob Saget. Last month, he celebrated the late comedian\u0026#39;s 65th birthday by posting a \u0026#34;Full House\u0026#34; reunion photo on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7F3GJgJcUb/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7MYQayrfHD/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e taken the day after Saget\u0026#39;s funeral, which included Mary-Kate and Ashley Olsen.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Bob was the one who kept us all together, he was the glue,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;It still hurts. He was just plucked out of our lives.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "83038134"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eJust before the comedian\u0026#39;s death, Stamos enjoyed a reunion with Saget and their wives. The two expressed their love for each other and took a final picture together. The whole tragedy taught Stamos to make his feelings known.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;You just never think that\u0026#39;s going to be the last time with someone. But you just don\u0026#39;t know,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;That\u0026#39;s why you tell everybody you love him and care about them. That you\u0026#39;re proud of them. Call your mom.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "7044543001"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"presto-h2 marker\"\u003eSummer is all kid-filled parties and getting hosed down\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"marker\"\u003eFor Stamos, summer is all about working the pizza oven for friends. \u0026#34;But parties are different now,\u0026#34; says Stamos. who has been sober since 2015. \u0026#34;Nowadays, there\u0026#39;s a lot of kids running, laughing and throwing water balloons.\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"marker\"\u003eBilly is the water culprit who surprise attacks with a hose when his father comes home from work.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"marker\"\u003e\u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m so tired and he\u0026#39;s just waiting behind the bush with a hose,\u0026#34; says Stamos. \u0026#34;The joy he gets out of spraying his poor dad. I just love it. That\u0026#39;s summer to me.\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis interview has been edited for length and clarity.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

