body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "2017810002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAfter only eight months of marriage, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/10/11/billy-ray-cyrus-firerose-wedding-tish-cyrus-miley-cyrus/71146103007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eBilly Ray Cyrus\u003c/a\u003e and wife \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/10/26/billy-ray-cyrus-dog-introduced-him-to-firerose/71333648007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eFirerose\u003c/a\u003e are heading their separate ways.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe country singer and father of popstar \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/03/miley-cyrus-talks-friendship-beyonce-writing-ii-most-wanted-cowboy-carter/73957724007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMiley Cyrus\u003c/a\u003e filed for divorce from Firerose (real name: Johanna Rosie Hodges) on May 23, according to an online search of the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://williamson.tncrtinfo.com/Default.aspx\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eWilliamson County court system\u003c/a\u003e. Cyrus cited irreconcilable differences and inappropriate marital conduct as the primary reasons for the split, according to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://people.com/billy-ray-cyrus-files-for-divorce-from-firerose-alleges-inappropriate-marital-conduct-8661668\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePeople magazine\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.etonline.com/billy-ray-cyrus-files-for-divorce-from-wife-firerose-citing-inappropriate-marital-conduct-227142\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eEntertainment Tonight\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to representatives for Cyrus for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe couple, who \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/10/11/billy-ray-cyrus-firerose-wedding-tish-cyrus-miley-cyrus/71146103007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003etied the knot in October 2023\u003c/a\u003e, separated on May 22, per People and ET. Despite their recent nuptials, Cyrus stated that \u0026#34;consent to (the) marriage was obtained by fraud\u0026#34; in his divorce filing.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72089387007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;Ethereal celebration\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/10/11/billy-ray-cyrus-firerose-wedding-tish-cyrus-miley-cyrus/71146103007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eBilly Ray Cyrus, Tish Cyrus\u0026#39; ex-husband, marries singer Firerose\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe Grammy-winning singer will be required to provide spousal support to Firerose amid their divorce, according to ET. Cyrus will pay his estranged wife, who was required to leave Cyrus\u0026#39; residence following their separation, $500 per night for 10 nights to cover the costs of temporary lodging as she searches for a new home.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, Cyrus will pay the Australian singer $5,000 per month to \u0026#34;obtain suitable housing in the middle Tennessee area for 90 days or the dissolution of the marriage,\u0026#34; per ET.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBefore his relationship with Firerose, Cyrus was married to manager and producer Tish Cyrus from 1993 until April 2022 \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2022/04/11/billy-ray-cyrus-wife-tish-cyrus-file-divorce/7276538001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewhen the couple filed for divorce\u003c/a\u003e, citing irreconcilable differences. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCyrus and Tish have five children together: Brandi Trace, Miley, Braison and Noah. Billy Ray adopted Brandi and Trace, who are Tish\u0026#39;s children from a previous relationship.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eBilly Ray Cyrus and Firerose: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/10/26/billy-ray-cyrus-dog-introduced-him-to-firerose/71333648007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eCountry singer\u0026#39;s estranged wife credits his dog for introducing them on \u0026#39;Hannah Montana\u0026#39; set\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe “Achy Breaky Heart” singer isn’t the only Cyrus to take a trip down the aisle. Tish Cyrus \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/08/27/tish-cyrus-dominic-purcell-wedding-photos-miley-cyrus/70696013007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003emarried “Prison Break” actor Dominic Purcell\u003c/a\u003e in a small poolside ceremony at daughter Miley’s Malibu home in August 2023.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eBilly Ray Cyrus marries Firerose in \u0026#39;ethereal celebration\u0026#39;\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCyrus married Firerose on Oct. 10, 2023. The following day, the newlywed couple \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CyQ_2UKrbru/?hl\u003den\u0026img_index\u003d1\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eshared photos from their nuptials\u003c/a\u003e on Instagram.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn the photos, Cyrus and Firerose were seen soaking up their marital bliss in an idyllic field. Cyrus wore a classic, black-and-white tuxedo while Firerose donned a white dress that featured a semi-sheer top embroidered with white floral patterns.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "71146179007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCyrus and Firerose said in the joint post that their wedding was \u0026#34;the most perfect, ethereal celebration of love we could have ever imagined.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;10/10/23 will always be the beautiful, joyous day that our two souls united as one in holy matrimony,\u0026#34; the couple wrote. \u0026#34;For both of us to hear the preacher say, ‘Billy Ray and Firerose Cyrus… I now pronounce you husband and wife,’ that was the sacred moment our new forever began. Long Live Love! ❤️♾️\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eFirerose credits Billy Ray Cyrus\u0026#39; dog for introducing them on \u0026#39;Hannah Montana\u0026#39; set\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eDuring an October 2023 appearance on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dDUQg93g89aM\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;The Kelly Clarkson Show,\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e Firerose shared the \u0026#34;funny story\u0026#34; of how the couple met.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I was walking out of an audition ... in Hollywood, and Billy\u0026#39;s dog at the time, Tex, who was the most beautiful German shepherd you\u0026#39;ve ever seen, he was tapped into some divine purpose,\u0026#34; Firerose told host \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/06/09/kelly-clarkson-american-idol-katy-perry-replacement/74038943007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKelly Clarkson\u003c/a\u003e. \u0026#34;That was, like, 14 years ago so all these years later we just got married!\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAt the time, Billy Ray was filming \u0026#34;Hannah Montana\u0026#34; at Sunset Bronson studios with daughter Miley Cyrus and was taking a break with Tex when he encountered Firerose, according to a 2022 interview the couple did with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://people.com/country/billy-ray-cyrus-engaged-firerose-soulmate-happy-pure-love/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePeople magazine\u003c/a\u003e. He offered to take her onto the set and introduce her to the Disney Channel show\u0026#39;s producers.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74063331007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Don\u0026#39;t ever take a strange man up on this offer, but, in this case, Tex will testify that you will be totally safe,\u0026#34; Cyrus recalled saying at the time. \u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m going to introduce you to a producer and you can kind of make yourself at home and watch us rehearse and you know, maybe it might lead to a role or just another contact at Disney.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThey kept a \u0026#34;solid\u0026#34; friendship over the years, Firerose told People.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAfter \u0026#34;a lot of prayer\u0026#34; following his divorce from ex-wife Tish Cyrus, Cyrus asked Firerose whether they could be more than friends. They started as \u0026#34;musical soulmates,\u0026#34; which evolved into \u0026#34;happy, pure, love that to me, I didn\u0026#39;t know could exist.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCyrus and Firerose have collaborated on various singles, including \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dQOmrL-78rhw\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e“New Day,”\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003d-DgYpYrdWo8\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e“Time”\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dBvud1_q3OCA\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e“Plans.”\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: KiMi Robinson, USA TODAY\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
