  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe group referenced its own investigation, in which it claims it found evidence of cruelty and suffering on dozens of RSPCA-assured farms in the United Kingdom. RSPCA is a charity that promotes animal welfare and runs an \u0026#34;RSPCA Assured scheme\u0026#34; that assesses and confirms animal welfare standards on farms are being met. Charles, 75, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.rspca.org.uk/whatwedo/whoweare/royalpatron\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eserves as its royal patron\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74075444007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/tv/columnist/2015/09/24/review-blood-and-oil-could-spark-interest/72648184/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eChace Crawford\u003c/a\u003e is revealing how life started started imitating art during his \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/people/2012/12/18/gossip-girl-revealed-in-series-finale/1777219/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eGossip Girl\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; days in the mid-2000s to the early 2010s.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn Wednesday\u0026#39;s \u003ca href\u003d\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/7dEcNffeNMSjLK8tPYRkoR?si\u003dvL0O_KRaTUumX6MZH_QLkg\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Call Her Daddy\u0026#34; episode\u003c/a\u003e, the Lubbock, Texas-born actor, 37, reminisced about how he started morphing into Upper East Side high schooler Nate Archibald – whom he portrayed on The CW show from 2007-2012 – while living and filming in New York City.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCrawford told host \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/sports/media/2024/04/03/alex-cooper-call-her-daddy-podcast-nbc-2024-olympics-peacock/73195581007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eAlex Cooper\u003c/a\u003e that he and on-screen best friend \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/tv/2018/07/27/gossip-girl-star-ed-westwick-wont-charged-over-rape-allegations/853775002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eEd Westwick\u003c/a\u003e, aka blue blood bad boy Chuck Bass, lived together in \u0026#34;this little apartment\u0026#34; around 10th Avenue and 26th Street in the Chelsea neighborhood during their \u0026#34;Gossip Girl\u0026#34; days. They shared a junior one-bedroom, in which he lived in the main bedroom while Westwick took the extra space, which wasn\u0026#39;t quite a full room.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe jokingly called his friend out for being a messy roommate and having \u0026#34;a lunch pail with overflowing cigarettes.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eChace Crawford and Ed Westwick were roommates, threw parties on their rooftop\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "7913692002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;You (would have) thought the Joker lived there; it was insane. I\u0026#39;m not even kidding,\u0026#34; Crawford said, noting that Westwick was 18 or 19 while he was 21 years old at the time. \u0026#34;I shouldn\u0026#39;t be calling him out like this, but I love him to death.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;We had an absolute blast in that place. We had a rooftop deck,\u0026#34; Crawford added. \u0026#34;He\u0026#39;d invite a bunch of people; we\u0026#39;d bring a Bose speaker and a big bottle of vodka and just have a party up there all the time. ... We\u0026#39;d bring good friends. But then sometimes it\u0026#39;d get really out of hand.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eSome of the guests they\u0026#39;d hosted included Lindsay Lohan and their neighbor Alex Pall, who went on to form The Chainsmokers with Drew Taggart, he said. And though he recalled that they\u0026#39;d \u0026#34;raged up there,\u0026#34; the parties never got shut down.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCooper asked whether these gatherings were like the parties their on-screen personas would throw. \u0026#34;Not much except the money involved,\u0026#34; he said.  \u0026#34;We didn\u0026#39;t put much money behind ours. We weren\u0026#39;t making quite that. ... They did turn out to be pretty fun, well known-parties.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eWhen the teen drama series ended in 2012, \u0026#34;I was ready for it to be done,\u0026#34; Crawford revealed. Westwick, he recalled, said \u0026#34;Gossip Girl\u0026#34; was \u0026#34;the greatest job we\u0026#39;ll ever have.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It was easy and it was fun,\u0026#34; Crawford said. Since \u0026#34;Gossip Girl,\u0026#34; he\u0026#39;s maintained a consistent career in film and TV and has starred on Amazon Prime Video\u0026#39;s popular series \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/06/11/the-boys-season-4/74057851007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Boys\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; since 2019.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;The Boys\u0026#39; Season 4 is coming: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/06/11/the-boys-season-4/74057851007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ePremiere date, cast, trailer, how to watch and stream\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eChace Crawford responds to whether he hooked up with a \u0026#39;Gossip Girl\u0026#39; co-star \u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCrawford also spilled on whether he had an on-set romance with any of his \u0026#34;Gossip Girl\u0026#34; coworkers. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I would say those things are inevitable,\u0026#34; he seemingly confirmed when Cooper asked whether he\u0026#39;d hooked up with a co-star.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;People probably think it\u0026#39;s, like, these sexy scenes or whatever and that\u0026#39;s the worst part of it. It\u0026#39;s, like, 60 people watching,\u0026#34; he said of filming romantic scenes for a TV series. \u0026#34;You\u0026#39;re on set for, like 12-14 hours a day. And usually there\u0026#39;s some pretty interesting people from all walks of life.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJoin our Watch Party! \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003e Sign up to receive USA TODAY\u0026#39;s movie and TV recommendations\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "7913406002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCrawford revealed that things get difficult if he has a genuine interest in someone he works with on set.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The danger is if you connect right away with sense of humor, at least for me. If you have a rapport and can kind of, like, banter ... For me, I\u0026#39;m like, oh I\u0026#39;ve got to watch out.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHowever, he tried to steer Cooper and her audience from believing it was a \u0026#34;Gossip Girl\u0026#34; colleague with whom he\u0026#39;d gotten involved off-set.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I\u0026#39;ve done other shows and stuff,\u0026#34; he said.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eChace Crawford says he\u0026#39;d star in \u0026#39;The Boys\u0026#39; for \u0026#39;another 10 years\u0026#39;\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn other interviews promoting Season 4 of \u0026#34;The Boys,\u0026#34; Crawford — who plays The Deep — revealed he loves playing the aquatic superhero with useless powers.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I might be the only one who would do this show for another 10 years,\u0026#34; the actor told \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.wmagazine.com/culture/chace-crawford-the-boys-season-four-theories-interview\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eW Magazine\u003c/a\u003e in an interview published Wednesday. \u0026#34;I love the character so much, but (showrunner Eric) Kripke knows best.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe continued: \u0026#34;It\u0026#39;s tough to know when to stick the landing in TV and you don’t want to overcook the storylines. It definitely will be sad. It’s been one of the greatest rides of my life, but I’m looking forward to going out with a bang.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;The Boys\u0026#39; Season 4:  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/06/11/the-boys-season-4/74057851007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ePremiere date, cast, trailer, how to watch and stream\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCrawford jumped at the chance to play the character, telling \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.newsweek.com/2024/06/28/chace-crawford-absurdly-shatters-pretty-boy-image-boys-1910906.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eNewsweek\u003c/a\u003e in an interview published Wednesday that it\u0026#39;s a departure from his pretty boy image, as with \u0026#34;Gossip Girl.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;These types of roles don\u0026#39;t come around a lot,\u0026#34; he told the outlet. \u0026#34;Also, I think you have to have a sense of humor about yourself. To be like, \u0026#39;Yeah, let\u0026#39;s make fun of that guy.\u0026#39;\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eKripke announced on social media Tuesday that \u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/therealKripke/status/1800543513735471143\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eSeason 5 of \u0026#34;The Boys\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e will be its last.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe first three episodes of Season 4 of \u0026#34;The Boys\u0026#34; premiered June 13 on Prime Video, with new episodes weekly. The season finale will stream on Thursday, July 18.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Taijuan Moorman and Emily DeLetter\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74075444007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/tv/columnist/2015/09/24/review-blood-and-oil-could-spark-interest/72648184/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eChace Crawford\u003c/a\u003e is revealing how life started started imitating art during his \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/people/2012/12/18/gossip-girl-revealed-in-series-finale/1777219/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eGossip Girl\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; days in the mid-2000s to the early 2010s.\u003c/p\u003e"
