body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74091320007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIt’s been a great ride, but \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/books/2023/09/12/peloton-cody-rigsby-book-xoxo-dwts-interview/70770772007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePeloton\u003c/a\u003e instructor Kendall Toole is pedaling off to her next chapter.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eToole revealed her departure from the fitness brand in an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/C8J3vjAunke/?utm_source\u003dig_embed\u0026ig_rid\u003ddf10ec83-63b6-4e9c-a608-6b6b44c6107a\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eemotional Instagram video\u003c/a\u003e on Thursday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It’s with great consideration and many, many, many hours of reflection, but I’m choosing to close my chapter at Peloton,\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026#34; \u003c/strong\u003eToole said. \u0026#34;Thank you, Peloton, for this incredible, life-changing opportunity. I will forever be grateful for this life experience and transformation and personal growth that this has been for me.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe 31-year-old did not disclose the reason for her exit in the video, but she reassured her followers that she wouldn’t be leaving the public eye.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Before we get too emotional, I don’t want you to think I’m saying goodbye,” Toole said. “I’m not, this is just a shift. I’ll be continuing to check in on social media and far beyond. This is more of a ‘I’ll see you on the next chapter’ kind of an energy.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShe added: \u0026#34;Stay tuned for what’s next, and I will see you in the next adventure.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74092094007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to a representative for Toole for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eToole alluded to her departure from Peloton in a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7xjHUeJY41/?img_index\u003d1\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJune 3 Instagram post\u003c/a\u003e. “Shedding a skin and removing an armour that no longer serves; you’re raw for a while,” she wrote at the time. “But, don’t ever forget: tender is transformed. A new thing. The next level. Uncharted waters (and) uninked pages.”\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eToole has previously worked as an actress, according to the fitness personality’s \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm1587428/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eIMDb page\u003c/a\u003e. She appeared in the short films “Petunia” and “Little Canyon,” as well as a three-episode stint on the 2012 musical comedy “Frat House Musical.”\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73930374007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;Self-deprecation is my motto\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/books/2023/09/12/peloton-cody-rigsby-book-xoxo-dwts-interview/70770772007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eThe key to Peloton instructor Cody Rigsby\u0026#39;s success\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eKendall Toole thanks Peloton fans for ‘letting me into your homes’\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eToole – who has a background in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.onepeloton.com/instructors/kmoneyNYC\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003echeerleading, gymnastics, dance and boxing\u003c/a\u003e – got her start at Peloton as a cycling instructor, according to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.onepeloton.com/blog/kendall-toole-tunde-oyeneyin-peloton-instructors/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eofficial Peloton website\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;To the community who have become my friends and family and have stayed in the fight with me, I cannot thank you enough,” Toole said in her Instagram video Thursday. “It’s been an absolute honor, especially to every single one of you Knockouts and NKO crew members for all of the fun and craziness and joy.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eCelebs talk Peloton: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/01/05/christopher-nolan-peloton-instructor-tenet-review/72119486007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eChristopher Nolan addresses Peloton instructor\u0026#39;s harsh \u0026#39;Tenet\u0026#39; review at Golden Globes\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe former Peloton instructor also thanked her fans for their support and “letting me into your homes, into your hearts, and in many times — I hope — into the shadowy parts of your mind where sometimes things can get a little tough.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Thank you for riding with me, for sweating with me, for crying with me, for growing and evolving with me and every single way we’ve committed to showing up for ourselves so that we can show up for those around us in our life,” Toole continued. \u0026#34;That kind of commitment to ourselves is truly spectacular.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74091320007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIt’s been a great ride, but \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/books/2023/09/12/peloton-cody-rigsby-book-xoxo-dwts-interview/70770772007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePeloton\u003c/a\u003e instructor Kendall Toole is pedaling off to her next chapter.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eToole revealed her departure from the fitness brand in an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/C8J3vjAunke/?utm_source\u003dig_embed\u0026ig_rid\u003ddf10ec83-63b6-4e9c-a608-6b6b44c6107a\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eemotional Instagram video\u003c/a\u003e on Thursday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It’s with great consideration and many, many, many hours of reflection, but I’m choosing to close my chapter at Peloton,\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026#34; \u003c/strong\u003eToole said. \u0026#34;Thank you, Peloton, for this incredible, life-changing opportunity. I will forever be grateful for this life experience and transformation and personal growth that this has been for me.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe 31-year-old did not disclose the reason for her exit in the video, but she reassured her followers that she wouldn’t be leaving the public eye.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Before we get too emotional, I don’t want you to think I’m saying goodbye,” Toole said. “I’m not, this is just a shift. I’ll be continuing to check in on social media and far beyond. This is more of a ‘I’ll see you on the next chapter’ kind of an energy.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShe added: \u0026#34;Stay tuned for what’s next, and I will see you in the next adventure.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74092094007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to a representative for Toole for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eToole alluded to her departure from Peloton in a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7xjHUeJY41/?img_index\u003d1\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJune 3 Instagram post\u003c/a\u003e. “Shedding a skin and removing an armour that no longer serves; you’re raw for a while,” she wrote at the time. “But, don’t ever forget: tender is transformed. A new thing. The next level. Uncharted waters (and) uninked pages.”\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eToole has previously worked as an actress, according to the fitness personality’s \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm1587428/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eIMDb page\u003c/a\u003e. She appeared in the short films “Petunia” and “Little Canyon,” as well as a three-episode stint on the 2012 musical comedy “Frat House Musical.”\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73930374007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;Self-deprecation is my motto\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/books/2023/09/12/peloton-cody-rigsby-book-xoxo-dwts-interview/70770772007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eThe key to Peloton instructor Cody Rigsby\u0026#39;s success\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eKendall Toole thanks Peloton fans for ‘letting me into your homes’\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eToole – who has a background in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.onepeloton.com/instructors/kmoneyNYC\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003echeerleading, gymnastics, dance and boxing\u003c/a\u003e – got her start at Peloton as a cycling instructor, according to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.onepeloton.com/blog/kendall-toole-tunde-oyeneyin-peloton-instructors/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eofficial Peloton website\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;To the community who have become my friends and family and have stayed in the fight with me, I cannot thank you enough,” Toole said in her Instagram video Thursday. “It’s been an absolute honor, especially to every single one of you Knockouts and NKO crew members for all of the fun and craziness and joy.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eCelebs talk Peloton: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/01/05/christopher-nolan-peloton-instructor-tenet-review/72119486007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eChristopher Nolan addresses Peloton instructor\u0026#39;s harsh \u0026#39;Tenet\u0026#39; review at Golden Globes\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe former Peloton instructor also thanked her fans for their support and “letting me into your homes, into your hearts, and in many times — I hope — into the shadowy parts of your mind where sometimes things can get a little tough.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Thank you for riding with me, for sweating with me, for crying with me, for growing and evolving with me and every single way we’ve committed to showing up for ourselves so that we can show up for those around us in our life,” Toole continued. \u0026#34;That kind of commitment to ourselves is truly spectacular.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

