body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74136504007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/01/26/justin-timberlake-the-forget-tomorrow-world-tour-dates-tickets/72360902007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJustin Timberlake\u003c/a\u003e has reportedly been arrested on suspected DWI charges.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u0026#34;Selfish\u0026#34; singer was apprehended by police for driving while intoxicated in the Hamptons on Monday night, Sag Harbor Village Police Department told \u003ca href\u003d\"https://abcnews.go.com/GMA/Culture/justin-timberlake-arrested-dwi-hamptons-source/story?id\u003d111211530\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eABC News\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.newsday.com/long-island/crime/timberlake-singer-arrested-sag-harbor-east-end-n35em7xa\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eNewsday\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eA representative for Sag County Justice Court confirmed to USA TODAY that he will be arraigned Tuesday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to the Sag Harbor Village Police Department and reps for Timberlake.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72505299007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHis arrest comes ahead of two concerts on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/01/26/justin-timberlake-the-forget-tomorrow-world-tour-dates-tickets/72360902007/\"\u003eThe Forget Tomorrow World Tour\u003c/a\u003e in Chicago on Friday and Saturday. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u0026#34;Mirrors\u0026#34; singer, actor and former member of the boyband \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/14/nsync-reunion-justin-timberlake-concert-paradise-bye-bye-bye/72968225007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eNSYNC\u003c/a\u003e announced the tour in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/01/26/justin-timberlake-the-forget-tomorrow-world-tour-dates-tickets/72360902007/\"\u003eJanuary\u003c/a\u003e, his first in five years. The North American leg of the tour kicked off in April at Rogers Arena in Vancouver, Canada, with stops including cities in the U.S., Canada, Europe and the U.K.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eTimberlake\u0026#39;s return to the stage follows the release of his sixth album, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/01/25/justin-timberlake-album-date-selfish-music-video-watch/72351428007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Everything I Thought It Was\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "71832774007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I worked for a long time on this album and I ended up with 100 songs,\u0026#34; he told Zane Lowe for \u003ca href\u003d\"https://music.apple.com/us/curator/the-zane-lowe-show/990050553\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eApple Music 1\u003c/a\u003e in January. \u0026#34;So narrowing them down to 18 was a thing, and then, yeah, I’m really excited about this album. I think every artist probably says this, but it is my best work.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe added: \u0026#34;There are moments that are incredibly honest, but also, there’s a lot of fun on this album. … Some of the songs are more introspective and some of them are more what I think people know me for.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eTimberlake also \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/07/justin-timberlake-free-concert-wiltern-tickets/72877181007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eperformed several free shows\u003c/a\u003e, including a stop in his hometown of Memphis, New York City and Los Angeles. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "3140670002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe Los Angeles show in March included a surprise performance of his song \u0026#34;Paradise,\u0026#34; which features his NSYNC bandmates.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@kylehanagami/video/7346100462975847711?q\u003dnsync\u0026t\u003d1710410706719\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eVideos on social media\u003c/a\u003e showed Timberlake standing as the curtain behind him slowly revealed \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/07/25/britney-spears-lance-bass-twins-photos/70460965007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLance Bass\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2019/11/12/dancing-stars-joey-fatone-explains-wardrobe-malfunction/2583443001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJoey Fatone\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/music/2019/04/05/lou-pearlman-film-reveals-how-backstreet-boys-n-sync-lost-millions/3373395002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eChris Kirkpatrick\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/entertainthis/2016/08/09/nsync-reunites-jc-chasezs-40th-birthday/88446928/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJC Chasez\u003c/a\u003e. The crowd instantly went wild, screaming louder than the group as they began singing.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe group performed \u0026#34;Paradise\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;Bye Bye Bye\u0026#34; together, bridging their new music with their classic hit. The night marked their first performance with all five band members since their reunion at the 2013 VMAs.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Jay Stahl\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74136504007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/01/26/justin-timberlake-the-forget-tomorrow-world-tour-dates-tickets/72360902007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJustin Timberlake\u003c/a\u003e has reportedly been arrested on suspected DWI charges.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u0026#34;Selfish\u0026#34; singer was apprehended by police for driving while intoxicated in the Hamptons on Monday night, Sag Harbor Village Police Department told \u003ca href\u003d\"https://abcnews.go.com/GMA/Culture/justin-timberlake-arrested-dwi-hamptons-source/story?id\u003d111211530\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eABC News\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.newsday.com/long-island/crime/timberlake-singer-arrested-sag-harbor-east-end-n35em7xa\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eNewsday\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eA representative for Sag County Justice Court confirmed to USA TODAY that he will be arraigned Tuesday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to the Sag Harbor Village Police Department and reps for Timberlake.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72505299007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHis arrest comes ahead of two concerts on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/01/26/justin-timberlake-the-forget-tomorrow-world-tour-dates-tickets/72360902007/\"\u003eThe Forget Tomorrow World Tour\u003c/a\u003e in Chicago on Friday and Saturday. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u0026#34;Mirrors\u0026#34; singer, actor and former member of the boyband \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/14/nsync-reunion-justin-timberlake-concert-paradise-bye-bye-bye/72968225007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eNSYNC\u003c/a\u003e announced the tour in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/01/26/justin-timberlake-the-forget-tomorrow-world-tour-dates-tickets/72360902007/\"\u003eJanuary\u003c/a\u003e, his first in five years. The North American leg of the tour kicked off in April at Rogers Arena in Vancouver, Canada, with stops including cities in the U.S., Canada, Europe and the U.K.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eTimberlake\u0026#39;s return to the stage follows the release of his sixth album, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/01/25/justin-timberlake-album-date-selfish-music-video-watch/72351428007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Everything I Thought It Was\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "71832774007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I worked for a long time on this album and I ended up with 100 songs,\u0026#34; he told Zane Lowe for \u003ca href\u003d\"https://music.apple.com/us/curator/the-zane-lowe-show/990050553\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eApple Music 1\u003c/a\u003e in January. \u0026#34;So narrowing them down to 18 was a thing, and then, yeah, I’m really excited about this album. I think every artist probably says this, but it is my best work.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe added: \u0026#34;There are moments that are incredibly honest, but also, there’s a lot of fun on this album. … Some of the songs are more introspective and some of them are more what I think people know me for.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eTimberlake also \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/07/justin-timberlake-free-concert-wiltern-tickets/72877181007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eperformed several free shows\u003c/a\u003e, including a stop in his hometown of Memphis, New York City and Los Angeles. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "3140670002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe Los Angeles show in March included a surprise performance of his song \u0026#34;Paradise,\u0026#34; which features his NSYNC bandmates.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@kylehanagami/video/7346100462975847711?q\u003dnsync\u0026t\u003d1710410706719\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eVideos on social media\u003c/a\u003e showed Timberlake standing as the curtain behind him slowly revealed \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/07/25/britney-spears-lance-bass-twins-photos/70460965007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLance Bass\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2019/11/12/dancing-stars-joey-fatone-explains-wardrobe-malfunction/2583443001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJoey Fatone\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/music/2019/04/05/lou-pearlman-film-reveals-how-backstreet-boys-n-sync-lost-millions/3373395002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eChris Kirkpatrick\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/entertainthis/2016/08/09/nsync-reunites-jc-chasezs-40th-birthday/88446928/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJC Chasez\u003c/a\u003e. The crowd instantly went wild, screaming louder than the group as they began singing.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe group performed \u0026#34;Paradise\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;Bye Bye Bye\u0026#34; together, bridging their new music with their classic hit. The night marked their first performance with all five band members since their reunion at the 2013 VMAs.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Jay Stahl\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

