  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/01/26/justin-timberlake-the-forget-tomorrow-world-tour-dates-tickets/72360902007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJustin Timberlake\u003c/a\u003e has been arrested on suspicion of driving while intoxicated.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
