      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I come home, chug a bunch of water, take two Advil liquid gels and I have a greasy little meal before I go to bed and then I wake up perfectly fine,\u0026#34; she says. \u0026#34;If I don\u0026#39;t, then I order pho and spring rolls.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74042351007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eShay Mitchell accepts traveling with children is \u0026#39;not going to be relaxing,\u0026#39; and that\u0026#39;s OK\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMitchell and partner \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2022/02/07/shay-mitchell-matte-babel-expecting-second-baby/6698827001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMatte Babel\u003c/a\u003e share daughters Atlas, 4, and Rome, 2. As summer break approaches, she has plans to visit her parents in Vancouver.\u003c/p\u003e"
