    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFor parents traveling with young children, Mitchell says, \u0026#34;don\u0026#39;t stress out if your child is having a little fit\u0026#34; or \u0026#34;get down on yourself if they\u0026#39;re not being quiet.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74016170007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;That was something that as a new mom … I was always freaking out like, \u0026#39;Don\u0026#39;t make noise.\u0026#39; And now I\u0026#39;m like, \u0026#39;Sorry, they are kids.\u0026#39; I\u0026#39;m going to do my best, and they\u0026#39;re not kicking seats by any means, but you do what you can.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;When we were shooting \u0026#39;Thirst,\u0026#39; Rome was only 5 months old, and that was really difficult because we were gone for a month,\u0026#34; she says. But something that I heard that really stuck with me is \u0026#39;It\u0026#39;s my first time living, too.\u0026#39; These are things that I have always wanted to do. … This is my passion. I know that when I came home, they could tell that I was excited about it.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
