    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I have (the) Mary Poppins of travel bags,\u0026#34; Mitchell says, noting she keeps all the \u0026#34;essentials\u0026#34; from medicine to Maldon salt for a little extra seasoning to airplane food.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74076933007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It\u0026#39;s the best salt,\u0026#34; she adds, pausing to search for the correct spelling.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShay\u0026#39;s airplane essentials include: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMedicine.\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eMakeup.\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eFace mist. \u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eHand cream (\u0026#34;I don\u0026#39;t like that feeling when your hands get dry in the airplane.\u0026#34;).\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eExtra socks.\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eNeck pillow.\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eSleep eye mask (\u0026#34;That\u0026#39;s a necessity.\u0026#34;).\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eEarplugs.\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eMaldon salt.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74042354007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eDuring her downtime, Shay Mitchell is watching \u0026#39;Is It Cake?\u0026#39;\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I love \u0026#39;Is It Cake?\u0026#39; I swear I think I get it right like 80% of the time. I wish there was an app (connected to the show) and you can make friendly bets. I think I\u0026#39;d be in the top 10 because I\u0026#39;m pretty good at sussing it out. I love that show,\u0026#34; she says with passion.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u0026#34;Thirst\u0026#34; star also loves watching reruns of \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2021/06/12/anthony-bourdain-documentary-roadrunner-explores-his-life-death/7629875002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eAnthony Bourdain\u003c/a\u003e: No Reservations\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/health-wellness/2022/01/14/sex-and-city-reboot-and-just-like-that-mistakes-one-thing-spot-on/6525912001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eSex and the City\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eRecently, she finished \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/03/07/theo-james-talks-the-gentlemen-netflix/72395548007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Gentleman\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026#34; \u0026#34;So good … the show, not Theo (James). I\u0026#39;m not just saying he was good, I\u0026#39;m just … It was good,\u0026#34; Mitchell says jokingly of the Netflix series. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m trying to read a lot more. I have my little \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TMN58KL?tag\u003dusattrending-20\"\u003eKindle\u003c/a\u003e. I just finished \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.amazon.com/Starts-Us-Novel-Ends/dp/1668001225/ref\u003dtmm_pap_swatch_0?_encoding\u003dUTF8\u0026qid\u003d\u0026sr\u003d\u0026tag\u003dusattrending-20\"\u003e\u0026#39;It Starts With Us.\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e That took me a very long time, but now being a mom with two kids and doing quite a bit of traveling, it\u0026#39;s hard finding that time to read. I\u0026#39;m going to pick up \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.amazon.com/Seven-Husbands-Evelyn-Hugo-Novel/dp/1501139231/?tag\u003dusattrending-20\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#39;The Seven Husbands of Evelyn Hugo.\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e And then every once in a while I\u0026#39;ll read one of my older books like \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.amazon.com/Mastery-Love-Practical-Relationship-Toltec/dp/1878424424/?tag\u003dusattrending-20\"\u003e\u0026#39;Mastering of Love,\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e which is my favorite. I\u0026#39;ve probably read it 10 times.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73930374007"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "71967673007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJoin our Watch Party! \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSign up to receive USA TODAY\u0026#39;s movie and TV recommendations right in your inbox\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eShe celebrates her life \u0026#39;no matter how mundane\u0026#39; the day is\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;In the morning and at night I go through all the things that I feel grateful for. People could roll their eyes, but I really do,\u0026#34; the \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2023/02/09/how-you-season-4-compares-to-gossip-girl-penn-badgley/11211337002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eYou\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; actress says, adding her days are special \u0026#34;no matter how mundane\u0026#34; it is because it means \u0026#34;nothing bad happened.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Even with birthdays and getting older, people are like, \u0026#39;Are you scared of coming close to 40?\u0026#39; Absolutely not. How fortunate am I to be able to hit 40? I\u0026#39;m really excited for what\u0026#39;s to come,\u0026#34; Mitchell adds.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHer grandmother Romaine, who died in 2022, was instrumental in her positive outlook on life. \u0026#34;She\u0026#39;s with me at all times and I think that\u0026#39;s also been something that has given me a little bit more confidence. …  I just think (about) what she would tell me if she was here and she\u0026#39;d always say, \u0026#39;OK, I\u0026#39;m going to say a little prayer for you.\u0026#39;\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis interview has been edited for length and clarity.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

contentBody:
{
  "contentBody": [{
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74076934007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eIn a new weekly series, \u003cstrong\u003eUSA TODAY’s The Essentials\u003c/strong\u003e, celebrities share what fuels their lives.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/parenting/2019/10/22/shay-mitchell-details-her-labor-delivery-first-baby-pitocin-doula/4061297002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eShay Mitchell\u003c/a\u003e is blending travel and alcohol to make the ultimate cocktail: her show \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://max.prf.hn/click/camref:1101lvDdV/pubref:UST-STM/destination:https://www.max.com/shows/thirst-with-shay-mitchell/b06c5626-7574-434f-8bb2-203a4e7ced94\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThirst\u003c/a\u003e with Shay Mitchell.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe actress already cemented herself in both industries with her \u003ca href\u003d\"https://bistravel.pxf.io/c/50053/1148735/14511?subId1\u003dUST-TRV\u0026u\u003dhttps%3A%2F%2Fbeistravel.com%2F\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eBéis\u003c/a\u003e travel accessories company and tequila brand \u003ca href\u003d\"https://drinkonda.com/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eOnda\u003c/a\u003e, and she\u0026#39;s taking it a step further with a show focused on trying different beverages around the world.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It\u0026#39;s combining both of my loves of traveling and drinking, and not even just drinking alcohol, but consuming beverages, learning more about a culture, the history (and) the people that live there through the lens of the beverages,\u0026#34; Mitchell says of her new \u003ca href\u003d\"https://max.prf.hn/click/camref:1101lvDdV/pubref:UST-STM/destination:https://www.max.com/shows/thirst-with-shay-mitchell/b06c5626-7574-434f-8bb2-203a4e7ced94\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMax four-episode series\u003c/a\u003e, which premiered May 23.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eWhile fans were obsessing over her character Emily Fields on \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/tv/2017/06/26/pretty-little-liars-finale-why-im-tuning-back-in/103118572/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePretty Little Liars\u003c/a\u003e,\u0026#34; she was using the breaks from filming to jet set. \u0026#34;When I was on a TV show in my 20s, every time we\u0026#39;d go on hiatus I would be taking off to a different place,\u0026#34; she says, modestly referring to her time on the ABC Family (now Freeform) hit from 2010 to 2017.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eNow, as a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2022/02/07/shay-mitchell-matte-babel-expecting-second-baby/6698827001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003emom-of-two\u003c/a\u003e, world exploration looks different for the 37-year-old actress.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003ePurchases you make through our links may earn us and our publishing partners a commission.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74016169007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eShay Mitchell\u0026#39;s \u0026#39;Thirst\u0026#39; is for a spicy skinny margarita\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eMitchell just launched a reposado of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://drinkonda.com/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eOnda\u003c/a\u003e, perfect for her go-to cocktail: \u0026#34;A spicy skinny margarita … Extra spicy.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eShe also expanded her beverage palette filming \u0026#34;Thirst.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Cachaça (was my favorite spirit) and that was from Brazil, and I loved it. I learned it\u0026#39;s one of the top five spirits there is and yet 99% of it is bought within Brazil itself, which is kind of crazy.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74016171007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eTraditional Peruvian drink emolienteit surprised her the most. \u0026#34;It\u0026#39;s very fibrous because of the chia seeds that are in there and it was a lot thicker of the consistency than I expected. … Not bad by any means, just unexpected.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eShay Mitchell\u0026#39;s hangover cure \u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I come home, chug a bunch of water, take two Advil liquid gels and I have a greasy little meal before I go to bed and then I wake up perfectly fine,\u0026#34; she says. \u0026#34;If I don\u0026#39;t, then I order pho and spring rolls.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74042351007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eShay Mitchell accepts traveling with children is \u0026#39;not going to be relaxing,\u0026#39; and that\u0026#39;s OK\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eMitchell and partner \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2022/02/07/shay-mitchell-matte-babel-expecting-second-baby/6698827001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMatte Babel\u003c/a\u003e share daughters Atlas, 4, and Rome, 2. As summer break approaches, she has plans to visit her parents in Vancouver.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I bring activities. Atlas is an avid colorer and drawer so I always have her coloring stuff and her books. Rome … there really isn\u0026#39;t any sort of like tip or trick that I\u0026#39;ve learned for her. It\u0026#39;s just WWF (now WWE) the entire time, she\u0026#39;s just wrestling me. She\u0026#39;s standing. She\u0026#39;s sitting. I can\u0026#39;t even lie, the second child for me is just nonstop. I just have to know that it\u0026#39;s not going to be relaxing time and get over it,\u0026#34; she concedes.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eFor parents traveling with young children, Mitchell says, \u0026#34;don\u0026#39;t stress out if your child is having a little fit\u0026#34; or \u0026#34;get down on yourself if they\u0026#39;re not being quiet.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74016170007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;That was something that as a new mom … I was always freaking out like, \u0026#39;Don\u0026#39;t make noise.\u0026#39; And now I\u0026#39;m like, \u0026#39;Sorry, they are kids.\u0026#39; I\u0026#39;m going to do my best, and they\u0026#39;re not kicking seats by any means, but you do what you can.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;When we were shooting \u0026#39;Thirst,\u0026#39; Rome was only 5 months old, and that was really difficult because we were gone for a month,\u0026#34; she says. But something that I heard that really stuck with me is \u0026#39;It\u0026#39;s my first time living, too.\u0026#39; These are things that I have always wanted to do. … This is my passion. I know that when I came home, they could tell that I was excited about it.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74016801007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eShay Mitchell\u0026#39;s bags are like \u0026#39;Mary Poppins\u0026#39; when it comes to travel\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I have (the) Mary Poppins of travel bags,\u0026#34; Mitchell says, noting she keeps all the \u0026#34;essentials\u0026#34; from medicine to Maldon salt for a little extra seasoning to airplane food.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74076933007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It\u0026#39;s the best salt,\u0026#34; she adds, pausing to search for the correct spelling.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eShay\u0026#39;s airplane essentials include: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMedicine.\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eMakeup.\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eFace mist. \u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eHand cream (\u0026#34;I don\u0026#39;t like that feeling when your hands get dry in the airplane.\u0026#34;).\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eExtra socks.\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eNeck pillow.\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eSleep eye mask (\u0026#34;That\u0026#39;s a necessity.\u0026#34;).\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eEarplugs.\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eMaldon salt.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74042354007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eDuring her downtime, Shay Mitchell is watching \u0026#39;Is It Cake?\u0026#39;\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I love \u0026#39;Is It Cake?\u0026#39; I swear I think I get it right like 80% of the time. I wish there was an app (connected to the show) and you can make friendly bets. I think I\u0026#39;d be in the top 10 because I\u0026#39;m pretty good at sussing it out. I love that show,\u0026#34; she says with passion.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u0026#34;Thirst\u0026#34; star also loves watching reruns of \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2021/06/12/anthony-bourdain-documentary-roadrunner-explores-his-life-death/7629875002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eAnthony Bourdain\u003c/a\u003e: No Reservations\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/health-wellness/2022/01/14/sex-and-city-reboot-and-just-like-that-mistakes-one-thing-spot-on/6525912001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eSex and the City\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eRecently, she finished \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/03/07/theo-james-talks-the-gentlemen-netflix/72395548007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Gentleman\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026#34; \u0026#34;So good … the show, not Theo (James). I\u0026#39;m not just saying he was good, I\u0026#39;m just … It was good,\u0026#34; Mitchell says jokingly of the Netflix series. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m trying to read a lot more. I have my little \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TMN58KL?tag\u003dusattrending-20\"\u003eKindle\u003c/a\u003e. I just finished \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.amazon.com/Starts-Us-Novel-Ends/dp/1668001225/ref\u003dtmm_pap_swatch_0?_encoding\u003dUTF8\u0026qid\u003d\u0026sr\u003d\u0026tag\u003dusattrending-20\"\u003e\u0026#39;It Starts With Us.\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e That took me a very long time, but now being a mom with two kids and doing quite a bit of traveling, it\u0026#39;s hard finding that time to read. I\u0026#39;m going to pick up \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.amazon.com/Seven-Husbands-Evelyn-Hugo-Novel/dp/1501139231/?tag\u003dusattrending-20\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#39;The Seven Husbands of Evelyn Hugo.\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e And then every once in a while I\u0026#39;ll read one of my older books like \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.amazon.com/Mastery-Love-Practical-Relationship-Toltec/dp/1878424424/?tag\u003dusattrending-20\"\u003e\u0026#39;Mastering of Love,\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e which is my favorite. I\u0026#39;ve probably read it 10 times.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73930374007"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "71967673007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJoin our Watch Party! \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSign up to receive USA TODAY\u0026#39;s movie and TV recommendations right in your inbox\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eShe celebrates her life \u0026#39;no matter how mundane\u0026#39; the day is\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;In the morning and at night I go through all the things that I feel grateful for. People could roll their eyes, but I really do,\u0026#34; the \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2023/02/09/how-you-season-4-compares-to-gossip-girl-penn-badgley/11211337002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eYou\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; actress says, adding her days are special \u0026#34;no matter how mundane\u0026#34; it is because it means \u0026#34;nothing bad happened.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Even with birthdays and getting older, people are like, \u0026#39;Are you scared of coming close to 40?\u0026#39; Absolutely not. How fortunate am I to be able to hit 40? I\u0026#39;m really excited for what\u0026#39;s to come,\u0026#34; Mitchell adds.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eHer grandmother Romaine, who died in 2022, was instrumental in her positive outlook on life. \u0026#34;She\u0026#39;s with me at all times and I think that\u0026#39;s also been something that has given me a little bit more confidence. …  I just think (about) what she would tell me if she was here and she\u0026#39;d always say, \u0026#39;OK, I\u0026#39;m going to say a little prayer for you.\u0026#39;\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis interview has been edited for length and clarity.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "3672350002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eJayson Scott, the son of Grammy-nominated \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2023/08/11/50-cent-tour-get-rich-or-die-tryin-hip-hop-anniversary/70568062007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003erapper\u003c/a\u003e, actor and TV personality \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2019/12/04/remy-ma-charges-dropped-love-hip-hop-new-york-costar-assault/2606094001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eRemy Ma\u003c/a\u003e, has been arrested in New York on murder charges in a fatal shooting that allegedly took place three years ago.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eScott, 23, is accused of first- and second-degree murder in the death of 47-year-old Darius Guillebeaux, the New York Police Department confirmed to USA TODAY Friday. He also faces charges of reckless endangerment and criminal possession of a weapon. Another suspect was also arrested in connection with the case.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe case stems from an alleged altercation in Queens on June 7, 2021, which left Guillebeaux with multiple gunshot wounds to the head and chest, police said. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to Scott\u0026#39;s attorney for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74164729007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eA lawyer for Ma, who starred in VH1\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;Love \u0026amp; Hip Hop New York,\u0026#34; said in a statement obtained by USA TODAY on Friday that Scott was arrested on the basis of \u0026#34;very serious unfounded allegations.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Remy Ma wished to address this situation personally, but has been strongly advised by our office not to say anything publicly — as most people in this situation are, as the case is still active,\u0026#34; the statement said. \u0026#34;To be clear, Jayson Scott is innocent and Remy Ma is committed to proving his innocence and fully supporting her child during this time.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74164903007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe statement continues: \u0026#34;We stand by Jayson\u0026#39;s innocence and hope the NYPD will conduct a complete and thorough investigation to reveal the truth. This has undoubtedly been a trying time for Remy Ma and her family.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;While she sincerely appreciates the love and support she has received, we kindly ask that her privacy be respected as their legal team works to prove Jayson’s innocence.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMa received a Grammy nomination for her 2004 Terror Squad collaboration with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2023/08/11/50-cent-tour-get-rich-or-die-tryin-hip-hop-anniversary/70568062007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eFat Joe\u003c/a\u003e, \u0026#34;Lean Back.\u0026#34; The two were also nominated for their 2017 song \u0026#34;All The Way Up.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "3140670002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe New York rapper was sentenced to eight years in prison in 2008 after being found guilty of assault, weapons possession and attempted coercion for shooting and wounding an acquaintance after discovering $3,000 was missing from her purse after a night out, per \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.reuters.com/article/uk-crime-remy/rapper-remy-ma-gets-8-years-for-shooting-friend-idUKN1340878120080513/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eReuters\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHer lawyer, Ivan Fisher, called the shooting in the early hours of July 14, 2007, accidental and suggested the victim, Makeda Barnes-Joseph, was exaggerating the facts to win a large sum in a separate civil suit.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMa was released in 2014. She has another child, 5-year-old daughter Reminisce Mackenzie, with rapper Papoose.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Edith Honan, Reuters\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": " "
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "3672350002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
