body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74223683007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBill Cobbs, the prolific Daytime Emmy-winning actor who starred in 1992\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/06/04/kevin-costner-whitney-houston-the-bodyguard-eulogy/73979343007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Bodyguard\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; and the \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/2014/12/18/movie-review-night-museum-bids-farewell-robin-williams/20605367/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eNight at the Museum\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; franchise, has died.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe was 90. A cause of death was not immediately clear.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCobbs\u0026#39; longtime manager, Susan Zachary, confirmed to USA TODAY that Cobbs died Tuesday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;He was one of my first clients in each incarnation of this leg of my professional career and I am honored and proud to be his last talent representative,\u0026#34; Zachary said in a statement. \u0026#34;He was loyal and dear… an inspiring actor, director, and human. He will be sorely missed by all who knew him.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn a statement released Wednesday, his family said, \u0026#34;We are saddened to share the passing of Bill Cobbs. On Tuesday, June 25, Bill passed away peacefully at his home in California. A beloved partner, big brother, uncle, surrogate parent, godfather and friend, Bill recently and happily celebrated his 90th birthday surrounded by cherished loved ones.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;As a family we are comforted knowing Bill has found peace and eternal rest with his Heavenly Father. We ask for your prayers and encouragement during this time.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72087830007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThroughout his nearly 50-year career, Cobbs accumulated 200 film and TV credits, according to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm0167850/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eIMDB\u003c/a\u003e. In \u0026#34;The Bodyguard,\u0026#34; which was Whitney Houston\u0026#39;s feature film debut and starred Kevin Costner as her guard, Cobbs played her manager, Bill Devaney.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe also played night guard Reginald, who worked alongside Dick Van Dyke\u0026#39;s Cecil and Mickey Rooney\u0026#39;s Gus and became one of the film\u0026#39;s villains in 2006\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;Night at the Museum.\u0026#34; He briefly reprised his role in the 2014 sequel \u0026#34;Night at the Museum: Secret of the Tomb.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHis other Disney credits included 1997\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;Air Bud\u0026#34; (as basketball coach Arthur Chaney) and 2013\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;Oz the Great and Powerful.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIt was his role as Mr. Hendrickson in Amazon Prime Video\u0026#39;s Canadian series \u0026#34;Dino Dana\u0026#34; that earned Cobbs a Daytime Emmy in 2020. One of his other TV roles included playing Rev. James, Sr. in an episode of \u0026#34;The Sopranos\u0026#34; in 2000.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBorn in Cleveland, Ohio, in 1934, Cobbs held several positions in the U.S. Air Force, IBM and as a car salesman before finding his way into acting at 36. He started his career in local theater, stepping into his first role in the Negro Ensemble Company\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;Ride a Black Horse\u0026#34; production.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eEventually, he made his TV debut in the educational series \u0026#34;Vegetable Soup\u0026#34; before making his way onto the silver screen in 1974\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;The Taking of Pelham One Two Three.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74223683007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBill Cobbs, the prolific Daytime Emmy-winning actor who starred in 1992\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/06/04/kevin-costner-whitney-houston-the-bodyguard-eulogy/73979343007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Bodyguard\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; and the \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/2014/12/18/movie-review-night-museum-bids-farewell-robin-williams/20605367/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eNight at the Museum\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; franchise, has died.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe was 90. A cause of death was not immediately clear.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCobbs\u0026#39; longtime manager, Susan Zachary, confirmed to USA TODAY that Cobbs died Tuesday.\u003c/p\u003e"
