body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74190630007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/05/31/jimmy-kimmel-donald-trump-guilty-verdict-reaction/73919424007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJimmy Kimmel\u003c/a\u003e is telling all about what it\u0026#39;s like to attend the \u0026#34;Avengers: Endgame\u0026#34; of parties. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe late-night host \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dtmbuGSB30x8\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003echatted on \u0026#34;The Howard Stern Show\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e about going to a star-studded bash with dozens of famous guests, including \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/opinion/columnist/2024/04/22/taylor-swift-tortured-poets-department-review-critics-swifties/73416410007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTaylor Swift\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/25/taylor-swift-travis-kelce-interview-relationship-bussin-with-the-boys/74203295007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTravis Kelce\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/01/mick-jagger-moves-like-maroon-5-watch/73165429007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMick Jagger\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/20/bruce-springsteen-concert/73047643007/\"\u003eBruce Springsteen\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/06/15/steven-spielberg-sugarland-express-tribeca-goldie-hawn/74112703007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eSteven Spielberg\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe party was held at \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2023/11/07/paul-mccartney-the-lyrics-paperback-book/71480638007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePaul McCartney\u0026#39;s\u003c/a\u003e house, and Kimmel explained he ended up there after going to a dinner whose host was invited to the gathering. There were about 100 guests, people were dancing in the kitchen, and Swift was DJing — although that may make her role sound a bit more involved than it was, according to Kimmel.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;She just had her iPhone and tapped into the house system,\u0026#34; he said. \u0026#34;It wasn\u0026#39;t like she was hired to work there.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73277793007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBut Kimmel confirmed that Swift\u0026#39;s boyfriend joined her at the party, and the comedian\u0026#39;s wife, Molly McNearney, chimed in that Kelce is \u0026#34;very good looking.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe party was so ridiculously packed with A-list talent that Kimmel said he gravitated towards the people he already knew so they could say to each other, \u0026#34;Can you believe that this is happening and that we\u0026#39;re here?\u0026#34; He did, though, have a \u0026#34;good chat\u0026#34; with Springsteen. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eTravis Kelce \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/23/travis-kelce-onstage-taylor-swift-eras-tour/74187621007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ejoins Taylor Swift onstage during surprise Eras Tour appearance in London: Watch\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;We talked about Elvis, and we talked about being in L.A.,\u0026#34; Kimmel said. \u0026#34;We even had that moment (of), like, \u0026#39;Can you believe this party?\u0026#39; Even Bruce Springsteen was like, \u0026#39;This is some party.\u0026#39;\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eKimmel also chatted with Swift, although he didn\u0026#39;t reveal details of the conversation. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFor her part, McNearney described going into the corner to talk to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/10/jennifer-aniston-tears-up-friends-anniversary/74043507007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJennifer Aniston\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/25/courteney-cox-johnny-mcdaid-breakup-2015-therapy/73449985007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eCourteney Cox\u003c/a\u003e, whom she was \u0026#34;relieved\u0026#34; to see there. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It was one of those parties (where) I didn\u0026#39;t know how to hold my body,\u0026#34; she said. \u0026#34;I didn\u0026#39;t know where to look.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eTravis Kelce \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/25/taylor-swift-travis-kelce-interview-relationship-bussin-with-the-boys/74203295007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ereveals how he started to \u0026#39;really fall\u0026#39; for \u0026#39;very self-aware\u0026#39; Taylor Swift\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eEven though Springsteen and Cox were both at the party, the two never broke into their dance from the \u0026#34;Dancing in the Dark\u0026#34; music video, which the actress \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/10/courteney-cox-dancing-in-the-dark-dance-tiktok/74043314007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003erecreated\u003c/a\u003e on TikTok earlier this month. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAustin Butler reminisced with Kimmel about \u0026#39;insane\u0026#39; star-studded party\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis appears to be the same party that \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/06/21/the-bikeriders-movie-cast-interview/73976357007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eAustin Butler\u003c/a\u003e also attended, and when the \u0026#34;Dune\u0026#34; star was a guest on Kimmel\u0026#39;s show earlier this month, the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dc2MiZ43bpgE\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003etwo reminisced\u003c/a\u003e about the night. Kimmel described the bash as \u0026#34;maybe the craziest party I have ever been to in my whole life,\u0026#34; and Butler agreed it was \u0026#34;insane.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It was like a party where Tom Hanks is going, \u0026#39;Oh my God, can you believe who\u0026#39;s here?\u0026#39;\u0026#34; Kimmel joked. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73930374007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eButler, meanwhile, recalled chatting with Springsteen about Elvis Presley, whom he played in the movie \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2022/06/21/elvis-review-austin-butler-rules-king-over-musical-mess/7652227001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eElvis\u003c/a\u003e,\u0026#34; and being amazed to see \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/10/ringo-starr-interview-beatles-memories-tour-and-country-album/73557096007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eRingo Starr\u003c/a\u003e and McCartney in the same room. The actor also noted he was star-struck to see \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/02/05/meryl-streep-mark-ronson-grammys/72477705007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMeryl Streep\u003c/a\u003e, whom he met after eating vegan pizza by himself in McCartney\u0026#39;s kitchen.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I couldn\u0026#39;t believe I was meeting Meryl Streep with Paul McCartney\u0026#39;s vegan pizza in my mouth,\u0026#34; Butler joked. \u0026#34;She was so sweet.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74190630007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/05/31/jimmy-kimmel-donald-trump-guilty-verdict-reaction/73919424007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJimmy Kimmel\u003c/a\u003e is telling all about what it\u0026#39;s like to attend the \u0026#34;Avengers: Endgame\u0026#34; of parties. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe late-night host \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dtmbuGSB30x8\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003echatted on \u0026#34;The Howard Stern Show\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e about going to a star-studded bash with dozens of famous guests, including \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/opinion/columnist/2024/04/22/taylor-swift-tortured-poets-department-review-critics-swifties/73416410007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTaylor Swift\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/25/taylor-swift-travis-kelce-interview-relationship-bussin-with-the-boys/74203295007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTravis Kelce\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/01/mick-jagger-moves-like-maroon-5-watch/73165429007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMick Jagger\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/20/bruce-springsteen-concert/73047643007/\"\u003eBruce Springsteen\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/06/15/steven-spielberg-sugarland-express-tribeca-goldie-hawn/74112703007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eSteven Spielberg\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe party was held at \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2023/11/07/paul-mccartney-the-lyrics-paperback-book/71480638007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePaul McCartney\u0026#39;s\u003c/a\u003e house, and Kimmel explained he ended up there after going to a dinner whose host was invited to the gathering. There were about 100 guests, people were dancing in the kitchen, and Swift was DJing — although that may make her role sound a bit more involved than it was, according to Kimmel.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;She just had her iPhone and tapped into the house system,\u0026#34; he said. \u0026#34;It wasn\u0026#39;t like she was hired to work there.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73277793007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBut Kimmel confirmed that Swift\u0026#39;s boyfriend joined her at the party, and the comedian\u0026#39;s wife, Molly McNearney, chimed in that Kelce is \u0026#34;very good looking.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe party was so ridiculously packed with A-list talent that Kimmel said he gravitated towards the people he already knew so they could say to each other, \u0026#34;Can you believe that this is happening and that we\u0026#39;re here?\u0026#34; He did, though, have a \u0026#34;good chat\u0026#34; with Springsteen. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eTravis Kelce \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/23/travis-kelce-onstage-taylor-swift-eras-tour/74187621007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ejoins Taylor Swift onstage during surprise Eras Tour appearance in London: Watch\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;We talked about Elvis, and we talked about being in L.A.,\u0026#34; Kimmel said. \u0026#34;We even had that moment (of), like, \u0026#39;Can you believe this party?\u0026#39; Even Bruce Springsteen was like, \u0026#39;This is some party.\u0026#39;\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eKimmel also chatted with Swift, although he didn\u0026#39;t reveal details of the conversation. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFor her part, McNearney described going into the corner to talk to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/10/jennifer-aniston-tears-up-friends-anniversary/74043507007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJennifer Aniston\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/25/courteney-cox-johnny-mcdaid-breakup-2015-therapy/73449985007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eCourteney Cox\u003c/a\u003e, whom she was \u0026#34;relieved\u0026#34; to see there. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It was one of those parties (where) I didn\u0026#39;t know how to hold my body,\u0026#34; she said. \u0026#34;I didn\u0026#39;t know where to look.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eTravis Kelce \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/25/taylor-swift-travis-kelce-interview-relationship-bussin-with-the-boys/74203295007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ereveals how he started to \u0026#39;really fall\u0026#39; for \u0026#39;very self-aware\u0026#39; Taylor Swift\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eEven though Springsteen and Cox were both at the party, the two never broke into their dance from the \u0026#34;Dancing in the Dark\u0026#34; music video, which the actress \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/10/courteney-cox-dancing-in-the-dark-dance-tiktok/74043314007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003erecreated\u003c/a\u003e on TikTok earlier this month. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAustin Butler reminisced with Kimmel about \u0026#39;insane\u0026#39; star-studded party\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis appears to be the same party that \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/06/21/the-bikeriders-movie-cast-interview/73976357007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eAustin Butler\u003c/a\u003e also attended, and when the \u0026#34;Dune\u0026#34; star was a guest on Kimmel\u0026#39;s show earlier this month, the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dc2MiZ43bpgE\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003etwo reminisced\u003c/a\u003e about the night. Kimmel described the bash as \u0026#34;maybe the craziest party I have ever been to in my whole life,\u0026#34; and Butler agreed it was \u0026#34;insane.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It was like a party where Tom Hanks is going, \u0026#39;Oh my God, can you believe who\u0026#39;s here?\u0026#39;\u0026#34; Kimmel joked. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73930374007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eButler, meanwhile, recalled chatting with Springsteen about Elvis Presley, whom he played in the movie \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2022/06/21/elvis-review-austin-butler-rules-king-over-musical-mess/7652227001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eElvis\u003c/a\u003e,\u0026#34; and being amazed to see \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/10/ringo-starr-interview-beatles-memories-tour-and-country-album/73557096007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eRingo Starr\u003c/a\u003e and McCartney in the same room. The actor also noted he was star-struck to see \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/02/05/meryl-streep-mark-ronson-grammys/72477705007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMeryl Streep\u003c/a\u003e, whom he met after eating vegan pizza by himself in McCartney\u0026#39;s kitchen.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I couldn\u0026#39;t believe I was meeting Meryl Streep with Paul McCartney\u0026#39;s vegan pizza in my mouth,\u0026#34; Butler joked. \u0026#34;She was so sweet.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

