body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "71825143007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/03/04/jamie-foxx-health-scare-details-stand-up-set/72843491007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJamie Foxx\u003c/a\u003e is revealing new details about the unspecified \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/04/12/jamie-foxx-recovering-medical-complication-daughter-corinne-says/11654483002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003emedical complication\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; he experienced last year.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn an undated video circulating on social media, which was posted by accounts such as \u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/ArtOfDialogue_/status/1807761080455995750\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e@ArtOfDialogue_\u003c/a\u003e, the Oscar-winning actor appeared to discuss the circumstances around the health issue, which set him on a months-long \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/08/17/jamie-foxx-health-update-unexpected-dark-journey/70610821007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eroad to recovery\u003c/a\u003e, with some fans.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFoxx, 56, said in the video that on April 11, 2023, he experienced a \u0026#34;bad headache\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;asked my boy for an Advil.\u0026#34; Then \u0026#34;I was gone for 20 days.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe went on, \u0026#34;I don’t remember anything. I’m in Atlanta ... My sister and my daughter took me to the first doctor. They gave me a cortisone shot. The next doctor said, \u0026#39;There’s something going on up there.\u0026#39;\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFoxx pointed to his head before explaining that he wouldn\u0026#39;t go into further details \u0026#34;on camera.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY reached out to Foxx\u0026#39;s representative for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74273577007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJamie Foxx promised to explain health scare \u0026#39;in a funny way\u0026#39;\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn March, Foxx alluded to his 2023 health scare while accepting the producers award at the African American Film Critics Association\u0026#39;s awards luncheon.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Everybody wants to know what happened, and I\u0026#39;m going to tell you what happened, but I gotta do it in my way,\u0026#34; Foxx said, according to a video of the speech \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dqMl0YFhERaU\u0026t\u003d186s\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003euploaded to YouTube\u003c/a\u003e. \u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m gonna do it in a funny way.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFoxx also teased a return to the stage by sharing an old clip of his stand-up comedy \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C350sWYvZoM/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eon Instagram\u003c/a\u003e and telling fans he\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;planning on bringing more moments\u0026#34; like those.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Going to get on somebody\u0026#39;s stage somewhere near you,\u0026#34; Foxx wrote. \u0026#34;I got some jokes and a story to tell.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJamie Foxx\u0026#39;s previous update: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/03/04/jamie-foxx-health-scare-details-stand-up-set/72843491007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eActor promises to \u0026#39;tell you what happened\u0026#39; during health scare\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "108567570"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWhat happened to Jamie Foxx?\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAfter sharing several recovery updates on Instagram, Foxx \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/12/05/jamie-foxx-illness-medical-condition-update/71815841007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003emade his first major public appearance\u003c/a\u003e in December to accept the Vanguard Award at the Critics Choice Association\u0026#39;s Celebration of Cinema \u0026amp; Television: Honoring Black, Latino and AAPI Achievements.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAt the time, he revealed that he \u0026#34;couldn\u0026#39;t actually walk\u0026#34; six months earlier.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It feels good to be here,\u0026#34; he said. \u0026#34;I cherish every single minute now. It\u0026#39;s different. I wouldn\u0026#39;t wish what I went through on my worst enemy because it\u0026#39;s tough when it\u0026#39;s almost over. ... I saw the tunnel. I didn\u0026#39;t see the light. It was hot in that tunnel, too; I don\u0026#39;t know where I was going.\u0026#39;\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFoxx joked, \u0026#34;Am I going to the right place? I see the devil going, \u0026#39;C\u0026#39;mon.\u0026#39;\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn April 12, daughter Corinne Foxx revealed the \u0026#34;Ray\u0026#34; actor \u0026#34;experienced a medical complication\u0026#34; and was recovering.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74274139007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Luckily, due to quick action and great care, he is already on his way to recovery,\u0026#34; she wrote in a since-removed Instagram post. \u0026#34;We know how beloved he is and appreciate your prayers. The family asks for privacy during this time.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eSeveral months later, in July, Jamie Foxx \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/07/23/jamie-foxx-first-video-update-hospitalization-medical-complication/70452815007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eposted a video on social media\u003c/a\u003e to prove to his fans that he was on the mend.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I didn’t want you to see me with tubes running out of me and trying to figure out if I was going to make it through,\u0026#34; he said in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Cu_Iog9tJIk/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ea July 21 Instagram post\u003c/a\u003e. \u0026#34;I went to hell and back, and my road to recovery had some potholes as well, but I’m coming back.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe added, \u0026#34;It’s been tough, man; I was sick. But now I’ve got my legs under me so you’re going to see me.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Brendan Morrow\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "71825143007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/03/04/jamie-foxx-health-scare-details-stand-up-set/72843491007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJamie Foxx\u003c/a\u003e is revealing new details about the unspecified \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/04/12/jamie-foxx-recovering-medical-complication-daughter-corinne-says/11654483002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003emedical complication\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; he experienced last year.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn an undated video circulating on social media, which was posted by accounts such as \u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/ArtOfDialogue_/status/1807761080455995750\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e@ArtOfDialogue_\u003c/a\u003e, the Oscar-winning actor appeared to discuss the circumstances around the health issue, which set him on a months-long \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/08/17/jamie-foxx-health-update-unexpected-dark-journey/70610821007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eroad to recovery\u003c/a\u003e, with some fans.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFoxx, 56, said in the video that on April 11, 2023, he experienced a \u0026#34;bad headache\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;asked my boy for an Advil.\u0026#34; Then \u0026#34;I was gone for 20 days.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
