  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It feels good to be here,\u0026#34; he said. \u0026#34;I cherish every single minute now. It\u0026#39;s different. I wouldn\u0026#39;t wish what I went through on my worst enemy because it\u0026#39;s tough when it\u0026#39;s almost over. ... I saw the tunnel. I didn\u0026#39;t see the light. It was hot in that tunnel, too; I don\u0026#39;t know where I was going.\u0026#39;\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eFoxx joked, \u0026#34;Am I going to the right place? I see the devil going, \u0026#39;C\u0026#39;mon.\u0026#39;\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn April 12, daughter Corinne Foxx revealed the \u0026#34;Ray\u0026#34; actor \u0026#34;experienced a medical complication\u0026#34; and was recovering.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74274139007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Luckily, due to quick action and great care, he is already on his way to recovery,\u0026#34; she wrote in a since-removed Instagram post. \u0026#34;We know how beloved he is and appreciate your prayers. The family asks for privacy during this time.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eSeveral months later, in July, Jamie Foxx \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/07/23/jamie-foxx-first-video-update-hospitalization-medical-complication/70452815007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eposted a video on social media\u003c/a\u003e to prove to his fans that he was on the mend.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I didn’t want you to see me with tubes running out of me and trying to figure out if I was going to make it through,\u0026#34; he said in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Cu_Iog9tJIk/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ea July 21 Instagram post\u003c/a\u003e. \u0026#34;I went to hell and back, and my road to recovery had some potholes as well, but I’m coming back.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe added, \u0026#34;It’s been tough, man; I was sick. But now I’ve got my legs under me so you’re going to see me.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Brendan Morrow\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

