      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It only works because the performances are so good,\u0026#34; Zemeckis told the magazine.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74213261007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Both Tom and Robin understood instantly that, \u0026#39;Okay, we have to go back and channel what we were like 50 years ago or 40 years ago, and we have to bring that energy, that kind of posture, and even raise our voices higher. That kind of thing.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAccording to a Sony press release, \u0026#34;Here\u0026#34; is an \u0026#34;original film about multiple families and a special place they inhabit. The story travels through generations, capturing the human experience in its purest form.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWho else will star in Sony\u0026#39;s \u0026#39;Here\u0026#39;?\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe movie will primarily focus on Hank and Wright\u0026#39;s characters and fictional family, but it will also look back at the people who lived in their home before them. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003ePaul Bettany and Kelly Reilly will play Richard\u0026#39;s parents and actors Michelle Dockery, Gwilym Lee, David Fynn and Ophelia Lovibond will also star in \u0026#34;Here.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

contentBody:
{
  "contentBody": [{
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2023/01/12/tom-hanks-man-called-otto-casting-son-truman/11010846002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTom Hanks\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2023/10/02/who-was-jenny-in-forrest-gump/70561358007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eRobin Wright\u003c/a\u003e are reuniting onscreen for another epic love story. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2019/07/03/tom-hanks-remembers-forrest-gump-on-25th-anniversary/1631723001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eForrest Gump\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; director Robert Zemeckis and co-stars Hanks and Wright are reuniting for an innovative film, out later this year, that sees de-aged versions of the two actors portray their characters over several decades − from high school sweethearts to spouses. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe film is based on Richard McGuire\u0026#39;s 2014 graphic novel of the same name and will take place in one living room over the course of a century. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eHanks and Wright can be seen in their roles as Richard and Margaret, respectively, in first-look images from \u0026#34;Here\u0026#34; released by Sony on Tuesday. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74213262007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWhen will Tom Hanks\u0026#39; new movie \u0026#39;Here\u0026#39; be released?\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Here,\u0026#34; slated to release Nov. 15, is directed by Zemeckis, who co-wrote the script with Eric Roth. The duo was also behind the six-time Academy Award-winning \u0026#34;Forrest Gump,\u0026#34; which will celebrate its 30th anniversary next month. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWhat is \u0026#39;Here\u0026#39; about? \u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eAccording to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.vanityfair.com/hollywood/story/here-first-look-robert-zemeckis-tom-hanks-robin-wright\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eVanity Fair\u003c/a\u003e, the camera does not move from its position as \u0026#34;Here\u0026#34; shows how a family home changes hands − and appearance − over time, even going so far back as prehistoric times. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eHanks portrays a young Richard up until he\u0026#39;s in his 80s.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It only works because the performances are so good,\u0026#34; Zemeckis told the magazine.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74213261007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Both Tom and Robin understood instantly that, \u0026#39;Okay, we have to go back and channel what we were like 50 years ago or 40 years ago, and we have to bring that energy, that kind of posture, and even raise our voices higher. That kind of thing.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eAccording to a Sony press release, \u0026#34;Here\u0026#34; is an \u0026#34;original film about multiple families and a special place they inhabit. The story travels through generations, capturing the human experience in its purest form.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWho else will star in Sony\u0026#39;s \u0026#39;Here\u0026#39;?\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe movie will primarily focus on Hank and Wright\u0026#39;s characters and fictional family, but it will also look back at the people who lived in their home before them. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003ePaul Bettany and Kelly Reilly will play Richard\u0026#39;s parents and actors Michelle Dockery, Gwilym Lee, David Fynn and Ophelia Lovibond will also star in \u0026#34;Here.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

