      "value": "3083590001"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAdele has been performing her Weekends With Adele concert residency in Las Vegas since 2022 with plans to wrap up in November. She\u0026#39;s \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/01/31/adele-munich-germany-summer-shows/72419853007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eset to play a series of shows\u003c/a\u003e in Munich this August, marking her first time performing in mainland Europe since 2016. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

