    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe performance footage also showed an individual being escorted from the concert by police. \u0026#34;You didn\u0026#39;t have to go that far,\u0026#34; Rexha said onstage.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to representatives for Rexha and Titletown for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "2141341001"
    }, {
