body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73539754007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/entertainment/music/taylor-swift/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTaylor Swift\u003c/a\u003e broke an attendance record in Lyon, France, with her sold-out \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/17/a-year-of-the-eras-tour-a-look-back-at-taylor-swifts-unprecedented-show/72972730007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eEras Tour\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;This is overall my very first trip to Lyon and look at what you\u0026#39;ve done,\u0026#34; the singer — donning a pink bejeweled jacket and bodysuit — said to the 61,000 fans packed inside the Groupama Stadium on Monday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe night before, Swift announced the crowd had broken the venue\u0026#39;s all-time attendance record for a female artist. Similar to in other cities where succeeding nights have broken attendance records from the night before, on Monday she exclaimed: \u0026#34;You broke that record.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAs her hands thrust into the air and the crowd roared, gray clouds loomed over the open-roofed stadium. Rain didn\u0026#39;t pour Monday night like it did \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/02/taylor-swift-sings-in-rain-eras-tours-lyon-france/73948698007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eduring the \u0026#34;Reputation\u0026#34; era Sunday night.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eTemperatures hovered in the low 60s on Monday. Some fans on the floor noticeably needed water. The singer-songwriter isn\u0026#39;t \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/30/taylor-swift-tells-workers-to-get-water-to-fans-in-spain/73867526007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eshy about pausing songs to ask guards\u003c/a\u003e to help Swifties. Six minutes into her 10-minute version of \u0026#34;All Too Well,\u0026#34; she briefly stopped singing as the background track continued. \u0026#34;S\u0026#39;il vous plaît, please help,\u0026#34; she said.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe singer and her crew have a four-day tour break. Their next stop is Edinburgh, Scotland, where she will perform on Friday, Saturday and Sunday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73627073007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eDon\u0026#39;t miss any Taylor Swift news; sign up for the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.tennessean.com/newsletters/this-swift-beat/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003efree, weekly newsletter This Swift Beat.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eFollow Taylor Swift reporter Bryan West on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/bryanwesttv/\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@bryanwesttv\"\u003eTikTok\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/bryanwesttv\"\u003eX as @BryanWestTV\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73539754007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/entertainment/music/taylor-swift/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTaylor Swift\u003c/a\u003e broke an attendance record in Lyon, France, with her sold-out \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/17/a-year-of-the-eras-tour-a-look-back-at-taylor-swifts-unprecedented-show/72972730007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eEras Tour\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;This is overall my very first trip to Lyon and look at what you\u0026#39;ve done,\u0026#34; the singer — donning a pink bejeweled jacket and bodysuit — said to the 61,000 fans packed inside the Groupama Stadium on Monday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe night before, Swift announced the crowd had broken the venue\u0026#39;s all-time attendance record for a female artist. Similar to in other cities where succeeding nights have broken attendance records from the night before, on Monday she exclaimed: \u0026#34;You broke that record.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAs her hands thrust into the air and the crowd roared, gray clouds loomed over the open-roofed stadium. Rain didn\u0026#39;t pour Monday night like it did \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/02/taylor-swift-sings-in-rain-eras-tours-lyon-france/73948698007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eduring the \u0026#34;Reputation\u0026#34; era Sunday night.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eTemperatures hovered in the low 60s on Monday. Some fans on the floor noticeably needed water. The singer-songwriter isn\u0026#39;t \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/30/taylor-swift-tells-workers-to-get-water-to-fans-in-spain/73867526007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eshy about pausing songs to ask guards\u003c/a\u003e to help Swifties. Six minutes into her 10-minute version of \u0026#34;All Too Well,\u0026#34; she briefly stopped singing as the background track continued. \u0026#34;S\u0026#39;il vous plaît, please help,\u0026#34; she said.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe singer and her crew have a four-day tour break. Their next stop is Edinburgh, Scotland, where she will perform on Friday, Saturday and Sunday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73627073007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eDon\u0026#39;t miss any Taylor Swift news; sign up for the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.tennessean.com/newsletters/this-swift-beat/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003efree, weekly newsletter This Swift Beat.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eFollow Taylor Swift reporter Bryan West on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/bryanwesttv/\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@bryanwesttv\"\u003eTikTok\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/bryanwesttv\"\u003eX as @BryanWestTV\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

