contentBody:
{
  "contentBody": [{
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73539754007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/entertainment/music/taylor-swift/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTaylor Swift\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#39;s acoustic set had some challenges on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/07/taylor-swift-eras-tour-scotland/73954579007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003enight one in Edinburgh, Scotland\u003c/a\u003e, and the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/17/a-year-of-the-eras-tour-a-look-back-at-taylor-swifts-unprecedented-show/72972730007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eEras Tour\u003c/a\u003e star was not shy to pause her set.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eDuring the second chorus of \u0026#34;Would\u0026#39;ve, Could\u0026#39;ve, Should\u0026#39;ve\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Midnights,\u0026#34; she strummed her guitar and asked security guards to help a fan, who seemed to need help.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I’m just gonna keep playing until someone notices them,\u0026#34; she said in a talk-sing voice for about a minute. \u0026#34;We’re going to keep talking until the people in front of me get help.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I can do this all night,\u0026#34; she added.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74022113007"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73627073007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eWhen the fan received attention from a medical team, and Swift heard they were OK, she said \u0026#34;Awesome.\u0026#34; She mashed up \u0026#34;I Know Places\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;1989 (Taylor\u0026#39;s Version).\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;\u0026#39;Tis The Damn Season\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Evermore,\u0026#34; which was cut from year two of the tour returned during the piano song. She mashed up \u0026#34;Daylight\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Lover.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eDon\u0026#39;t miss any Taylor Swift news; sign up for the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.tennessean.com/newsletters/this-swift-beat/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003efree, weekly newsletter This Swift Beat.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eFollow Taylor Swift reporter Bryan West on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/bryanwesttv/\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@bryanwesttv\"\u003eTikTok\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/bryanwesttv\"\u003eX as @BryanWestTV\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73539754007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFor the first time on the Eras Tour, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/entertainment/music/taylor-swift/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTaylor Swift\u003c/a\u003e played her surprise, acoustic set for three nights in the Scotland sun\u0026#39;s afterglow.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe late sunsets and stadium\u0026#39;s open-roof allowed the singer to perform at twilight. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn night two during \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/04/18/taylor-swift-tortured-poets-album-release-updates/73149372007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;The Tortured Poets Department\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e set, the singer wore black gloves. While fans debated on livestream chats if it was an Easter egg or intentional, the arena held at a chilly 51 degrees. The gloves came off during Swift\u0026#39;s costume change after \u0026#34;I Can Do It With a Broken Heart\u0026#34; and before the acoustic set.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn her bright orange dress, Swift mashed up \u0026#34;The Bolter\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;The Tortured Poets Department\u0026#34; with \u0026#34;Getaway Car\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Reputation\u0026#34; on the guitar.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn the piano, she mashed up \u0026#34;All Of The Girls You Loved Before\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Lover\u0026#34; with \u0026#34;Crazier\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Hannah Montana: The Movie - Soundtrack.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;You might not know this song,\u0026#34; Swift said before diving into her 2009 song to which the crowd sang along.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003e\u0026#39;I can do this all night\u0026#39; Scotland\u0026#39;s Version\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I can do this all night\u0026#34; is not the name of one of Swift\u0026#39;s vault songs or \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/04/18/taylor-swift-tortured-poets-album-release-updates/73149372007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003enew \u0026#34;Tortured Poets\u0026#34; tracks\u003c/a\u003e, but the Eras Tour star did say this when she paused her acoustic set on night one in Scotland to make sure a fan was okay.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eWhen workers got to the Swiftie, the singer finished her mashup of \u0026#34;Would\u0026#39;ve, Could\u0026#39;ve, Should\u0026#39;ve\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Midnights\u0026#34; with \u0026#34;I Know Places\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;1989 (Taylor\u0026#39;s Version).\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn the piano, Swift mixed \u0026#34;\u0026#39;Tis The Damn Season\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Evermore,\u0026#34; cut from the setlist in May, with \u0026#34;Daylight\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Lover.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eMore: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/07/taylor-swift-scotland-helps-fan/73954690007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eTaylor Swift pauses Scotland Eras Tour show until \u0026#39;the people in front of me get help\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73627073007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eDon\u0026#39;t miss any Taylor Swift news; sign up for the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.tennessean.com/newsletters/this-swift-beat/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003efree, weekly newsletter This Swift Beat.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eFollow Taylor Swift reporter Bryan West on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/bryanwesttv/\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@bryanwesttv\"\u003eTikTok\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/bryanwesttv\"\u003eX as @BryanWestTV\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
