    "value": "\u003cp\u003eWith \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2023/08/10/taylor-swift-eras-wraps-in-la-with-epic-concert/70559206007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ealbum announcements\u003c/a\u003e, music video reveals, special guests appearances and a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/04/18/taylor-swift-tortured-poets-album-release-updates/73149372007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewhole new \u0026#34;Tortured Poets\u0026#34; set\u003c/a\u003e unveiled in Paris, France, the tour has continued to evolve and impress. Swift has broken attendance records for many stadiums across the world and countries have welcomed the singer in innovative ways. A hidden language of Swift-ese has developed in the form of friendship bracelets, custom concert chants (\u0026#34;1, 2, 3 let\u0026#39;s go b****\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;Where you going Taylor?\u0026#34;) and unforgettable dance moves. Tens of thousands of fans log on to watch livestreams every concert night anticipating Swift\u0026#39;s outfits, possible surprises and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/02/07/taylor-swift-eras-tour-setlist-complete-list-of-surprise-songs/72484807007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ecustom acoustic set\u003c/a\u003e of songs not included in the massive \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tennessean.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/09/taylor-swift-set-list-changes-eras-tour-tortured-poets/73514671007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e46-song set list\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73078313007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eMore: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/17/a-year-of-the-eras-tour-a-look-back-at-taylor-swifts-unprecedented-show/72972730007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eA year of the Eras Tour: A look back at Taylor Swift\u0026#39;s record-breaking show\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2023/10/12/taylor-swift-eras-tour-movie-premiere/71145770007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eSwift\u0026#39;s concert movie\u003c/a\u003e bypassed production studios as the singer worked directly with AMC as a distributor bringing fans dancing and singing in the aisles. The movie is available to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/14/taylor-swift-eras-tour-disney-bonus-acoustic-collection/72980833007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewatch on Disney+\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eNo word on if she will release a second movie with the newly scrambled show and additional set.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eSwift is only a third of the way through her 51 European stops. In the fall, she will come back to North America, heading to Miami, New Orleans and Indianapolis in October and November and then Canada. Her last show for 2024 is on Dec. 8 in Vancouver, British Columbia.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73627073007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eDon\u0026#39;t miss any Taylor Swift news; sign up for the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.tennessean.com/newsletters/this-swift-beat/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003efree, weekly newsletter This Swift Beat.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eFollow Taylor Swift reporter Bryan West on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/bryanwesttv/\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@bryanwesttv\"\u003eTikTok\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/bryanwesttv\"\u003eX as @BryanWestTV\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "12218097002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe Eagles’ \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2023/09/08/the-eagles-final-tour-long-goodbye-opening-night-new-york/70788342007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003elong and winding road to goodbye\u003c/a\u003e will go through Las Vegas this fall.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe band will become the fourth act to play \u003ca href\u003d\"http://73884854007\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ethe snazzy Sphere\u003c/a\u003e when their farewell tour, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://eagles.com/blogs/news/the-long-goodbye-tour\"\u003eThe Long Goodbye\u003c/a\u003e, pulls into the venue for 16 dates: Sept. 20-21; Sept. 27-28; Oct. 11-12; Oct. 18-19; Nov. 1-2; Nov. 8-9; Dec. 6-7 and Dec. 13-14.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eTickets for all dates through November are on sale now at \u003ca href\u003d\"https://eagles.com.\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eeagles.com.\u003c/a\u003e A pre-sale for the December shows begins at 1 p.m. ET July 9 with the general on sale at 1 p.m. July 12. Pre-registration for tickets not yet on sale is available at \u003ca href\u003d\"https://eagles.com\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eeagles.com\u003c/a\u003e. Tickets start at $175 (all-in pricing). \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74077980007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eMore: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/07/roger-daltrey-interview/74005347007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eRoger Daltrey says live music is \u0026#39;the only thing that hasn’t been stolen by the internet\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe Eagles playing the Sphere\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/10/the-eagles-sphere-las-vegas-speculation/73647121007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e wasn\u0026#39;t the best-kept secret\u003c/a\u003e. In May, James Dolan, executive chairman and CEO of Sphere Entertainment Co., mentioned on an earnings call the Eagles would be the next act to explore the creative and visual opportunities that come with playing the nine-month-old venue.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe band, which kicked off its farewell tour in September, will follow rapturously received residencies by U2, who \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2023/09/30/sphere-las-vegas-u2-opening-night-review/71008238007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003echristened the venue\u003c/a\u003e last fall, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/04/19/phish-sphere-vegas-songs/73373874007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePhish \u003c/a\u003eand, currently, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/01/31/dead-and-company-sphere-las-vegas/72424771007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eDead \u0026amp; Company\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe Grateful Dead offshoot band fronted by Bob Weir and including John Mayer and Mickey Hart, are in the midst of a recently expanded 30-date run that will wrap Aug. 10.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73884854007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAll three of the acts who have parked at the Sphere have captivated crowds with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/videos/travel/2023/12/17/months-after-its-grand-opening-the-vegas-sphere-is-still-turning-heads/71952122007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eawe-inspiring visual elements\u003c/a\u003e – rolling video that makes the room feel as if it’s moving, band images incorporated into TV sets, walls of backstage passes that envelop the inside of the venue – projected onto the 160,000-square-foot LED screen that wraps the interior.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/01/06/eagles-long-goodbye-tour-forum-california-homecoming/72086733007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Eagles\u003c/a\u003e, currently touring Europe, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2023/09/08/the-eagles-setlist-the-long-goodbye-tour/70793106007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ehave a set list stocked\u003c/a\u003e with their more laid-back hits in the first half (“Take it Easy,” “One of These Nights,” “Take it To the Limit”) that builds to rollicking rockers including “Life in the Fast Lane” and “Already Gone” as the show continues.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "12218097002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe Eagles’ \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2023/09/08/the-eagles-final-tour-long-goodbye-opening-night-new-york/70788342007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003elong and winding road to goodbye\u003c/a\u003e will go through Las Vegas this fall.\u003c/p\u003e"
