body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73766397007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/05/26/katy-perry-returns-las-vegas-resorts-world-residency/9927676002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKaty Perry\u003c/a\u003e is celebrating \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/nation/2024/06/01/pride-month-explained/73937777007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePride Month\u003c/a\u003e with a dash of sass.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe popstar marked the first day of the monthlong LGBTQ celebration with an edited video of a recent commencement speech given by NFL player \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/2024/05/16/harrison-butker-speech-internet-nfl-celebs-react/73713932007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eHarrison Butker\u003c/a\u003e. The Kansas City Chiefs kicker drew controversy earlier this month for his remarks, some of which took aim at the LGBTQ community and \u0026#34;dangerous gender ideologies.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe revised clip, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/C7sSJyovXU7/?igsh\u003ddGg4ZDljdDRoYTI4\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eshared on Perry\u0026#39;s Instagram\u003c/a\u003e, splices Butker\u0026#39;s comments to sound like he was showing support for the LGBTQ community. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The road ahead is bright, things are changing, society is shifting and people young and old are embracing diversity, equity and inclusion,\u0026#34; Butker says in the edited video. \u0026#34;With that said, I want to say happy Pride Month to all of you.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73951463007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u0026#34;Firework\u0026#34; singer concluded the post with a message for her LGBTQ fans.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Fixed this for my girls, my graduates, and my gays — you can do anything, congratulations and happy pride 🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍⚧️ 🧡\u0026#34; Perry wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCheck out how other stars are celebrating Pride and showing their love for the LGBTQ community.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "35626395"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eMaren Morris comes out as bisexual months after Ryan Hurd divorce\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/12/14/maren-morris-ryan-hurd-divorce-dating/71922271007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMaren Morris\u003c/a\u003e is for the guys \u003cem\u003eand\u003c/em\u003e the girls.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The Bones\u0026#34; singer, who is on her RSVP Redux tour, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/health-wellness/2024/06/11/maren-morris-coming-lgbtq/74052068007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ecame out as bisexual on\u003c/a\u003e June 9 following a show in Arizona where she waved a rainbow for Pride Month.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;happy to be the B in LGBTQ+,\u0026#34; the 34-year-old captioned her post on Instagram. \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8AGJTTJqdm/?img_index\u003d6\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ehappy pride\u003c/a\u003e 🌈.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74066395007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMorris\u0026#39; declaration comes after she filed for divorce from her singer-songwriter husband Ryan Hurd, 37, after five years of marriage on Oct. 2, according to documents obtained by \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2023/10/17/maren-morris-husband-ryan-hurd-file-for-divorce-after-five-years/71215087007/\"\u003eThe Nashville Tennessean\u003c/a\u003e, part of the USA TODAY Network.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;Happy pride\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/10/maren-morris-bisexual/74042432007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eMaren Morris comes out as bisexual months after divorce filing\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJessica Madsen shares pride for same-sex relationship\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eJessica Madsen kicked off Pride Month with a joyful update on her love life.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/05/17/nicola-coughlan-bridgerton-season-3-interview/73725101007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Bridgerton\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; star shared a series of LGBTQ imagery in an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7qtJkwMu4h/?img_index\u003d1\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram post\u003c/a\u003e Saturday, including a GIF of herself wearing a colorful tie-dye top and rainbow-colored jewel makeup.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;In love with a woman, loud about it and proud about it! 🌈\u0026#34; Madsen wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73951462007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAdele shows support for Pride Month by calling out concert heckler\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/02/adele-calls-out-las-vegas-concertgoer-pride-sucks/73947470007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eAdele\u003c/a\u003e slammed an audience member who shouted, \u0026#34;Pride sucks!\u0026#34;, during a recent performance in her \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/02/27/adele-postpones-las-vegas-residency-march-dates-illness/72765401007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLas Vegas concert residency\u003c/a\u003e, according to a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/dellyfromdablok/status/1797110056028139671\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003evideo shared on social m\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/dellyfromdablok/status/1797110056028139671\"\u003eedia\u003c/a\u003e Saturday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn the clip, the British pop singer initially appeared taken aback after being interrupted by the heckler but grew angry after realizing what they had said.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Did you come to my (expletive) show and just say that Pride sucks?\u0026#34; an incensed Adele asked. \u0026#34;Are you (expletive) stupid?\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe crowd erupted in cheers after the 16-time Grammy winner told this \u0026#34;ridiculous\u0026#34; concertgoer, \u0026#34;You\u0026#39;ve got nothing nice to say, shut up, all right?\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;Shut up!\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/02/adele-calls-out-las-vegas-concertgoer-pride-sucks/73947470007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAdele calls out \u0026#39;stupid\u0026#39; concertgoer for shouting \u0026#39;Pride sucks\u0026#39; at her show\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAdam Lambert rocks out at WeHo Pride\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/10/adam-lambert-changes-pronoun-whataya-want-from-me/73627292007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eAdam Lambert\u003c/a\u003e made Tinseltown sparkle with queer magic.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/05/02/every-american-idol-winner-ranked-worst-best/9617596002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;American Idol\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; alum took the stage at WeHo Pride and rocked out in a black sheer top, sleek leather jacket and matching pants for the performance, which included the premiere of Lambert’s new song \u0026#34;Lube.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;WeHo Pride, you all brought the fire! 😈\u0026#34; Lambert \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7sggT5x3Rf/?img_index\u003d1\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewrote on Instagram\u003c/a\u003e. \u0026#34;It was amazing to perform \u0026#39;Lube\u0026#39; live for the first time. Your energy was electrifying!\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73951458007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/28/adam-lambert-interview/73733086007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMay interview with USA TODAY\u003c/a\u003e, Lambert reflected on the political pushback faced by the LGBTQ community.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I think people are scared of confidence and scared of pride and scared of what they don\u0026#39;t understand,\u0026#34; Lambert said. \u0026#34;I feel sorry for those that are controlled by that kind of fear.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eAdam Lambert: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/28/adam-lambert-interview/73733086007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSinger talks Pride, announces new EP \u0026#39;Afters\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eKeke Palmer joins JoJo Siwa for Pride Month dance\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/03/12/keke-palmer-jimmy-fallon-password-season-2-celebrity-guests/72941293007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKeke Palmer\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/health-wellness/2024/04/10/jojo-siwa-music-video-hate-bullies-online-response/73275764007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJoJo Siwa\u003c/a\u003e make for a funky double rainbow.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003ePalmer shared an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7sUMYaJNCc/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram video\u003c/a\u003e of herself dancing with the singer and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/11/02/dance-moms-reunion-special-jojo-siwa-cast-members/71419544007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Dance Mom\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/11/02/dance-moms-reunion-special-jojo-siwa-cast-members/71419544007/\"\u003es\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; alum Saturday ahead of a Pride Month performance. The ladies playfully whipped their arms to a groovy dance beat. \u0026#34;Get up here! Let\u0026#39;s dance,\u0026#34; Palmer lip-synced in the video.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73951452007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e“When you (and) @itsjojosiwa are both performing at Pittsburgh Pride and need a (little) dance warm up 😂😂😂\u0026#34; Palmer wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Mary Walrath-Holdridge, Brendan Morrow, Ralphie Aversa and Naledi Ushe, USA TODAY\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73766397007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/05/26/katy-perry-returns-las-vegas-resorts-world-residency/9927676002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKaty Perry\u003c/a\u003e is celebrating \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/nation/2024/06/01/pride-month-explained/73937777007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePride Month\u003c/a\u003e with a dash of sass.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe popstar marked the first day of the monthlong LGBTQ celebration with an edited video of a recent commencement speech given by NFL player \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/2024/05/16/harrison-butker-speech-internet-nfl-celebs-react/73713932007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eHarrison Butker\u003c/a\u003e. The Kansas City Chiefs kicker drew controversy earlier this month for his remarks, some of which took aim at the LGBTQ community and \u0026#34;dangerous gender ideologies.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe revised clip, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/C7sSJyovXU7/?igsh\u003ddGg4ZDljdDRoYTI4\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eshared on Perry\u0026#39;s Instagram\u003c/a\u003e, splices Butker\u0026#39;s comments to sound like he was showing support for the LGBTQ community. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The road ahead is bright, things are changing, society is shifting and people young and old are embracing diversity, equity and inclusion,\u0026#34; Butker says in the edited video. \u0026#34;With that said, I want to say happy Pride Month to all of you.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73951463007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u0026#34;Firework\u0026#34; singer concluded the post with a message for her LGBTQ fans.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Fixed this for my girls, my graduates, and my gays — you can do anything, congratulations and happy pride 🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍⚧️ 🧡\u0026#34; Perry wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCheck out how other stars are celebrating Pride and showing their love for the LGBTQ community.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "35626395"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eMaren Morris comes out as bisexual months after Ryan Hurd divorce\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/12/14/maren-morris-ryan-hurd-divorce-dating/71922271007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMaren Morris\u003c/a\u003e is for the guys \u003cem\u003eand\u003c/em\u003e the girls.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The Bones\u0026#34; singer, who is on her RSVP Redux tour, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/health-wellness/2024/06/11/maren-morris-coming-lgbtq/74052068007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ecame out as bisexual on\u003c/a\u003e June 9 following a show in Arizona where she waved a rainbow for Pride Month.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;happy to be the B in LGBTQ+,\u0026#34; the 34-year-old captioned her post on Instagram. \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8AGJTTJqdm/?img_index\u003d6\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ehappy pride\u003c/a\u003e 🌈.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74066395007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMorris\u0026#39; declaration comes after she filed for divorce from her singer-songwriter husband Ryan Hurd, 37, after five years of marriage on Oct. 2, according to documents obtained by \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2023/10/17/maren-morris-husband-ryan-hurd-file-for-divorce-after-five-years/71215087007/\"\u003eThe Nashville Tennessean\u003c/a\u003e, part of the USA TODAY Network.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;Happy pride\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/10/maren-morris-bisexual/74042432007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eMaren Morris comes out as bisexual months after divorce filing\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJessica Madsen shares pride for same-sex relationship\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eJessica Madsen kicked off Pride Month with a joyful update on her love life.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/05/17/nicola-coughlan-bridgerton-season-3-interview/73725101007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Bridgerton\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; star shared a series of LGBTQ imagery in an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7qtJkwMu4h/?img_index\u003d1\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram post\u003c/a\u003e Saturday, including a GIF of herself wearing a colorful tie-dye top and rainbow-colored jewel makeup.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;In love with a woman, loud about it and proud about it! 🌈\u0026#34; Madsen wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73951462007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAdele shows support for Pride Month by calling out concert heckler\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/02/adele-calls-out-las-vegas-concertgoer-pride-sucks/73947470007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eAdele\u003c/a\u003e slammed an audience member who shouted, \u0026#34;Pride sucks!\u0026#34;, during a recent performance in her \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/02/27/adele-postpones-las-vegas-residency-march-dates-illness/72765401007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLas Vegas concert residency\u003c/a\u003e, according to a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/dellyfromdablok/status/1797110056028139671\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003evideo shared on social m\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/dellyfromdablok/status/1797110056028139671\"\u003eedia\u003c/a\u003e Saturday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn the clip, the British pop singer initially appeared taken aback after being interrupted by the heckler but grew angry after realizing what they had said.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Did you come to my (expletive) show and just say that Pride sucks?\u0026#34; an incensed Adele asked. \u0026#34;Are you (expletive) stupid?\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe crowd erupted in cheers after the 16-time Grammy winner told this \u0026#34;ridiculous\u0026#34; concertgoer, \u0026#34;You\u0026#39;ve got nothing nice to say, shut up, all right?\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;Shut up!\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/02/adele-calls-out-las-vegas-concertgoer-pride-sucks/73947470007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAdele calls out \u0026#39;stupid\u0026#39; concertgoer for shouting \u0026#39;Pride sucks\u0026#39; at her show\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAdam Lambert rocks out at WeHo Pride\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/10/adam-lambert-changes-pronoun-whataya-want-from-me/73627292007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eAdam Lambert\u003c/a\u003e made Tinseltown sparkle with queer magic.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/05/02/every-american-idol-winner-ranked-worst-best/9617596002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;American Idol\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; alum took the stage at WeHo Pride and rocked out in a black sheer top, sleek leather jacket and matching pants for the performance, which included the premiere of Lambert’s new song \u0026#34;Lube.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;WeHo Pride, you all brought the fire! 😈\u0026#34; Lambert \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7sggT5x3Rf/?img_index\u003d1\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewrote on Instagram\u003c/a\u003e. \u0026#34;It was amazing to perform \u0026#39;Lube\u0026#39; live for the first time. Your energy was electrifying!\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73951458007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/28/adam-lambert-interview/73733086007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMay interview with USA TODAY\u003c/a\u003e, Lambert reflected on the political pushback faced by the LGBTQ community.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I think people are scared of confidence and scared of pride and scared of what they don\u0026#39;t understand,\u0026#34; Lambert said. \u0026#34;I feel sorry for those that are controlled by that kind of fear.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eAdam Lambert: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/28/adam-lambert-interview/73733086007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSinger talks Pride, announces new EP \u0026#39;Afters\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eKeke Palmer joins JoJo Siwa for Pride Month dance\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/03/12/keke-palmer-jimmy-fallon-password-season-2-celebrity-guests/72941293007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKeke Palmer\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/health-wellness/2024/04/10/jojo-siwa-music-video-hate-bullies-online-response/73275764007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJoJo Siwa\u003c/a\u003e make for a funky double rainbow.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003ePalmer shared an \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7sUMYaJNCc/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram video\u003c/a\u003e of herself dancing with the singer and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/11/02/dance-moms-reunion-special-jojo-siwa-cast-members/71419544007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Dance Mom\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/11/02/dance-moms-reunion-special-jojo-siwa-cast-members/71419544007/\"\u003es\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; alum Saturday ahead of a Pride Month performance. The ladies playfully whipped their arms to a groovy dance beat. \u0026#34;Get up here! Let\u0026#39;s dance,\u0026#34; Palmer lip-synced in the video.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73951452007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e“When you (and) @itsjojosiwa are both performing at Pittsburgh Pride and need a (little) dance warm up 😂😂😂\u0026#34; Palmer wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Mary Walrath-Holdridge, Brendan Morrow, Ralphie Aversa and Naledi Ushe, USA TODAY\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

contentBody:
{
  "contentBody": [{
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73766397007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/05/26/katy-perry-returns-las-vegas-resorts-world-residency/9927676002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKaty Perry\u003c/a\u003e is celebrating \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/nation/2024/06/01/pride-month-explained/73937777007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePride Month\u003c/a\u003e with a dash of sass.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe popstar marked the first day of the monthlong LGBTQ celebration with an edited video of a recent commencement speech given by NFL player \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/2024/05/16/harrison-butker-speech-internet-nfl-celebs-react/73713932007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eHarrison Butker\u003c/a\u003e. The Kansas City Chiefs kicker drew controversy earlier this month for his remarks, some of which took aim at the LGBTQ community and \u0026#34;dangerous gender ideologies.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe revised clip, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/C7sSJyovXU7/?igsh\u003ddGg4ZDljdDRoYTI4\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eshared on Perry\u0026#39;s Instagram\u003c/a\u003e, splices Butker\u0026#39;s comments to sound like he was showing support for the LGBTQ community. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The road ahead is bright, things are changing, society is shifting and people young and old are embracing diversity, equity and inclusion,\u0026#34; Butker says in the edited video. \u0026#34;With that said, I want to say happy Pride Month to all of you.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73951463007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u0026#34;Firework\u0026#34; singer concluded the post with a message for her LGBTQ fans.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Fixed this for my girls, my graduates, and my gays — you can do anything, congratulations and happy pride 🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍⚧️ 🧡\u0026#34; Perry wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eCheck out how other stars are celebrating Pride and showing their love for the LGBTQ community.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "35626395"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eMaren Morris comes out as bisexual months after Ryan Hurd divorce\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
