    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/03/19/jake-gyllenhaal-staph-infection-hand-glass-road-house/73027469007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJake Gyllenhaal\u003c/a\u003e sees some benefits to being legally blind.\u003c/p\u003e"
