  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn March, the Oscar nominee revealed he sliced his hand with glass and developed a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/03/19/jake-gyllenhaal-staph-infection-hand-glass-road-house/73027469007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003estaph infection\u003c/a\u003e while filming the remake of the 1989 action movie starring \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2019/08/15/i-am-patrick-swayze-documentary-inspiring-moments/1994009001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePatrick Swayze\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
