body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.nationaldaycalendar.com/national-day/national-best-friends-day-june-8\"\u003eNational Best Friends Day\u003c/a\u003e is a celebration that occurs annually on June 8 to honor those who hold the title of best friend in our lives. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBest friend is a term that we use to define a person that has been there for us through thick and thin. This person is someone we can call to share a meme, a video, cry, laugh, confide in and ultimately trust. It isn\u0026#39;t a title that is just given to anyone.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn that regard, celebrities are just like us. Because everyone, even the world\u0026#39;s biggest stars, needs a bestie.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn honor of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2022/06/08/national-best-friends-day-look-celebrity/7552471001/\"\u003eNational Best Friends Day\u003c/a\u003e, we\u0026#39;re highlighting some famous celebrity best friend duos.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eCelebrating National Best Friends Day: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/humankind/2024/06/05/emotional-surprise-reunion-of-graduate-and-her-best-friend/73989246007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eWatch this girl surprise her bestie at graduation\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "71811658007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eNational Best Friends Day 2024: A look at celeb besties\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eOprah Winfrey and Gayle King\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72482389007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eA list of notable celebrity besties arguably can\u0026#39;t exist without mentioning these two. They became friends as journalists working at the same Baltimore, Maryland tv station in 1976, according to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.oprahdaily.com/life/relationships-love/a26965035/oprah-and-gayle-friendship/\"\u003eOprahDaily.com\u003c/a\u003e. And the rest as they say is history. King often appeared as a guest on \u0026#34;The Oprah Winfrey Show\u0026#34; which started in 1986. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74026308007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn June 2024, Winfrey hosted the wedding of King\u0026#39;s son and daughter-in-law at her home. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74025751007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eSnoop Dogg and Martha Stewart\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe unlikely pair developed a friendship in 2008 when Snoop appeared on \u0026#39;The Martha Stewart Show\u0026#34;. The dynamic duo has been kicking it ever since even partnering together on several business ventures such as \u0026#34;Martha \u0026amp; Snoop\u0026#39;s Potluck Party\u0026#34; which first aired in 2016.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "86752650"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eTina Fey and Amy Poehler\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eLaughter and jokes is certainly the center of this friendship. Fey and Poehler have known each other for years and have worked alongside each other in movies including the 2008 comedy film \u0026#34;Baby Mama\u0026#34;. The pair have shared the stage with each other hosting the Golden Globes several times and most recently toured the country during their \u0026#34;Restless Leg\u0026#34; comedy tour.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74025628007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eBen Affleck and Matt Damon\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe pair met when they were young kids and have been friends ever since. They have worked on many iconic movies together including \u0026#34;Glory Daze\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;Good Will Hunting\u0026#34; which they co-write and won Oscars for. Recently, their friendship was on display in the popular \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/02/13/ben-affleck-dunkin-super-bowl-commercial-dunkings-song/72588529007/\"\u003e2024 Super Bowl commercial for Dunkin\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74024772007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eLily Tomlin and Jane Fonda\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74020002007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBefore working together on the movie \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0080319/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;9 to 5\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e Jane Fonda met Lily Tomlin behind the scenes of her one-woman Broadway show \u003ca href\u003d\"https://playbill.com/production/appearing-nitely-biltmore-theatre-vault-0000001545\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Appearing Nitely\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e that came out in 1977. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eTom Brady and Rob Gronkowski \u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74021519007"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74021513007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis dynamic duo stole the hearts of many \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.patriots.com/\"\u003eNew England Pat\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.patriots.com/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003er\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.patriots.com/\"\u003eiots\u003c/a\u003e fans when they started playing together in 2010. The quarterback and tight end continued their friendship and moved their fan base to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.buccaneers.com/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTampa Bay Buccaneers\u003c/a\u003e where they retired in 2023. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eNicki Minaj and Ariana Grande \u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74019732007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eSince collaborating on their hit song \u003ca href\u003d\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0puf9yIluy9W0vpMEUoAnN?autoplay\u003dtrue\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Bang Bang\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e in 2014 with singer-songwriter Jessie J, rapper Nicki Minaj and singer Ariana Grande have worked on many songs together since they have met. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJustin Bieber and Jaden Smith \u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74021792007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMany celebrity besties start their friendships after working together and that is no different for popstar Justin Bieber and rapper and actor Jaden Smith. The two worked on the song \u003ca href\u003d\"https://open.spotify.com/album/4aCRpFro5zK8We6tWnce4W\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Never Say Never\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e 14 years ago and have remained close ever since. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eZendaya and Bella Thorne \u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74020209007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eWhile starring on the Disney Channel \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.disneyplus.com/series/shake-it-up/75Diu61Vt0bi?distributionPartner\u003dgoogle\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Shake It Up\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e acting as best friends, Bella Thorne and Zendaya became besties in real life after the shows premiere in 2010. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eDwayne \u0026#39;The Rock\u0026#39; Johnson and Kevin Hart \u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74021866007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFor eight years comedian Kevin Hart and Dwayne \u0026#34;The Rock\u0026#34; Johnson have been scene poking fun at each other on the big screen and off. The hilarious friendship is most recognized by their roles in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt1489889/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Central Intelligence\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt2283362/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Jumanji: Welcome to the Jungle.\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eTisha Campbell and Tichina Arnold\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74020128007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eYour best friend can be your work bestie as these celebrity actresses show. Tisha Campbell and Tichina Arnold were friends long before making their debut on the hit comedy sitcom \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0103488/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Martin\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e. In 1986, they were the singers in the movie \u0026#34;Little Shop of Horrors\u0026#34;.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAnderson Cooper and Andy Cohen \u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74022585007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eYou can start the year off right with these two besties. The duo shows what working with your best friend actually looks like. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eSerena Williams and Meghan Markle\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74022638007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis bond should show you how your best friend should show up for you no matter what. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eBad Bunny and J Balvin \u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74022112007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThese reguetóneros have created music that has topped the Billboard charts separately but the two released their album called \u003ca href\u003d\"https://open.spotify.com/album/6ylFfzx32ICw4L1A7YWNLN?autoplay\u003dtrue\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Oasis\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e in 2019 that showed their ability to share the spotlight.  \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eH.E.R. and Kristy Sarah\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis duo is fairly new to the celeb bestie scene but appear to have been friends for a while. The Grammy award winning singer H.E.R. (also known as Gabriella Wilson) and her influencer bestie \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@kristy.sarah\"\u003eKristy Sarah\u003c/a\u003e routinely post themselves doing funny best friend activities on TikTok racking up thousands of views and comments from online fans.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74025853007"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74025855007"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74025861007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eHow you can celebrate National Best Friends Day\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73986970007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eTo mark the day, you can post your best friend on social media to show your appreciation using the hashtag #BestFriendsDay.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis would also be a good day to grab your bestie for a day of fun together like going for lunch or dinner, shopping or an outdoor activity. And if your best friend is long distance, a phone call or video call session would definitely do the trick. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "6910031001"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eAhjané Forbes is a reporter on the National Trending Team at USA TODAY. Ahjané covers breaking news, car recalls, crime, health, lottery and public policy stories. Email her at \u003cu\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"mailto:aforbes@gannett.com\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eaforbes@gannett.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/u\u003e. Follow her on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/forbesfineest/?hl\u003den\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.threads.net/@forbesfineest\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThreads\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/forbesfineest\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eX (Twitter)\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eBianca Harris is an editor on the National Trending Team at USA TODAY. Email her at bharris@gannett.com.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.nationaldaycalendar.com/national-day/national-best-friends-day-june-8\"\u003eNational Best Friends Day\u003c/a\u003e is a celebration that occurs annually on June 8 to honor those who hold the title of best friend in our lives. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBest friend is a term that we use to define a person that has been there for us through thick and thin. This person is someone we can call to share a meme, a video, cry, laugh, confide in and ultimately trust. It isn\u0026#39;t a title that is just given to anyone.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn that regard, celebrities are just like us. Because everyone, even the world\u0026#39;s biggest stars, needs a bestie.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn honor of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2022/06/08/national-best-friends-day-look-celebrity/7552471001/\"\u003eNational Best Friends Day\u003c/a\u003e, we\u0026#39;re highlighting some famous celebrity best friend duos.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eCelebrating National Best Friends Day: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/humankind/2024/06/05/emotional-surprise-reunion-of-graduate-and-her-best-friend/73989246007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eWatch this girl surprise her bestie at graduation\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "71811658007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eNational Best Friends Day 2024: A look at celeb besties\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eOprah Winfrey and Gayle King\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72482389007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eA list of notable celebrity besties arguably can\u0026#39;t exist without mentioning these two. They became friends as journalists working at the same Baltimore, Maryland tv station in 1976, according to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.oprahdaily.com/life/relationships-love/a26965035/oprah-and-gayle-friendship/\"\u003eOprahDaily.com\u003c/a\u003e. And the rest as they say is history. King often appeared as a guest on \u0026#34;The Oprah Winfrey Show\u0026#34; which started in 1986. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74026308007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn June 2024, Winfrey hosted the wedding of King\u0026#39;s son and daughter-in-law at her home. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74025751007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eSnoop Dogg and Martha Stewart\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe unlikely pair developed a friendship in 2008 when Snoop appeared on \u0026#39;The Martha Stewart Show\u0026#34;. The dynamic duo has been kicking it ever since even partnering together on several business ventures such as \u0026#34;Martha \u0026amp; Snoop\u0026#39;s Potluck Party\u0026#34; which first aired in 2016.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "86752650"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eTina Fey and Amy Poehler\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eLaughter and jokes is certainly the center of this friendship. Fey and Poehler have known each other for years and have worked alongside each other in movies including the 2008 comedy film \u0026#34;Baby Mama\u0026#34;. The pair have shared the stage with each other hosting the Golden Globes several times and most recently toured the country during their \u0026#34;Restless Leg\u0026#34; comedy tour.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74025628007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eBen Affleck and Matt Damon\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe pair met when they were young kids and have been friends ever since. They have worked on many iconic movies together including \u0026#34;Glory Daze\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;Good Will Hunting\u0026#34; which they co-write and won Oscars for. Recently, their friendship was on display in the popular \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/02/13/ben-affleck-dunkin-super-bowl-commercial-dunkings-song/72588529007/\"\u003e2024 Super Bowl commercial for Dunkin\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74024772007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eLily Tomlin and Jane Fonda\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74020002007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBefore working together on the movie \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0080319/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;9 to 5\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e Jane Fonda met Lily Tomlin behind the scenes of her one-woman Broadway show \u003ca href\u003d\"https://playbill.com/production/appearing-nitely-biltmore-theatre-vault-0000001545\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Appearing Nitely\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e that came out in 1977. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eTom Brady and Rob Gronkowski \u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74021519007"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74021513007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis dynamic duo stole the hearts of many \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.patriots.com/\"\u003eNew England Pat\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.patriots.com/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003er\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.patriots.com/\"\u003eiots\u003c/a\u003e fans when they started playing together in 2010. The quarterback and tight end continued their friendship and moved their fan base to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.buccaneers.com/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTampa Bay Buccaneers\u003c/a\u003e where they retired in 2023. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eNicki Minaj and Ariana Grande \u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74019732007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eSince collaborating on their hit song \u003ca href\u003d\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0puf9yIluy9W0vpMEUoAnN?autoplay\u003dtrue\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Bang Bang\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e in 2014 with singer-songwriter Jessie J, rapper Nicki Minaj and singer Ariana Grande have worked on many songs together since they have met. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJustin Bieber and Jaden Smith \u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74021792007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMany celebrity besties start their friendships after working together and that is no different for popstar Justin Bieber and rapper and actor Jaden Smith. The two worked on the song \u003ca href\u003d\"https://open.spotify.com/album/4aCRpFro5zK8We6tWnce4W\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Never Say Never\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e 14 years ago and have remained close ever since. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eZendaya and Bella Thorne \u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74020209007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eWhile starring on the Disney Channel \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.disneyplus.com/series/shake-it-up/75Diu61Vt0bi?distributionPartner\u003dgoogle\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Shake It Up\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e acting as best friends, Bella Thorne and Zendaya became besties in real life after the shows premiere in 2010. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eDwayne \u0026#39;The Rock\u0026#39; Johnson and Kevin Hart \u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74021866007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFor eight years comedian Kevin Hart and Dwayne \u0026#34;The Rock\u0026#34; Johnson have been scene poking fun at each other on the big screen and off. The hilarious friendship is most recognized by their roles in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt1489889/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Central Intelligence\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt2283362/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Jumanji: Welcome to the Jungle.\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eTisha Campbell and Tichina Arnold\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74020128007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eYour best friend can be your work bestie as these celebrity actresses show. Tisha Campbell and Tichina Arnold were friends long before making their debut on the hit comedy sitcom \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0103488/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Martin\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e. In 1986, they were the singers in the movie \u0026#34;Little Shop of Horrors\u0026#34;.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAnderson Cooper and Andy Cohen \u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74022585007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eYou can start the year off right with these two besties. The duo shows what working with your best friend actually looks like. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eSerena Williams and Meghan Markle\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74022638007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis bond should show you how your best friend should show up for you no matter what. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eBad Bunny and J Balvin \u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74022112007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThese reguetóneros have created music that has topped the Billboard charts separately but the two released their album called \u003ca href\u003d\"https://open.spotify.com/album/6ylFfzx32ICw4L1A7YWNLN?autoplay\u003dtrue\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Oasis\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e in 2019 that showed their ability to share the spotlight.  \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eH.E.R. and Kristy Sarah\u003c/h3\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis duo is fairly new to the celeb bestie scene but appear to have been friends for a while. The Grammy award winning singer H.E.R. (also known as Gabriella Wilson) and her influencer bestie \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@kristy.sarah\"\u003eKristy Sarah\u003c/a\u003e routinely post themselves doing funny best friend activities on TikTok racking up thousands of views and comments from online fans.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74025853007"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74025855007"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74025861007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eHow you can celebrate National Best Friends Day\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73986970007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eTo mark the day, you can post your best friend on social media to show your appreciation using the hashtag #BestFriendsDay.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis would also be a good day to grab your bestie for a day of fun together like going for lunch or dinner, shopping or an outdoor activity. And if your best friend is long distance, a phone call or video call session would definitely do the trick. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "6910031001"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eAhjané Forbes is a reporter on the National Trending Team at USA TODAY. Ahjané covers breaking news, car recalls, crime, health, lottery and public policy stories. Email her at \u003cu\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"mailto:aforbes@gannett.com\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eaforbes@gannett.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/u\u003e. Follow her on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/forbesfineest/?hl\u003den\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.threads.net/@forbesfineest\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThreads\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/forbesfineest\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eX (Twitter)\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eBianca Harris is an editor on the National Trending Team at USA TODAY. Email her at bharris@gannett.com.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

contentBody:
{
  "contentBody": [{
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.nationaldaycalendar.com/national-day/national-best-friends-day-june-8\"\u003eNational Best Friends Day\u003c/a\u003e is a celebration that occurs annually on June 8 to honor those who hold the title of best friend in our lives. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eBest friend is a term that we use to define a person that has been there for us through thick and thin. This person is someone we can call to share a meme, a video, cry, laugh, confide in and ultimately trust. It isn\u0026#39;t a title that is just given to anyone.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn that regard, celebrities are just like us. Because everyone, even the world\u0026#39;s biggest stars, needs a bestie.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn honor of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2022/06/08/national-best-friends-day-look-celebrity/7552471001/\"\u003eNational Best Friends Day\u003c/a\u003e, we\u0026#39;re highlighting some famous celebrity best friend duos.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eCelebrating National Best Friends Day: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/humankind/2024/06/05/emotional-surprise-reunion-of-graduate-and-her-best-friend/73989246007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eWatch this girl surprise her bestie at graduation\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "71811658007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eNational Best Friends Day 2024: A look at celeb besties\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eOprah Winfrey and Gayle King\u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "72482389007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eA list of notable celebrity besties arguably can\u0026#39;t exist without mentioning these two. They became friends as journalists working at the same Baltimore, Maryland tv station in 1976, according to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.oprahdaily.com/life/relationships-love/a26965035/oprah-and-gayle-friendship/\"\u003eOprahDaily.com\u003c/a\u003e. And the rest as they say is history. King often appeared as a guest on \u0026#34;The Oprah Winfrey Show\u0026#34; which started in 1986. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74026308007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn June 2024, Winfrey hosted the wedding of King\u0026#39;s son and daughter-in-law at her home. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74025751007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eSnoop Dogg and Martha Stewart\u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe unlikely pair developed a friendship in 2008 when Snoop appeared on \u0026#39;The Martha Stewart Show\u0026#34;. The dynamic duo has been kicking it ever since even partnering together on several business ventures such as \u0026#34;Martha \u0026amp; Snoop\u0026#39;s Potluck Party\u0026#34; which first aired in 2016.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "86752650"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eTina Fey and Amy Poehler\u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eLaughter and jokes is certainly the center of this friendship. Fey and Poehler have known each other for years and have worked alongside each other in movies including the 2008 comedy film \u0026#34;Baby Mama\u0026#34;. The pair have shared the stage with each other hosting the Golden Globes several times and most recently toured the country during their \u0026#34;Restless Leg\u0026#34; comedy tour.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74025628007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eBen Affleck and Matt Damon\u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe pair met when they were young kids and have been friends ever since. They have worked on many iconic movies together including \u0026#34;Glory Daze\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;Good Will Hunting\u0026#34; which they co-write and won Oscars for. Recently, their friendship was on display in the popular \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/02/13/ben-affleck-dunkin-super-bowl-commercial-dunkings-song/72588529007/\"\u003e2024 Super Bowl commercial for Dunkin\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74024772007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eLily Tomlin and Jane Fonda\u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74020002007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eBefore working together on the movie \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0080319/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;9 to 5\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e Jane Fonda met Lily Tomlin behind the scenes of her one-woman Broadway show \u003ca href\u003d\"https://playbill.com/production/appearing-nitely-biltmore-theatre-vault-0000001545\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Appearing Nitely\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e that came out in 1977. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eTom Brady and Rob Gronkowski \u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74021519007"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74021513007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis dynamic duo stole the hearts of many \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.patriots.com/\"\u003eNew England Pat\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.patriots.com/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003er\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.patriots.com/\"\u003eiots\u003c/a\u003e fans when they started playing together in 2010. The quarterback and tight end continued their friendship and moved their fan base to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.buccaneers.com/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTampa Bay Buccaneers\u003c/a\u003e where they retired in 2023. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eNicki Minaj and Ariana Grande \u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74019732007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eSince collaborating on their hit song \u003ca href\u003d\"https://open.spotify.com/track/0puf9yIluy9W0vpMEUoAnN?autoplay\u003dtrue\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Bang Bang\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e in 2014 with singer-songwriter Jessie J, rapper Nicki Minaj and singer Ariana Grande have worked on many songs together since they have met. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJustin Bieber and Jaden Smith \u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74021792007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eMany celebrity besties start their friendships after working together and that is no different for popstar Justin Bieber and rapper and actor Jaden Smith. The two worked on the song \u003ca href\u003d\"https://open.spotify.com/album/4aCRpFro5zK8We6tWnce4W\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Never Say Never\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e 14 years ago and have remained close ever since. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eZendaya and Bella Thorne \u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74020209007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eWhile starring on the Disney Channel \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.disneyplus.com/series/shake-it-up/75Diu61Vt0bi?distributionPartner\u003dgoogle\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Shake It Up\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e acting as best friends, Bella Thorne and Zendaya became besties in real life after the shows premiere in 2010. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eDwayne \u0026#39;The Rock\u0026#39; Johnson and Kevin Hart \u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74021866007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eFor eight years comedian Kevin Hart and Dwayne \u0026#34;The Rock\u0026#34; Johnson have been scene poking fun at each other on the big screen and off. The hilarious friendship is most recognized by their roles in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt1489889/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Central Intelligence\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt2283362/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Jumanji: Welcome to the Jungle.\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eTisha Campbell and Tichina Arnold\u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74020128007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eYour best friend can be your work bestie as these celebrity actresses show. Tisha Campbell and Tichina Arnold were friends long before making their debut on the hit comedy sitcom \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0103488/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Martin\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e. In 1986, they were the singers in the movie \u0026#34;Little Shop of Horrors\u0026#34;.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAnderson Cooper and Andy Cohen \u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74022585007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eYou can start the year off right with these two besties. The duo shows what working with your best friend actually looks like. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eSerena Williams and Meghan Markle\u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74022638007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis bond should show you how your best friend should show up for you no matter what. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eBad Bunny and J Balvin \u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74022112007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThese reguetóneros have created music that has topped the Billboard charts separately but the two released their album called \u003ca href\u003d\"https://open.spotify.com/album/6ylFfzx32ICw4L1A7YWNLN?autoplay\u003dtrue\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Oasis\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e in 2019 that showed their ability to share the spotlight.  \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eH.E.R. and Kristy Sarah\u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis duo is fairly new to the celeb bestie scene but appear to have been friends for a while. The Grammy award winning singer H.E.R. (also known as Gabriella Wilson) and her influencer bestie \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@kristy.sarah\"\u003eKristy Sarah\u003c/a\u003e routinely post themselves doing funny best friend activities on TikTok racking up thousands of views and comments from online fans.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74025853007"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74025855007"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74025861007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eHow you can celebrate National Best Friends Day\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73986970007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eTo mark the day, you can post your best friend on social media to show your appreciation using the hashtag #BestFriendsDay.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis would also be a good day to grab your bestie for a day of fun together like going for lunch or dinner, shopping or an outdoor activity. And if your best friend is long distance, a phone call or video call session would definitely do the trick. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "6910031001"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eAhjané Forbes is a reporter on the National Trending Team at USA TODAY. Ahjané covers breaking news, car recalls, crime, health, lottery and public policy stories. Email her at \u003cu\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"mailto:aforbes@gannett.com\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eaforbes@gannett.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/u\u003e. Follow her on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/forbesfineest/?hl\u003den\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.threads.net/@forbesfineest\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThreads\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/forbesfineest\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eX (Twitter)\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eBianca Harris is an editor on the National Trending Team at USA TODAY. Email her at bharris@gannett.com.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "8057886001"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/07/debra-byrd-vocal-coach-american-idol-dead/72885228007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJennifer Hudson\u003c/a\u003e isn’t one for kissing and telling, but one thing is clear — she is on cloud nine with her boyfriend \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/01/22/jennifer-hudson-common-show-relationship/72309104007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eCommon\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHudson gushed about her rapper beau during an interview with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://people.com/jennifer-hudson-says-everything-is-wonderful-dating-common-daytime-emmys-exclusive-8660524\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePeople magazine\u003c/a\u003e at the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/06/08/dick-van-dyke-daytime-emmy-awards-oldest-winner/74026017007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e2024 Daytime Emmy Awards\u003c/a\u003e. But the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/05/02/every-american-idol-winner-ranked-worst-best/9617596002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;American Idol\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e alum was mum in offering any details on the couple’s relationship.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Everything is wonderful,\u0026#34; Hudson told the outlet. \u0026#34;That\u0026#39;s all you need to know.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHudson’s comments follow Common’s appearance on the singer’s talk show, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2022/09/12/jennifer-hudson-daytime-talks-new-egot-star-reveals-big-challenges/8005881001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;The Jennifer Hudson Show,\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e earlier this year, a conversation that drew attention after the two had been the subject of dating rumors. During the interview, Hudson and Common coyly discussed their dating lives without naming who they were involved with.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72397023007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJennifer Hudson, Common talk dating on ‘The Jennifer Hudson Show’\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn January, Common \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/01/22/jennifer-hudson-common-show-relationship/72309104007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eappeared as a guest on \u0026#34;The Jennifer Hudson Show,\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e where he discussed his love life. In the episode, Hudson playfully pressed Common, who arrived with flowers for her and said he loves \u0026#34;being in your presence.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Let\u0026#39;s get down to business, Mr. Common,\u0026#34; Hudson said at the time. \u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m a host, and so I have to ask you this question because everybody always wants to know this. Are you dating anyone?\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe crowd cheered as the Grammy-winning rapper laughed nervously. \u0026#34;So, yes,\u0026#34; he said. \u0026#34;And I\u0026#39;m in a relationship that is (with) one of the most beautiful people I\u0026#39;ve ever met in life.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73698116007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJennifer Hudson and Common: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/01/22/jennifer-hudson-common-show-relationship/72309104007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eRapper talks dating EGOT winner\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCommon then continued and clarified that he was talking about Hudson, alluding to the actress-singer\u0026#39;s accolades: \u0026#34;She\u0026#39;s smart. She loves God. She has something real down to earth about her. She\u0026#39;s talented. But I set my standard kind of high because she had to have an EGOT. She had to win an Oscar on her first movie. I set my standard high. She had to get her own talk show.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e“The Light” emcee then asked Hudson about her own love life, and she confirmed she\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;dating as well\u0026#34; and is \u0026#34;very happy.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCommon later discussed the interview on the \u0026#34;Today\u0026#34; show, saying he and Hudson \u0026#34;had a little fun.\u0026#34; He added: \u0026#34;I felt like, man, why not just be loving and honest with who I am and who we are?\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJennifer Hudson pays tribute: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/07/debra-byrd-vocal-coach-american-idol-dead/72885228007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSinger and Barry Manilow mourn death of \u0026#39;American Idol\u0026#39; vocal coach Debra Byrd\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCommon stressed that he is \u0026#34;very private\u0026#34; about his relationships, which are \u0026#34;not for public consumption.\u0026#34; But \u0026#34;at the end of the day,\u0026#34; he added, \u0026#34;we were on her show. We had a good time.\u0026#34; He also said he has realized he is the \u0026#34;marrying type\u0026#34; and is open to tying the knot \u0026#34;at some point in my life.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "8057886001"
    }, {
