body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73878785007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/28/shannen-doherty-michael-landon-little-house-on-the-prairie/73875173007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMichael Landon\u003c/a\u003e failed to prioritize his health before he was diagnosed with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/2022/07/06/doctors-hope-treatments-pancreatic-cancerfdg-g/7538295001/?gnt-cfr\u003d1\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ethe cancer\u003c/a\u003e that would ultimately kill him, according to his daughter. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eLeslie Landon Matthews, daughter of the late \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/04/17/little-house-on-the-prairie-at-50/73098495007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLittle House on the Prairie\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; actor, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.foxnews.com/entertainment/little-house-star-michael-landon-stubborn-avoided-doctors-ahead-fatal-cancer-diagnosis-daughter\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.foxnews.com/entertainment/little-house-star-michael-landon-stubborn-avoided-doctors-ahead-fatal-cancer-diagnosis-daughter\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003etold Fox News in an interview\u003c/a\u003e published Sunday that her famous dad was stubborn and resisted scheduling physicals during his life. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The one thing that I know was part of my dad\u0026#39;s personality was his stubbornness,\u0026#34; she shared. \u0026#34;And I don\u0026#39;t think staying on top of his health was a priority. I think he put it aside. I know that my mom often talked about (how) getting him to his physicals was always a feat.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74035701007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShe added that by the time her dad began experiencing an \u0026#34;uncontrollable pain\u0026#34; in his stomach on vacation, he \u0026#34;couldn\u0026#39;t ignore it anymore\u0026#34; and had to fly home early to see a doctor. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eLandon was diagnosed with pancreatic cancer in April 1991 and died three months later, on July 1. He was 54. The actor played Charles Ingalls on \u0026#34;Little House on the Prairie,\u0026#34; while Landon Matthews appeared on the show as Etta Plum, a school teacher. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eSee them now: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/04/17/little-house-on-the-prairie-tv-show-50-years/73094869007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eMelissa Gilbert and stars from \u0026#39;Little House on the Prairie\u0026#39; reunite\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eSpeaking with Fox News, Landon Matthews reflected that if her father was alive today, \u0026#34;He would say, \u0026#39;Boy, I blew it. I really should have been staying on top of my health every year and making sure I was getting full checkups.\u0026#39; \u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn \u0026#34;The Tonight Show\u0026#34; in 1991, Landon said \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dfl49E8JXpRk\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dfl49E8JXpRk\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ehe was working on maintaining high spirits\u003c/a\u003e during his cancer battle. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;For any of those families out there who have a relative who has cancer, they know how tough the fight is and how important the mental attitude is,\u0026#34; he said. \u0026#34;You pull together and you keep a very, very up attitude, \u0026#39;I\u0026#39;m going to beat it\u0026#39; kind of thing, because mentally is more than 50% of your medicine.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eSign up for our Watch Party newsletter:  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eWe deliver the best movie and TV recommendations to your inbox\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eLast month, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/02/shannen-doherty-cancer-journey-letting-go-stuff/73176481007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eShannen Doherty\u003c/a\u003e paid tribute to Landon on her \u0026#34;Let\u0026#39;s Be Clear\u0026#34; podcast, noting that having him as a mentor while she starred on \u0026#34;Little House on the Prairie\u0026#34; spurred her passion for acting.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;He was just unbelievable,\u0026#34; Doherty said. \u0026#34;So, so, so talented, so kind, so considerate. It really helped shape me.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "3364175002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;Little House on the Prairie\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/04/17/little-house-on-the-prairie-at-50/73098495007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eHow star Melissa Gilbert shaped a generation of women\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eLandon was survived by nine children. Earlier this year, Landon Matthews and her brother Michael Landon Jr. \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/04/17/little-house-on-the-prairie-tv-show-50-years/73094869007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eattended a cast reunion and festival\u003c/a\u003e in Simi Valley, California, celebrating the show\u0026#39;s 50th anniversary. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;When we pulled up, we didn\u0026#39;t know, there might be a line, it\u0026#39;s all the way around the corner,\u0026#34; Landon Jr. said at the event. \u0026#34;Oh, my gosh, this has been unbelievable. And you\u0026#39;ve totally rekindled our hearts for the show and the love of the show. Thank you for that.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Laura Trujillo, USA TODAY\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
