  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eLandon was survived by nine children. Earlier this year, Landon Matthews and her brother Michael Landon Jr. \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/04/17/little-house-on-the-prairie-tv-show-50-years/73094869007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eattended a cast reunion and festival\u003c/a\u003e in Simi Valley, California, celebrating the show\u0026#39;s 50th anniversary. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;When we pulled up, we didn\u0026#39;t know, there might be a line, it\u0026#39;s all the way around the corner,\u0026#34; Landon Jr. said at the event. \u0026#34;Oh, my gosh, this has been unbelievable. And you\u0026#39;ve totally rekindled our hearts for the show and the love of the show. Thank you for that.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Laura Trujillo, USA TODAY\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

