body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72303363007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/16/naomi-watts-kai-schreiber-dior-fall-2024-show/73349462007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eNaomi Watts\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/picture-gallery/entertainment/movies/2020/09/22/almost-famous-20th-anniversary-kate-hudson-where-are-they-now/3491977001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eBilly Crudup\u003c/a\u003e have tied the knot \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/06/11/naomi-watts-billy-crudup-married-see-wedding-photo/70310831007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003efor a second time\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOver the weekend, photographer Ben Watts, Watts\u0026#39; brother, posted video of the couple walking down the aisle in a Mexico City ceremony.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Wot a weekend Naomi x Billy Mexico City,\u0026#34; the photographer captioned the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8AxqlLRXe6/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eblack-and- white video\u003c/a\u003e, set to the tune of the traditional \u0026#34;Wedding March.\u0026#34; The video shows an elegant venue with Crudup, 55, walking down the aisle in a dark suit and tie with his son, William Atticus Parker, and the British actress\u0026#39; daughter, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/16/naomi-watts-kai-schreiber-dior-fall-2024-show/73349462007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKai Schreiber\u003c/a\u003e, serving as a bridesmaid.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNaomi Watts, 55, is later shown walking down the aisle in an off-white, cowl-neckline wedding dress and veil, holding a bouquet as her son, Sasha Schreiber, gives her away. She then joins the \u0026#34;Almost Famous\u0026#34; actor on a reflective platform.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72731737007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eLater, the couple kiss after seemingly sharing their nuptials and return down the aisle hand in hand in celebration.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to Naomi Watts and Crudup\u0026#39;s reps for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74042190007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7-o31SuXim/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003esecond video\u003c/a\u003e from Ben Watts, the couple and their children are seen on an elevator, waving as the doors close.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNaomi Watts first announced her marriage to Crudup, her co-star in the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/tv/2017/06/29/review-naomi-watts-netflix-gypsy/103262532/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e2017 Netflix series \u0026#34;Gypsy,\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e last summer.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Hitched! 🕊️\u0026#34; she \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CtUreSjPa1g/?igshid\u003dMzRlODBiNWFlZA%3D%3D\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ecaptioned a photo\u003c/a\u003e of her and Crudup on the steps of what appears to be a courthouse last June. She wore a sleeveless, floral white lace dress and held a bouquet in one hand and the Tony Award winner in another. Crudup wore a blue suit and white button-up.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eNaomi Watts and Billy Crudup  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/06/11/naomi-watts-billy-crudup-married-see-wedding-photo/70310831007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eget married! See their wedding photo\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Hubby,\u0026#34; she captioned a close-up in her Instagram story at the time, and wrote that her bouquet was made up of \u0026#34;Flowers from the deli!!\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72397023007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShe also shared a shot of the couple in wedding attire posing with their casually dressed pals Mark Ruffalo and his wife, Sunrise Coigney, and Josh Hamilton and his wife, Lily Thorne.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u0026#34;King Kong\u0026#34; actress shares daughter Kai Schreiber, 15, and son Sasha Schreiber, 16, with ex \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/allthemoms/2019/01/09/liev-schreiber-never-cool-his-kids-video/2524195002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLiev Schreiber\u003c/a\u003e. The former couple \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/people/2016/09/26/naomi-watts-and-liev-schreiber-announce-separation/91138934/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eseparated in 2016\u003c/a\u003e after 11 years together.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eNaomi Watts  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/16/naomi-watts-kai-schreiber-dior-fall-2024-show/73349462007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eposes with youngest child Kai Schreiber, 15, during rare family outing\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBilly Crudup shares his 20-year-old son, William Atticus Parker, with ex Mary-Louise Parker.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Kim Willis\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72303363007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/16/naomi-watts-kai-schreiber-dior-fall-2024-show/73349462007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eNaomi Watts\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/picture-gallery/entertainment/movies/2020/09/22/almost-famous-20th-anniversary-kate-hudson-where-are-they-now/3491977001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eBilly Crudup\u003c/a\u003e have tied the knot \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/06/11/naomi-watts-billy-crudup-married-see-wedding-photo/70310831007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003efor a second time\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOver the weekend, photographer Ben Watts, Watts\u0026#39; brother, posted video of the couple walking down the aisle in a Mexico City ceremony.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Wot a weekend Naomi x Billy Mexico City,\u0026#34; the photographer captioned the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8AxqlLRXe6/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eblack-and- white video\u003c/a\u003e, set to the tune of the traditional \u0026#34;Wedding March.\u0026#34; The video shows an elegant venue with Crudup, 55, walking down the aisle in a dark suit and tie with his son, William Atticus Parker, and the British actress\u0026#39; daughter, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/16/naomi-watts-kai-schreiber-dior-fall-2024-show/73349462007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKai Schreiber\u003c/a\u003e, serving as a bridesmaid.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNaomi Watts, 55, is later shown walking down the aisle in an off-white, cowl-neckline wedding dress and veil, holding a bouquet as her son, Sasha Schreiber, gives her away. She then joins the \u0026#34;Almost Famous\u0026#34; actor on a reflective platform.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72731737007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eLater, the couple kiss after seemingly sharing their nuptials and return down the aisle hand in hand in celebration.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to Naomi Watts and Crudup\u0026#39;s reps for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74042190007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C7-o31SuXim/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003esecond video\u003c/a\u003e from Ben Watts, the couple and their children are seen on an elevator, waving as the doors close.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNaomi Watts first announced her marriage to Crudup, her co-star in the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/tv/2017/06/29/review-naomi-watts-netflix-gypsy/103262532/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e2017 Netflix series \u0026#34;Gypsy,\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e last summer.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Hitched! 🕊️\u0026#34; she \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CtUreSjPa1g/?igshid\u003dMzRlODBiNWFlZA%3D%3D\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ecaptioned a photo\u003c/a\u003e of her and Crudup on the steps of what appears to be a courthouse last June. She wore a sleeveless, floral white lace dress and held a bouquet in one hand and the Tony Award winner in another. Crudup wore a blue suit and white button-up.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eNaomi Watts and Billy Crudup  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/06/11/naomi-watts-billy-crudup-married-see-wedding-photo/70310831007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eget married! See their wedding photo\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Hubby,\u0026#34; she captioned a close-up in her Instagram story at the time, and wrote that her bouquet was made up of \u0026#34;Flowers from the deli!!\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72397023007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShe also shared a shot of the couple in wedding attire posing with their casually dressed pals Mark Ruffalo and his wife, Sunrise Coigney, and Josh Hamilton and his wife, Lily Thorne.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u0026#34;King Kong\u0026#34; actress shares daughter Kai Schreiber, 15, and son Sasha Schreiber, 16, with ex \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/allthemoms/2019/01/09/liev-schreiber-never-cool-his-kids-video/2524195002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLiev Schreiber\u003c/a\u003e. The former couple \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/people/2016/09/26/naomi-watts-and-liev-schreiber-announce-separation/91138934/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eseparated in 2016\u003c/a\u003e after 11 years together.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eNaomi Watts  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/16/naomi-watts-kai-schreiber-dior-fall-2024-show/73349462007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eposes with youngest child Kai Schreiber, 15, during rare family outing\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBilly Crudup shares his 20-year-old son, William Atticus Parker, with ex Mary-Louise Parker.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Kim Willis\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

