body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74052049007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eA little over two weeks after \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/23/christian-nodal-cazzu-breakup/73825165007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/23/christian-nodal-cazzu-breakup/73825165007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eChristian Nodal announced his breakup\u003c/a\u003e from \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/picture-gallery/entertainment/music/2022/10/10/women-artists-dominating-reggaeton/8193056001/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/picture-gallery/entertainment/music/2022/10/10/women-artists-dominating-reggaeton/8193056001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eCazzu\u003c/a\u003e, the Mexican singer-songwriter is now dating \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/10/19/angela-aguilar-pepe-aguilar-legacy-jaripeo-sin-fronteras-tour/8184484001/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/10/19/angela-aguilar-pepe-aguilar-legacy-jaripeo-sin-fronteras-tour/8184484001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eÀngela Aguilar\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn Monday, the 20-year-old daughter of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/picture-gallery/entertainment/music/2022/10/19/jaripeo-sin-fronteras-tour-pepe-aguilar-angela-aguilar-photos/10464572002/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/picture-gallery/entertainment/music/2022/10/19/jaripeo-sin-fronteras-tour-pepe-aguilar-angela-aguilar-photos/10464572002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePepe Aguilar\u003c/a\u003e confirmed her relationship with Nodal, 25, in an exclusive with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.hola.com/us/celebrities/20240610361250/exclusive-angela-aguilar-christian-nodal-romance-confirmed/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eHOLA!\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It is not a new relationship; it\u0026#39;s the continuation of a story that life made us pause so we could grow and miss each other,\u0026#34; the singers told the publication. \u0026#34;Because when we let go, we returned even closer.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe publication also shared photos of the couple. In one of the photos, Nodal can be seen hugging Aguilar and kissing her on the neck. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74052070007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAguilar and Nodal have also been musical collaborators. The two released their duet \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dGe4AKbnr6ME\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Dime Cómo Quieres\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e in 2020 when she was 17 and Nodal was 21. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe couple\u0026#39;s new romance comes two weeks after Nodal and Argentine rapper and singer Cazzu revealed they split up in an emotional social media post. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The time has come to share that Juileta and I are taking our separate paths,\u0026#34; Nodal wrote on his May 23 Instagram stories, in Spanish. \u0026#34;Our love and mutual respect remain strong, especially in our role as parents to our wonderful daughter, Inti. I am deeply grateful for the moments we shared and will always carry those memories fondly.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe news came eight months after the singers \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CxLvU-8u3Y5/?utm_source\u003dig_web_copy_link\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewelcomed a daughter\u003c/a\u003e in September 2023.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eChristian Nodal confirms relationship with Àngela Aguilar, denies cheating rumors \u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74052047007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNodal later \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8D_3XMMY1x/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8D_3XMMY1x/\"\u003eaddressed his relationship with Aguilar \u003c/a\u003eon Instagram in a lengthy video. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I know many of you today found out that Àngela and I officially are in a relationship,\u0026#34; Nodal said, adding that he wanted to provide some context out of respect to his former partner Cazzu. \u0026#34;First of all, (Cazzu) is someone I love and who has my respect for the rest of my life.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;We\u0026#39;re public figures, we\u0026#39;re artists … but love doesn\u0026#39;t always work out. Our cycle together ended in the best way possible. It was a love that gave us the most precious gift in life,\u0026#34; he continued, adding he will always love and care for their daughter. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74053956007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNodal then addressed cheating rumors surrounding his former relationship with Cazzu. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;There was no infidelity. Sometimes love just doesn\u0026#39;t work out, and now I find myself living a beautiful experience with a woman that I love and with a love that took so many years to become what it is now,\u0026#34; he added, referring to his relationship with Aguilar. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eCazzu speaks out on Christian Nodal breakup \u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73825451007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCazzu, born Julieta Emilia Cazzuchelli, reposted Nodal\u0026#39;s message on her \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/cazzu/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram stories\u003c/a\u003e in May and wrote a follow-up message addressing the breakup.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Artists are a screen of what happens in real life. You go through love, heartbreak, successes and mistakes with us,\u0026#34; Cazzu wrote, in Spanish. \u0026#34;Today, as it was many times and as there are still many, you accompany us, some with hate and others with much love. Thank you. Everything heals.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eÁngela Aguilar interview: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/10/19/angela-aguilar-pepe-aguilar-legacy-jaripeo-sin-fronteras-tour/8184484001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eRegional Mexican singer follows \u0026#39;in the footsteps of my dad\u0026#39; Pepe, but could also be genre\u0026#39;s future\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn a March interview with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.billboard.com/music/latin/christian-nodal-sxsw-billboard-cover-1235627808/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eBillboard\u003c/a\u003e, Nodal reflected on how his tour life had changed since starting a family with the \u0026#34;Maléfica\u0026#34; singer.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I remember those times when I would come down from the stage and feel alone,\u0026#34; Nodal said at the time. \u0026#34;Now I come down to a stroller with my baby in it, and it all seems perfect. … When she was born, I was feeling exhausted. I don’t know how I managed to change diapers, but she gives me energy, motivation and strength.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72089387007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNodal and Cazzu \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dPc5_TgdCkSw\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ebegan dating in 2022\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBefore Cazzu, Nodal dated Latin pop singer Belinda for a few months before \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.billboard.com/music/latin/christian-nodal-belinda-engaged-9578329/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ebecoming engaged in May 2021\u003c/a\u003e. In February 2022, the two \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.billboard.com/music/latin/belinda-christian-nodal-split-up-1235030869/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eannounced the end of their relationship\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74052049007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eA little over two weeks after \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/23/christian-nodal-cazzu-breakup/73825165007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/23/christian-nodal-cazzu-breakup/73825165007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eChristian Nodal announced his breakup\u003c/a\u003e from \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/picture-gallery/entertainment/music/2022/10/10/women-artists-dominating-reggaeton/8193056001/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/picture-gallery/entertainment/music/2022/10/10/women-artists-dominating-reggaeton/8193056001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eCazzu\u003c/a\u003e, the Mexican singer-songwriter is now dating \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/10/19/angela-aguilar-pepe-aguilar-legacy-jaripeo-sin-fronteras-tour/8184484001/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/10/19/angela-aguilar-pepe-aguilar-legacy-jaripeo-sin-fronteras-tour/8184484001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eÀngela Aguilar\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn Monday, the 20-year-old daughter of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/picture-gallery/entertainment/music/2022/10/19/jaripeo-sin-fronteras-tour-pepe-aguilar-angela-aguilar-photos/10464572002/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/picture-gallery/entertainment/music/2022/10/19/jaripeo-sin-fronteras-tour-pepe-aguilar-angela-aguilar-photos/10464572002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePepe Aguilar\u003c/a\u003e confirmed her relationship with Nodal, 25, in an exclusive with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.hola.com/us/celebrities/20240610361250/exclusive-angela-aguilar-christian-nodal-romance-confirmed/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eHOLA!\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It is not a new relationship; it\u0026#39;s the continuation of a story that life made us pause so we could grow and miss each other,\u0026#34; the singers told the publication. \u0026#34;Because when we let go, we returned even closer.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe publication also shared photos of the couple. In one of the photos, Nodal can be seen hugging Aguilar and kissing her on the neck. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74052070007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAguilar and Nodal have also been musical collaborators. The two released their duet \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dGe4AKbnr6ME\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Dime Cómo Quieres\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e in 2020 when she was 17 and Nodal was 21. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe couple\u0026#39;s new romance comes two weeks after Nodal and Argentine rapper and singer Cazzu revealed they split up in an emotional social media post. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The time has come to share that Juileta and I are taking our separate paths,\u0026#34; Nodal wrote on his May 23 Instagram stories, in Spanish. \u0026#34;Our love and mutual respect remain strong, especially in our role as parents to our wonderful daughter, Inti. I am deeply grateful for the moments we shared and will always carry those memories fondly.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe news came eight months after the singers \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CxLvU-8u3Y5/?utm_source\u003dig_web_copy_link\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewelcomed a daughter\u003c/a\u003e in September 2023.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eChristian Nodal confirms relationship with Àngela Aguilar, denies cheating rumors \u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74052047007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNodal later \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8D_3XMMY1x/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8D_3XMMY1x/\"\u003eaddressed his relationship with Aguilar \u003c/a\u003eon Instagram in a lengthy video. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I know many of you today found out that Àngela and I officially are in a relationship,\u0026#34; Nodal said, adding that he wanted to provide some context out of respect to his former partner Cazzu. \u0026#34;First of all, (Cazzu) is someone I love and who has my respect for the rest of my life.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;We\u0026#39;re public figures, we\u0026#39;re artists … but love doesn\u0026#39;t always work out. Our cycle together ended in the best way possible. It was a love that gave us the most precious gift in life,\u0026#34; he continued, adding he will always love and care for their daughter. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74053956007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNodal then addressed cheating rumors surrounding his former relationship with Cazzu. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;There was no infidelity. Sometimes love just doesn\u0026#39;t work out, and now I find myself living a beautiful experience with a woman that I love and with a love that took so many years to become what it is now,\u0026#34; he added, referring to his relationship with Aguilar. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eCazzu speaks out on Christian Nodal breakup \u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73825451007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCazzu, born Julieta Emilia Cazzuchelli, reposted Nodal\u0026#39;s message on her \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/cazzu/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram stories\u003c/a\u003e in May and wrote a follow-up message addressing the breakup.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Artists are a screen of what happens in real life. You go through love, heartbreak, successes and mistakes with us,\u0026#34; Cazzu wrote, in Spanish. \u0026#34;Today, as it was many times and as there are still many, you accompany us, some with hate and others with much love. Thank you. Everything heals.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eÁngela Aguilar interview: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/10/19/angela-aguilar-pepe-aguilar-legacy-jaripeo-sin-fronteras-tour/8184484001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eRegional Mexican singer follows \u0026#39;in the footsteps of my dad\u0026#39; Pepe, but could also be genre\u0026#39;s future\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn a March interview with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.billboard.com/music/latin/christian-nodal-sxsw-billboard-cover-1235627808/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eBillboard\u003c/a\u003e, Nodal reflected on how his tour life had changed since starting a family with the \u0026#34;Maléfica\u0026#34; singer.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I remember those times when I would come down from the stage and feel alone,\u0026#34; Nodal said at the time. \u0026#34;Now I come down to a stroller with my baby in it, and it all seems perfect. … When she was born, I was feeling exhausted. I don’t know how I managed to change diapers, but she gives me energy, motivation and strength.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72089387007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNodal and Cazzu \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dPc5_TgdCkSw\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ebegan dating in 2022\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBefore Cazzu, Nodal dated Latin pop singer Belinda for a few months before \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.billboard.com/music/latin/christian-nodal-belinda-engaged-9578329/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ebecoming engaged in May 2021\u003c/a\u003e. In February 2022, the two \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.billboard.com/music/latin/belinda-christian-nodal-split-up-1235030869/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eannounced the end of their relationship\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

