  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn a March interview with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.billboard.com/music/latin/christian-nodal-sxsw-billboard-cover-1235627808/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eBillboard\u003c/a\u003e, Nodal reflected on how his tour life had changed since starting a family with the \u0026#34;Maléfica\u0026#34; singer.\u003c/p\u003e"
