    "value": "72089387007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eNodal and Cazzu \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dPc5_TgdCkSw\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ebegan dating in 2022\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eBefore Cazzu, Nodal dated Latin pop singer Belinda for a few months before \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.billboard.com/music/latin/christian-nodal-belinda-engaged-9578329/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ebecoming engaged in May 2021\u003c/a\u003e. In February 2022, the two \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.billboard.com/music/latin/belinda-christian-nodal-split-up-1235030869/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eannounced the end of their relationship\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

