body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74069328007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8DKfskREo6/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eYouTube star Ben Potter\u003c/a\u003e, who rose to fame with his \u0026#34;Comicstorian\u0026#34; videos, died Saturday in a Colorado single-vehicle rollover crash. He was 40.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003ePotter\u0026#39;s silver Toyota 4Runner drove off the right shoulder, crossing a frontage road and rolling several times while driving southbound on I-25 near Fort Collins, according to Colorado State Patrol statements to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://people.com/youtube-star-ben-potter-cause-of-death-revealed-8661496?\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePeople\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.denverpost.com/2024/06/11/ben-potter-comicstorian-death-youtube/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Denver Post.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to Colorado police for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003ePotter rose to fame with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/user/comicstorian\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e3 million followers on the video-sharing platform\u003c/a\u003e for creating \u003ca href\u003d\"https://ftw.usatoday.com/2023/01/the-batman-part-2-dc-comics-dcu-james-gunn\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eaudio dramas of characters from the DC\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2021/07/07/marvel-superhero-movie-guide-best-viewing-order/7870386002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMarvel worlds\u003c/a\u003e. His wife, Nathalie Potter, addressed his death in a note to fans \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8DKfskREo6/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eposted to his social media accounts Monday.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74055491007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Two days ago ... my husband, Ben Potter, passed away in an unfortunate accident. To many of you, he was Comicstorian, voicing stories from across multiple different mediums,\u0026#34; Nathalie Potter wrote. \u0026#34;To his loved ones, he was one of the best and most supportive individuals anyone could ask for.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003ePotter appeared to post \u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/comicstorian/status/1799265920239665397?s\u003d46\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eone day before his death on X,\u003c/a\u003e writing that \u0026#34;for those wondering, Mangastorian video will drop tomorrow. We\u0026#39;re just behind in the edits.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe letter added that \u0026#34;as a husband, a son, a brother, a friend, or even just a stranger, Ben was loving and genuine.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNathalie Potter continued by remembering her husband as \u0026#34;our rock and he\u0026#39;d reassure his loved ones whenever they needed it,\u0026#34; vowing to continue building his video empire after she takes \u0026#34;time to be with friends and family.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74055305007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Right now my priority is preserving everything he\u0026#39;s built and I don\u0026#39;t have any plans beyond that. His channel was one of his greatest accomplishments, and while we all need our time to mourn him, I know he wouldn\u0026#39;t want it to end like this,\u0026#34; she wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/hassankhadair/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eHassan Khadair,\u003c/a\u003e the Comicstorian fan-turned-pop culture host for the channel, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8DZviNP3lQ/?img_index\u003d1\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003epaid tribute on Instagram,\u003c/a\u003e adding that \u0026#34;the other greatest joy was having Ben Potter, the guy who I loved watching so much, become my mentor and one of my best friends.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72087830007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Benny was over a decade into a successful YouTube career and frankly he was just getting started! We had so much wonderful stuff planned and I hope to be able to carry on his legacy and honor him in whatever way I can for the rest of my life. Love you forever Ben,\u0026#34; Khadair wrote.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eKhadair said Potter \u0026#34;had the most powerful, booming voice and simultaneously one of the most loving, warm, inviting presences.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74069328007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8DKfskREo6/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eYouTube star Ben Potter\u003c/a\u003e, who rose to fame with his \u0026#34;Comicstorian\u0026#34; videos, died Saturday in a Colorado single-vehicle rollover crash. He was 40.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003ePotter\u0026#39;s silver Toyota 4Runner drove off the right shoulder, crossing a frontage road and rolling several times while driving southbound on I-25 near Fort Collins, according to Colorado State Patrol statements to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://people.com/youtube-star-ben-potter-cause-of-death-revealed-8661496?\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePeople\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.denverpost.com/2024/06/11/ben-potter-comicstorian-death-youtube/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Denver Post.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to Colorado police for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
