body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "6611954001"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eActor \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/michaelraineyjr/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMichael Rainey Jr\u003c/a\u003e. is speaking out after a video appeared to show he was sexually assaulted on a livestream.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn an Instagram story on Monday, the \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/06/05/power-book-2-ghost-season-4/73973500007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePower\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; star, 23, said he is \u0026#34;still in shock\u0026#34; and doesn\u0026#39;t \u0026#34;fully know how to process what happened last night.\u0026#34; The incident occurred on a stream broadcast by \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.twitch.tv/thetylilshow\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTylil James\u003c/a\u003e, who hosts \u0026#34;The Tylil Show\u0026#34; on the live video platform Twitch and has more than 100,000 followers there. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eA video that circulated on social media showed Rainey standing in a room full of people during the stream when a woman appears to grab his crotch, making him visibly uncomfortable. The woman\u0026#39;s hand is obscured in the footage by two young children. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;This is an unfortunate situation that I do not condone in any way,\u0026#34; the actor said. \u0026#34;I can\u0026#39;t take it lightly because I know I would be in serious trouble if the roles were reversed.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74054821007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe alleged assault occurred while other participants in the stream were engaged in conversation, and it did not appear they initially noticed what happened.  \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe added, \u0026#34;The fact is, sexual assault is never okay, regardless of gender or status. We\u0026#39;re all human, and we should respect each other. Most importantly, we should always respect ourselves.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to representatives for Rainey. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eRainey is known for his role as Tariq St. Patrick in the \u0026#34;Power\u0026#34; franchise, including \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2020/09/04/power-book-ii-ghost-starz-spinoff-mary-j-blige/5679076002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePower Book II: Ghost\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026#34; The first part of its final season held its premiere in New York City last week and premiered Friday on Starz.  \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe has also had roles on \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2023/07/11/orange-is-the-new-black-10th-anniversary-it-changed-netflix/70388425007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eOrange Is the New Black\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; and in the films \u0026#34;The Butler\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/movies/2016/04/13/common-cedric-the-entertainer-barbershop-the-next-cut/82922586/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eBarbershop: The Next Cut\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;Power Book II: Ghost\u0026#39;  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/06/05/power-book-2-ghost-season-4/73973500007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSeason 4: Release date, cast, trailer, where to watch new episodes\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn an Instagram story, James apologized to Rainey and said the woman who seemingly groped him is his sister. \u0026#34;My little sister was completely wrong and out of line,\u0026#34; he said. \u0026#34;What she did was very inappropriate and unacceptable. I am truly embarrassed and disgusted by her actions.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eJames pledged to take \u0026#34;extreme precautions with future streams to avoid similar issues\u0026#34; and said he has banned his sister from participating. \u0026#34;I do not condone any type of assault,\u0026#34; he wrote. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;Power Book II: Ghost\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2020/09/04/power-book-ii-ghost-starz-spinoff-mary-j-blige/5679076002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eMary J. Blige on her role as a \u0026#39;queenpin\u0026#39; survivor in  sequel series\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn the comments section of Rainey\u0026#39;s most recent Instagram post, some fans urged the actor to take legal action. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Please press charges on her, because if the roles were reversed you would\u0026#39;ve been in jail,\u0026#34; one comment, which received more than 3,000 likes, read.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73930374007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAnother fan wrote, \u0026#34;Sorry that happened to you Michael, what she did was wrong and i hate that it\u0026#39;s taken lightly or as a joke when this happens to men.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eJames said in his Instagram story that he respects \u0026#34;whatever direction Michael wants to go in this situation.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eIf you or someone you know has experienced sexual violence, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.rainn.org/resources\"\u003eRAINN’s National Sexual Assault Hotline\u003c/a\u003e offers free, confidential, 24/7 support to survivors and their loved ones in English and Spanish at: 800-656-HOPE (4673) and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://hotline.rainn.org/\"\u003eHotline.RAINN.org\u003c/a\u003e and en Español \u003ca href\u003d\"https://rainn.org/es\"\u003eRAINN.org/es.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "6611954001"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eActor \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/michaelraineyjr/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMichael Rainey Jr\u003c/a\u003e. is speaking out after a video appeared to show he was sexually assaulted on a livestream.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn an Instagram story on Monday, the \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/06/05/power-book-2-ghost-season-4/73973500007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePower\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; star, 23, said he is \u0026#34;still in shock\u0026#34; and doesn\u0026#39;t \u0026#34;fully know how to process what happened last night.\u0026#34; The incident occurred on a stream broadcast by \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.twitch.tv/thetylilshow\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTylil James\u003c/a\u003e, who hosts \u0026#34;The Tylil Show\u0026#34; on the live video platform Twitch and has more than 100,000 followers there. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eA video that circulated on social media showed Rainey standing in a room full of people during the stream when a woman appears to grab his crotch, making him visibly uncomfortable. The woman\u0026#39;s hand is obscured in the footage by two young children. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;This is an unfortunate situation that I do not condone in any way,\u0026#34; the actor said. \u0026#34;I can\u0026#39;t take it lightly because I know I would be in serious trouble if the roles were reversed.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74054821007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe alleged assault occurred while other participants in the stream were engaged in conversation, and it did not appear they initially noticed what happened.  \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe added, \u0026#34;The fact is, sexual assault is never okay, regardless of gender or status. We\u0026#39;re all human, and we should respect each other. Most importantly, we should always respect ourselves.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to representatives for Rainey. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eRainey is known for his role as Tariq St. Patrick in the \u0026#34;Power\u0026#34; franchise, including \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2020/09/04/power-book-ii-ghost-starz-spinoff-mary-j-blige/5679076002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePower Book II: Ghost\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026#34; The first part of its final season held its premiere in New York City last week and premiered Friday on Starz.  \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe has also had roles on \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2023/07/11/orange-is-the-new-black-10th-anniversary-it-changed-netflix/70388425007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eOrange Is the New Black\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; and in the films \u0026#34;The Butler\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/movies/2016/04/13/common-cedric-the-entertainer-barbershop-the-next-cut/82922586/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eBarbershop: The Next Cut\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;Power Book II: Ghost\u0026#39;  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/06/05/power-book-2-ghost-season-4/73973500007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSeason 4: Release date, cast, trailer, where to watch new episodes\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn an Instagram story, James apologized to Rainey and said the woman who seemingly groped him is his sister. \u0026#34;My little sister was completely wrong and out of line,\u0026#34; he said. \u0026#34;What she did was very inappropriate and unacceptable. I am truly embarrassed and disgusted by her actions.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eJames pledged to take \u0026#34;extreme precautions with future streams to avoid similar issues\u0026#34; and said he has banned his sister from participating. \u0026#34;I do not condone any type of assault,\u0026#34; he wrote. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;Power Book II: Ghost\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2020/09/04/power-book-ii-ghost-starz-spinoff-mary-j-blige/5679076002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eMary J. Blige on her role as a \u0026#39;queenpin\u0026#39; survivor in  sequel series\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn the comments section of Rainey\u0026#39;s most recent Instagram post, some fans urged the actor to take legal action. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Please press charges on her, because if the roles were reversed you would\u0026#39;ve been in jail,\u0026#34; one comment, which received more than 3,000 likes, read.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73930374007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAnother fan wrote, \u0026#34;Sorry that happened to you Michael, what she did was wrong and i hate that it\u0026#39;s taken lightly or as a joke when this happens to men.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eJames said in his Instagram story that he respects \u0026#34;whatever direction Michael wants to go in this situation.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eIf you or someone you know has experienced sexual violence, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.rainn.org/resources\"\u003eRAINN’s National Sexual Assault Hotline\u003c/a\u003e offers free, confidential, 24/7 support to survivors and their loved ones in English and Spanish at: 800-656-HOPE (4673) and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://hotline.rainn.org/\"\u003eHotline.RAINN.org\u003c/a\u003e and en Español \u003ca href\u003d\"https://rainn.org/es\"\u003eRAINN.org/es.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

