    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/03/goldie-hawn-son-oliver-hudson-clarifies-trauma-comments/73188270007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eGoldie Hawn\u003c/a\u003e has revealed that her home with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2023/11/24/monarch-kurt-wyatt-russell-apple-godzilla-show/71674243007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKurt Russell\u003c/a\u003e was the target of a burglary attempt.\u003c/p\u003e"
