body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74077171007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eIn a new series \u003cstrong\u003eUSA TODAY’s The Essentials\u003c/strong\u003e, celebrities share what fuels their lives.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIt\u0026#39;s been a long, winding Hollywood road for \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2021/10/17/halloween-kills-brat-pack-star-anthony-michael-hall-horror/8458347002/\"\u003eAnthony Michael Hall.\u003c/a\u003e  \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBut the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/06/07/brats-documentary-andrew-mccarthy-rob-lowe/73991738007/\"\u003eBrat Pack \u003c/a\u003estar of 1980s hits such as \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2019/07/19/judd-nelson-says-the-breakfast-club-shouldnt-remade/1781750001/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2019/07/19/judd-nelson-says-the-breakfast-club-shouldnt-remade/1781750001/\"\u003e\u0026#34;The Breakfast Club,\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e \u0026#34;Vacation\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;Weird Science\u0026#34; is still rolling at 56 and has an acting career that has endured for almost 50 years. The actor who famously played The Geek in \u0026#34;Sixteen Candles\u0026#34; four decades ago is now playing fathers, teachers and villains.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It\u0026#39;s about having thick skin and just being tenacious,\u0026#34; says Hall, \u0026#34;It\u0026#39;s also about adapting, changing and growing.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.netflix.com/title/81064546\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eNetflix\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;Trigger Warning\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e (streaming June 21), Hall plays a malevolent U.S. senator, who gets on the wrong side of an ex-Special Forces commando (\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/09/jessica-alba-steps-down-from-the-honest-company/73268672007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJessica Alba\u003c/a\u003e). The adaptable Hall tells us about his surprising new favorite TV show and memories of his movie mentor.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJoin our Watch Party!  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSign up to receive USA TODAY\u0026#39;s movie and TV recommendations right in your inbox\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74007281007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAnthony Michael Hall\u0026#39;s top John Hughes movie? \u0026#39;Planes, Trains and Automobiles\u0026#39;\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHall starred in four \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2019/07/19/judd-nelson-says-the-breakfast-club-shouldnt-remade/1781750001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJohn Hughes movies\u003c/a\u003e, but the actor wasn\u0026#39;t in his favorite – the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2022/11/24/steve-martin-plane-trains-and-automobiles/10717692002/\"\u003e1987 holiday classic \u0026#34;Planes, Trains and Automobiles\u0026#34; starring John Candy and Steve Martin\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m a huge fan,\u0026#34; says Hall. \u0026#34;Because there\u0026#39;s so much great humor, but at its core, it\u0026#39;s really just about friendship.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "10766086002"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73113047007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe actor also keeps a permanent place in his heart for Hughes, who died in 2019.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m grateful for how I started and for John Hughes. Without him I wouldn\u0026#39;t be here talking to you,\u0026#34; says Hall. \u0026#34;I miss him.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;Planes, Trains and Automobiles\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2022/11/24/steve-martin-plane-trains-and-automobiles/10717692002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSteve Martin has no regrets about 19 f-bombs in car rental tirade\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74077169007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eFlexibility is key in Hollywood (and \u0026#39;Sixteen Candles\u0026#39;)\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHall is about putting in the work but taking creative chances. He recalls making \u0026#34;Sixteen Candles\u0026#34; with Hughes, his movie mentor, and shooting three takes of the messy aftermath of the high school party blowout at studly Jake Ryan\u0026#39;s house. The duo got inspired by the wrecked set in the rented house and the tomb-like glass table covered in beer cans.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;John asked me, \u0026#39;Do you think you could fit into that glass table?\u0026#39; And I was like, \u0026#39;Sure John, watch this,\u0026#39; And I climbed into that table,\u0026#34; says Hall, whose literal flexibility led to the trapped Hall\u0026#39;s iconic \u0026#34;Jaakkkkkkeee!\u0026#34; screech for help. \u0026#34;John wasn\u0026#39;t precious, because he knew his scripts were always funny.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74065498007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAnthony Michael Hall\u0026#39;s TV pick for \u0026#39;spring chicken\u0026#39; fatherhood: \u0026#39;Ms. Rachel\u0026#39;\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHall welcomed his first child last June at age 55 with his wife, Lucia Hall, which doesn’t compare with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/06/15/al-pacino-welcomes-baby-with-noor-alfallah/70327021007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/06/15/al-pacino-welcomes-baby-with-noor-alfallah/70327021007/\"\u003eAl Pacino\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/01/25/robert-de-niro-fatherhood-daughter-gia/72357726007/\"\u003eRobert De Niro\u003c/a\u003e, who became fathers again in 2023 at 83 and 79, respectively.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;With all due respect to Mr. De Niro and Mr. Pacino, in the year they both sired children, I feel like a spring chicken,\u0026#34; says Hall. \u0026#34;I always knew that I would start later in life. I didn\u0026#39;t think I\u0026#39;d be in my 50s.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMichael Anthony Hall II, now 1, carries his father\u0026#39;s given name (Hall had flipped the order of his names professionally when he started his career).\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe life change explains Hall\u0026#39;s must TV watch: The children\u0026#39;s YouTube program \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/books/2024/03/06/ms-rachel-books-toy-line-set-for-fall/72867773007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/books/2024/03/06/ms-rachel-books-toy-line-set-for-fall/72867773007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Ms. Rachel.\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I laugh because my wife and I look at each other as we literally have the song catalog memorized. So these days, we\u0026#39;re dancing and singing to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/04/ms-rachel-pride-month-lgbtq-backlash/73969851007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMs. Rachel\u003c/a\u003e. And as many parents will attest, she\u0026#39;s a lifesaver. She\u0026#39;s like a virtual preschool teacher.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74067223007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eWhile Michael is content, his father is already prepping him to (someday) watch director Christopher Nolan\u0026#39;s 2008 classic \u0026#34;The Dark Knight,\u0026#34; where Hall plays Gotham City TV reporter Mike Engel.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I just bought him a Batman action figure. I was joking with my wife that I can\u0026#39;t wait for him to watch \u0026#39;Dark Knight,\u0026#39; I\u0026#39;ve got a nice little role in that too,\u0026#34; says Hall. \u0026#34;But he started to chew on one of Batman\u0026#39;s hands and my wife got a little upset with me. He\u0026#39;s too young for the action figures. But one day ...\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAnthony Michael Hall shares his new must-have hairstyle \u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFacing off against Michael Myers as \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2021/10/17/halloween-kills-brat-pack-star-anthony-michael-hall-horror/8458347002/\"\u003eTommy Doyle in 2019\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;Halloween Kills\u0026#34; \u003c/a\u003erequired Hall to undergo a short haircut for the first time. Doyle died, but the hair survived. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;After they shaved my head, I was like, this is my favorite haircut,\u0026#34; says Hall. \u0026#34;It\u0026#39;s wash-and-go and it really minimizes the grey, I have to be honest.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74067194007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe slight downside is that fans keep mixing Hall up with \u0026#34;Law and Order: Special Victims Unit\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;Yellowstone\u0026#34; star Terry Serpico.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I\u0026#39;ll do a signing and people come up to me swearing that I\u0026#39;m on \u0026#39;Yellowstone\u0026#39; and \u0026#39;Law \u0026amp; Order.\u0026#39; I get confused with Terry Serpico a lot,\u0026#39;\u0026#34; says Hall. \u0026#34;I have to tell them that I love that guy, and I love \u0026#39;Michael Clayton,\u0026#39; too. But that\u0026#39;s not me.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eThis interview has been edited for length and clarity.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74077171007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eIn a new series \u003cstrong\u003eUSA TODAY’s The Essentials\u003c/strong\u003e, celebrities share what fuels their lives.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
