    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.netflix.com/title/81064546\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eNetflix\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;Trigger Warning\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e (streaming June 21), Hall plays a malevolent U.S. senator, who gets on the wrong side of an ex-Special Forces commando (\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/09/jessica-alba-steps-down-from-the-honest-company/73268672007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJessica Alba\u003c/a\u003e). The adaptable Hall tells us about his surprising new favorite TV show and memories of his movie mentor.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJoin our Watch Party!  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSign up to receive USA TODAY\u0026#39;s movie and TV recommendations right in your inbox\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74007281007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAnthony Michael Hall\u0026#39;s top John Hughes movie? \u0026#39;Planes, Trains and Automobiles\u0026#39;\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHall starred in four \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2019/07/19/judd-nelson-says-the-breakfast-club-shouldnt-remade/1781750001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJohn Hughes movies\u003c/a\u003e, but the actor wasn\u0026#39;t in his favorite – the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2022/11/24/steve-martin-plane-trains-and-automobiles/10717692002/\"\u003e1987 holiday classic \u0026#34;Planes, Trains and Automobiles\u0026#34; starring John Candy and Steve Martin\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
