  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74093668007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eG-Eazy, who\u0026#39;s been busy promoting his latest \u003ca href\u003d\"https://youtu.be/-pnXVff2bPk?si\u003d3_vwbX-ChblYzdkI\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003emusic video\u003c/a\u003e, upcoming album \u0026#34;Freak Show\u0026#34; and world tour, has not responded on social media. USA TODAY has reached out to reps for Rexha and G-Eazy for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
