  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eNicolas Malvagna of New Jersey \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/06/19/bebe-rexha-assault-man-charged-throwsphone-at-star-onstage/70335320007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewas charged\u003c/a\u003e with harassment and assault in 2023 for allegedly intentionally throwing a phone that struck Rexha\u0026#39;s face during her set at New York\u0026#39;s Pier 17. In photos she posted on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CtrQQLDuoV3/?hl\u003den\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e after the event, she \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/06/19/bebe-rexha-assault-man-charged-throwsphone-at-star-onstage/70335320007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eappeared to have a black eye\u003c/a\u003e and a cut to her eyebrow.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;(I\u0026#39;m) good,\u0026#34; Rexha captioned the pictures.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Edward Segarra\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

