      "value": "\u003cp class\u003d\"\" id\u003d\"mntl-sc-block_7-0\"\u003eShe continued: \u0026#34;Please send my very best wishes and good luck to all involved.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "10452175002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn her March announcement video, she called her cancer a \u0026#34;huge shock\u0026#34; for her family, adding that she and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/02/28/prince-william-queen-camilla-lean-on-extended-royal-family/72758483007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePrince William\u003c/a\u003e have done \u0026#34;everything we can to process and manage this privately for the sake of our young family.\u0026#34; The pair are parents to three children: \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/03/22/who-is-princess-kate-middleton/73070016007/#:~:text\u003dThe%20princess%20has%20three%20children%20with%20Prince%20William.,Charlotte%2C%208%20years%20old%20Louis%2C%205%20years%20old\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePrincess George, 10, Princess Charlotte, 8, and Prince Louis, 5.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAt the time, she said she would undergo \u0026#34;a course of preventive chemotherapy treatment\u0026#34; for undisclosed cancer.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
