body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72112536007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2023/09/25/kitchen-nightmares-watch-new-season/70964194007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eGordon Ramsay\u003c/a\u003e is lucky to be alive. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2023/02/10/super-bowl-next-level-chef-gordon-ramsay/11220835002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eHell\u0026#39;s Kitchen\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; host, 57, revealed on Saturday that he was treated at a hospital after being injured in a \u0026#34;really bad\u0026#34; bicycle accident in Connecticut. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It really shook me,\u0026#34; he says in a video shared to Instagram and X. \u0026#34;Honestly, I\u0026#39;m lucky to be here.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eRamsay wrote in the post\u0026#39;s caption that he is \u0026#34;doing OK and did not break any bones or suffer any major injuries,\u0026#34; but he is \u0026#34;a bit bruised up looking like a purple potato.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn the clip, he raises up his chef\u0026#39;s coat to show a massive bruise that wraps around his torso. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eSquatters take over Gordon Ramsay\u0026#39;s pub: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/2024/04/18/gordon-ramsay-london-pub-squatters-rights/73358728007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eCelebrity chef fights to take it back\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74116709007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to Ramsay\u0026#39;s representative for updates.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe celebrity chef did not share many details about the accident but says he was treated at Lawrence + Memorial Hospital in New London, and he thanked the \u0026#34;incredible trauma surgeons, doctors (and) nurses\u0026#34; who looked after him.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eRamsay, who said he is \u0026#34;in pain\u0026#34; after the \u0026#34;brutal\u0026#34; week, also turned his update into a PSA about the importance of wearing a helmet, telling his followers he wouldn\u0026#39;t \u0026#34;be here now\u0026#34; if he didn\u0026#39;t. He shared photos from before and after the accident, with the latter showing his banged-up helmet. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eSign up for our Watch Party newsletter:  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eWe deliver the best movie and TV recommendations to your inbox\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74116765007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;You\u0026#39;ve got to wear a helmet,\u0026#34; Ramsay stressed. \u0026#34;I don\u0026#39;t care how short the journey is. I don\u0026#39;t care the fact that these helmets cost money. But they\u0026#39;re crucial.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u0026#34;Kitchen Nightmares\u0026#34; star received many supportive comments on his Instagram post, and celebrity chef Nick DiGiovanni wrote, \u0026#34;Wow − that\u0026#39;s really scary. Glad you\u0026#39;re okay.\u0026#34; Other followers expressed shock at the size of Ramsay\u0026#39;s bruise. \u0026#34;That is gnarly,\u0026#34; one comment read. \u0026#34;Glad you\u0026#39;re okay, chef.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eRamsay\u0026#39;s message came after Nina Dobrev, 35, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/20/nina-dobrev-hospitalized-accident/73777209007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003esaid last month\u003c/a\u003e she was injured in a biking accident. On Instagram, \u0026#34;The Vampire Diaries\u0026#34; star shared before-and-after photos, the first showing her on an e-bike and the second showing her in the hospital. \u0026#34;How it started vs how it’s going,\u0026#34; she captioned the post.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eWhere to watch new season: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2023/09/25/kitchen-nightmares-watch-new-season/70964194007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eGordon Ramsay\u0026#39;s Kitchen Nightmares returns to Fox\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73930374007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eDobrev also wrote in an Instagram story at the time, \u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m OK but it\u0026#39;s going to be a long road of recovery ahead.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: KiMi Robinson, USA TODAY\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
