body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "4537977001"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/09/brooke-shields-movie-netflix-mother-of-the-bride/73600936007/\"\u003eBrooke Shields\u003c/a\u003e is choosing both fashion and comfort.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe supermodel and actress turned heads at the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/17/tony-awards-2024-highlights/74046073007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTony Awards\u003c/a\u003e on Sunday wearing a plunge neckline canary yellow dress, which she accessorized with matching Crocs shoes.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShe explained her affordable choice of footwear to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://people.com/2024-tony-awards-brooke-shields-wears-yellow-crocs-after-foot-surgery-see-her-look-8664153#:~:text\u003dOn%20June%2015%2C%20one%20day,the%20accompanying%20caption%20on%20Instagram.\"\u003ePeople magazine\u003c/a\u003e, saying, “I got my Crocs! I couldn’t do this in heels!” \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShields revealed in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/brookeshields/p/C8Noo5DPQlx/?hl\u003den\"\u003ean Instagram post\u003c/a\u003e Friday that she was recovering from a \u0026#34;double foot toe surgery\u0026#34; alongside a photo of her feet in post-surgical gear.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe former model was on hand at the Tonys to introduce Nicole Scherzinger, who gorgeously sang \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dhQ_Fpsoi9IY\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eWhat I Did For Love\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;A Chorus Line\u0026#34; for the in memoriam segment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74120816007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eTony Awards biggest moments: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/17/tony-awards-2024-highlights/74046073007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003e Angelina Jolie wins first Tony, Brooke Shields rocks Crocs\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShields has been on and off Broadway over the years in ensembles for \u0026#34;Chicago,\u0026#34; \u0026#34;Grease,\u0026#34; \u0026#34;Wonderful Town\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;The Addams Family.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Broadway welcomed me when nobody else was welcoming me. I started going to Broadway when I was a little, little girl, so to me it\u0026#39;s a part of my life,\u0026#34; Shields, the newly-elected president of Actors Equity Association, told People Sunday. \u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m usually a replacement. So, that\u0026#39;s exciting for me. If there\u0026#39;s somebody that wins the Tony and they leave the show, that\u0026#39;s a huge honor. So, anywhere they want me!\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAhead of the election for the Actors Equity Association, a union that represents more than \u003ca href\u003d\"https://actorsequity.org/aboutequity/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e51,000 professional actors and stage managers\u003c/a\u003e, Shields told USA TODAY she wanted to become president as a way to use her celebrity status for good.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;The Essentials\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/09/brooke-shields-movie-netflix-mother-of-the-bride/73600936007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eBrooke Shields dishes on downsizing, trolls and embracing her \u0026#39;Mother of the Bride\u0026#39; era\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJoin our Watch Party!  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSign up to receive USA TODAY\u0026#39;s movie and TV recommendations right in your inbox\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I\u0026#39;ve been a member for so long and the theater community has given me so much,\u0026#34; she said. \u0026#34;It felt like it was my time to step up, and this was my way of doing it.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShields added: \u0026#34;In order to make (celebrity) something you don\u0026#39;t try to hide from or resent the lack of privacy, it has to have good (with it). It\u0026#39;s easy to want to become a hermit. I have to feel like I\u0026#39;m harnessing it and I\u0026#39;m not a victim to it. If I can be the voice piece or at least the conduit, well, then there\u0026#39;s value in being famous.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Patrick Ryan\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "4537977001"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/09/brooke-shields-movie-netflix-mother-of-the-bride/73600936007/\"\u003eBrooke Shields\u003c/a\u003e is choosing both fashion and comfort.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe supermodel and actress turned heads at the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/17/tony-awards-2024-highlights/74046073007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTony Awards\u003c/a\u003e on Sunday wearing a plunge neckline canary yellow dress, which she accessorized with matching Crocs shoes.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShe explained her affordable choice of footwear to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://people.com/2024-tony-awards-brooke-shields-wears-yellow-crocs-after-foot-surgery-see-her-look-8664153#:~:text\u003dOn%20June%2015%2C%20one%20day,the%20accompanying%20caption%20on%20Instagram.\"\u003ePeople magazine\u003c/a\u003e, saying, “I got my Crocs! I couldn’t do this in heels!” \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShields revealed in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/brookeshields/p/C8Noo5DPQlx/?hl\u003den\"\u003ean Instagram post\u003c/a\u003e Friday that she was recovering from a \u0026#34;double foot toe surgery\u0026#34; alongside a photo of her feet in post-surgical gear.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe former model was on hand at the Tonys to introduce Nicole Scherzinger, who gorgeously sang \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dhQ_Fpsoi9IY\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eWhat I Did For Love\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;A Chorus Line\u0026#34; for the in memoriam segment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74120816007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eTony Awards biggest moments: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/17/tony-awards-2024-highlights/74046073007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003e Angelina Jolie wins first Tony, Brooke Shields rocks Crocs\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShields has been on and off Broadway over the years in ensembles for \u0026#34;Chicago,\u0026#34; \u0026#34;Grease,\u0026#34; \u0026#34;Wonderful Town\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;The Addams Family.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Broadway welcomed me when nobody else was welcoming me. I started going to Broadway when I was a little, little girl, so to me it\u0026#39;s a part of my life,\u0026#34; Shields, the newly-elected president of Actors Equity Association, told People Sunday. \u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m usually a replacement. So, that\u0026#39;s exciting for me. If there\u0026#39;s somebody that wins the Tony and they leave the show, that\u0026#39;s a huge honor. So, anywhere they want me!\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAhead of the election for the Actors Equity Association, a union that represents more than \u003ca href\u003d\"https://actorsequity.org/aboutequity/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e51,000 professional actors and stage managers\u003c/a\u003e, Shields told USA TODAY she wanted to become president as a way to use her celebrity status for good.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003e\u0026#39;The Essentials\u0026#39;: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/09/brooke-shields-movie-netflix-mother-of-the-bride/73600936007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eBrooke Shields dishes on downsizing, trolls and embracing her \u0026#39;Mother of the Bride\u0026#39; era\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJoin our Watch Party!  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSign up to receive USA TODAY\u0026#39;s movie and TV recommendations right in your inbox\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I\u0026#39;ve been a member for so long and the theater community has given me so much,\u0026#34; she said. \u0026#34;It felt like it was my time to step up, and this was my way of doing it.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShields added: \u0026#34;In order to make (celebrity) something you don\u0026#39;t try to hide from or resent the lack of privacy, it has to have good (with it). It\u0026#39;s easy to want to become a hermit. I have to feel like I\u0026#39;m harnessing it and I\u0026#39;m not a victim to it. If I can be the voice piece or at least the conduit, well, then there\u0026#39;s value in being famous.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Patrick Ryan\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

