body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72162699007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2023/07/27/kylie-jenner-breast-implants-kardashians/70480666007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKylie Jenner\u003c/a\u003e is baring all about criticism surrounding her looks.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eDuring a recent conversation \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/23/the-kardashians-show-kourtney-fetal-surgery-travis-barker/73820458007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eon an episode of \u0026#34;The Kardashians\u0026#34; on Hulu\u003c/a\u003e, aired Thursday, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2023/07/27/kylie-jenner-breast-implants-kardashians/70480666007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ethe makeup mogul\u003c/a\u003e and her supermodel big sister \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/06/06/kendall-jenner-gerry-turner-golden-bachelor/73978668007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKendall Jenner\u003c/a\u003e talk about how they believe their family is \u0026#34;dehumanized.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;If you talked the same way you do about us about any other woman, people would come to their defense all day long,\u0026#34; Kendall Jenner said on the show. \u0026#34;But for some reason, with us, people don\u0026#39;t think we have any feelings.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It\u0026#39;s, like, a miracle that I can still have confidence, and look in the mirror and think I\u0026#39;m pretty,\u0026#34; Kylie Jenner agreed, saying to the cameras that \u0026#34;after 10-plus years of hearing about (my looks), it just gets exhausting.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73594233007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eKylie Jenner says she regrets breast \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2023/07/27/kylie-jenner-breast-implants-kardashians/70480666007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eimplants at 19: \u0026#39;Wish I never got them done\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe mom to Aire, 2, and Stormi, 6, said she\u0026#39;s been \u0026#34;on a journey\u0026#34; over the last year. She added that she dissolved half of her lip filler and said the criticism is \u0026#34;just never going to change\u0026#34; with her. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It\u0026#39;s just like, why do people think it\u0026#39;s OK to talk about me?\u0026#34; she said, as Kendall Jenner hugged her through tears, adding that this is like \u0026#34;therapy\u0026#34; and saying she\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;never cried about this before, but I guess it does affect me.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "104462370"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;People have been talking about my looks since I was 12, 13. Before I even got lip filler, people were talking about my looks,\u0026#34; Kylie Jenner added. \u0026#34;I look old, I see it under every post.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;You\u0026#39;ve never looked younger, and you\u0026#39;ve never looked better,\u0026#34; Kendall Jenner responded before her little sister called herself \u0026#34;really strong\u0026#34; and a confident person, but said she\u0026#39;s also human. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Sadly, it\u0026#39;s just something that we have to really grow tough skin on,\u0026#34; the model told Kylie Jenner.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eKylie Jenner said she regretted getting breast implants at 19: \u0026#39;Wish I never got them done\u0026#39;\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eLast year, Jenner revealed she \u0026#34;got my breasts done\u0026#34; when she was 19, shortly before giving birth to daughter Stormi.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I just wish I never got them done to begin with,\u0026#34; Jenner told friend Anastasia Karanikolaou on an episode of \u0026#34;The Kardashians.\u0026#34; \u0026#34;(I) would recommend anyone who is thinking about it to wait until after children.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eJenner further reflected on how motherhood has affected her views on plastic surgery.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I have a daughter too. I would be heartbroken if she wanted to get her body done at 19,\u0026#34; Jenner said. \u0026#34;I want to be the best mom and best example for her. I wish I could be her and do it all differently, ‘cause I wouldn’t touch anything.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Edward Segarra\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72162699007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2023/07/27/kylie-jenner-breast-implants-kardashians/70480666007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKylie Jenner\u003c/a\u003e is baring all about criticism surrounding her looks.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eDuring a recent conversation \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/23/the-kardashians-show-kourtney-fetal-surgery-travis-barker/73820458007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eon an episode of \u0026#34;The Kardashians\u0026#34; on Hulu\u003c/a\u003e, aired Thursday, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2023/07/27/kylie-jenner-breast-implants-kardashians/70480666007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ethe makeup mogul\u003c/a\u003e and her supermodel big sister \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/06/06/kendall-jenner-gerry-turner-golden-bachelor/73978668007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eKendall Jenner\u003c/a\u003e talk about how they believe their family is \u0026#34;dehumanized.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;If you talked the same way you do about us about any other woman, people would come to their defense all day long,\u0026#34; Kendall Jenner said on the show. \u0026#34;But for some reason, with us, people don\u0026#39;t think we have any feelings.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It\u0026#39;s, like, a miracle that I can still have confidence, and look in the mirror and think I\u0026#39;m pretty,\u0026#34; Kylie Jenner agreed, saying to the cameras that \u0026#34;after 10-plus years of hearing about (my looks), it just gets exhausting.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73594233007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eKylie Jenner says she regrets breast \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2023/07/27/kylie-jenner-breast-implants-kardashians/70480666007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eimplants at 19: \u0026#39;Wish I never got them done\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe mom to Aire, 2, and Stormi, 6, said she\u0026#39;s been \u0026#34;on a journey\u0026#34; over the last year. She added that she dissolved half of her lip filler and said the criticism is \u0026#34;just never going to change\u0026#34; with her. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It\u0026#39;s just like, why do people think it\u0026#39;s OK to talk about me?\u0026#34; she said, as Kendall Jenner hugged her through tears, adding that this is like \u0026#34;therapy\u0026#34; and saying she\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;never cried about this before, but I guess it does affect me.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "104462370"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;People have been talking about my looks since I was 12, 13. Before I even got lip filler, people were talking about my looks,\u0026#34; Kylie Jenner added. \u0026#34;I look old, I see it under every post.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;You\u0026#39;ve never looked younger, and you\u0026#39;ve never looked better,\u0026#34; Kendall Jenner responded before her little sister called herself \u0026#34;really strong\u0026#34; and a confident person, but said she\u0026#39;s also human. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Sadly, it\u0026#39;s just something that we have to really grow tough skin on,\u0026#34; the model told Kylie Jenner.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eKylie Jenner said she regretted getting breast implants at 19: \u0026#39;Wish I never got them done\u0026#39;\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eLast year, Jenner revealed she \u0026#34;got my breasts done\u0026#34; when she was 19, shortly before giving birth to daughter Stormi.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I just wish I never got them done to begin with,\u0026#34; Jenner told friend Anastasia Karanikolaou on an episode of \u0026#34;The Kardashians.\u0026#34; \u0026#34;(I) would recommend anyone who is thinking about it to wait until after children.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eJenner further reflected on how motherhood has affected her views on plastic surgery.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I have a daughter too. I would be heartbroken if she wanted to get her body done at 19,\u0026#34; Jenner said. \u0026#34;I want to be the best mom and best example for her. I wish I could be her and do it all differently, ‘cause I wouldn’t touch anything.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Edward Segarra\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

