body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74067629007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/12/miley-cyrus-addresses-estrangement-billy-ray-cyrus/74075992007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eBilly Ray Cyrus\u003c/a\u003e and his estranged wife \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/10/26/billy-ray-cyrus-dog-introduced-him-to-firerose/71333648007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eFirerose\u003c/a\u003e are accusing each other of alleged abuse following their \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/11/billy-ray-cyrus-divorce-firerose/74062238007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003edivorce\u003c/a\u003e after only \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/10/11/billy-ray-cyrus-firerose-wedding-tish-cyrus-miley-cyrus/71146103007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eseven months of marriage\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn a Monday court filing in Tennessee\u0026#39;s Williamson County Chancery Court, obtained by USA TODAY Tuesday, Cyrus responded to Firerose\u0026#39;s June 14 counter-complaint by claiming the marriage was \u0026#34;induced by fraud.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn the case, Firerose, 36, is referred to by the name Johanna Rosie Hodges. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe singer, 62, claims Firerose\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;allegations of abuse were only made to sensationalize her false complaints by using the word \u0026#39;abuse.\u0026#39;\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCyrus adds that while he \u0026#34;would acknowledge that he was certainly vocal, frustrated and angry with the Defendant (Firerose) in May 2024, it is the Plaintiff (Cyrus) who, in fact, has been abused.\u0026#34; He claims he was \u0026#34;not only verbally and emotionally\u0026#34; abused by Firerose \u0026#34;but also physically abused\u0026#34; by her.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74211873007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAccording to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://people.com/firerose-accuses-billy-ray-cyrus-of-domestic-abuse-8665781\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePeople\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.etonline.com/firerose-accuses-billy-ray-cyrus-of-domestic-abuse-in-response-to-his-divorce-filing-227662\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eEntertainment Tonight\u003c/a\u003e, Firerose claimed in her counter-complaint earlier this month that she\u0026#39;d experienced verbal, emotional and psychological abuse from Cyrus.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Wife was subjected to Husband’s persistent drug use accompanied with the consumption of marijuana which made Husband unpredictable and volatile towards Wife,\u0026#34; the document reportedly read.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eReps for Cyrus declined to comment. USA TODAY has reached out to Firerose\u0026#39;s attorneys for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eBilly Ray Cyrus claims Firerose was \u0026#39;hiding\u0026#39; information \u0026#39;to induce marriage\u0026#39; \u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn May 23, Cyrus, who is \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/03/miley-cyrus-talks-friendship-beyonce-writing-ii-most-wanted-cowboy-carter/73957724007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMiley Cyrus\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#39; father, filed to divorce Firerose. In his petition, Cyrus cited irreconcilable differences and inappropriate marital conduct as the primary reasons, according to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://people.com/billy-ray-cyrus-files-for-divorce-from-firerose-alleges-inappropriate-marital-conduct-8661668\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePeople magazine\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.etonline.com/billy-ray-cyrus-files-for-divorce-from-wife-firerose-citing-inappropriate-marital-conduct-227142\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eEntertainment Tonight\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn his Monday filing, the \u0026#34;Achy Breaky Heart\u0026#34; singer claimed to have left their home after discovering in May that Hodges was not his wife\u0026#39;s maiden name. He alleges the Australian musician \u0026#34;had lied\u0026#34; about her name \u0026#34;to induce marriage\u0026#34; and that there are \u0026#34;additional things in her background she is hiding from him.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72089387007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn her counter-complaint, according to People and ET, Firerose alleged Cyrus had promised to pay for the procedure and filed his divorce petition a day before her planned double mastectomy on May 24, which caused her to delay the preventive procedure. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShe said that in 2020, she found out she was a carrier of the BRCA1 gene mutation.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCyrus responded that he did not know about this aspect of her health history until after they were married and asserted that while she had a doctor\u0026#39;s appointment scheduled for May 24, her surgery was not until June 6. He denied offering to pay for uncovered expenses related to the procedure, alleging Firerose said there would be no out-of-pocket costs.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eThrowback to the wedding: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/10/11/billy-ray-cyrus-firerose-wedding-tish-cyrus-miley-cyrus/71146103007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eBilly Ray Cyrus and Firerose had an \u0026#39;ethereal celebration\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe also says Firerose threatened that if he tried to divorce her she would \u0026#34;tell everyone that you did it because of the double mastectomy and your career will be over.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn April 2022, ex-wife Tish Cyrus-Purcell \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2022/04/11/billy-ray-cyrus-wife-tish-cyrus-file-divorce/7276538001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003efiled to divorce\u003c/a\u003e Billy Ray Cyrus, citing irreconcilable differences. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThey share children Braison, Noah and Miley Cyrus as well as Trace and Brandi Cyrus, Tish\u0026#39;s children from a prior relationship. Billy Ray Cyrus also has a 32-year-old son, Christopher Cody, with ex-girlfriend Kristin Luckey.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Edward Segarra\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74067629007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/12/miley-cyrus-addresses-estrangement-billy-ray-cyrus/74075992007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eBilly Ray Cyrus\u003c/a\u003e and his estranged wife \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/10/26/billy-ray-cyrus-dog-introduced-him-to-firerose/71333648007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eFirerose\u003c/a\u003e are accusing each other of alleged abuse following their \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/11/billy-ray-cyrus-divorce-firerose/74062238007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003edivorce\u003c/a\u003e after only \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/10/11/billy-ray-cyrus-firerose-wedding-tish-cyrus-miley-cyrus/71146103007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eseven months of marriage\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn a Monday court filing in Tennessee\u0026#39;s Williamson County Chancery Court, obtained by USA TODAY Tuesday, Cyrus responded to Firerose\u0026#39;s June 14 counter-complaint by claiming the marriage was \u0026#34;induced by fraud.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn the case, Firerose, 36, is referred to by the name Johanna Rosie Hodges. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe singer, 62, claims Firerose\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;allegations of abuse were only made to sensationalize her false complaints by using the word \u0026#39;abuse.\u0026#39;\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCyrus adds that while he \u0026#34;would acknowledge that he was certainly vocal, frustrated and angry with the Defendant (Firerose) in May 2024, it is the Plaintiff (Cyrus) who, in fact, has been abused.\u0026#34; He claims he was \u0026#34;not only verbally and emotionally\u0026#34; abused by Firerose \u0026#34;but also physically abused\u0026#34; by her.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74211873007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAccording to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://people.com/firerose-accuses-billy-ray-cyrus-of-domestic-abuse-8665781\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePeople\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.etonline.com/firerose-accuses-billy-ray-cyrus-of-domestic-abuse-in-response-to-his-divorce-filing-227662\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eEntertainment Tonight\u003c/a\u003e, Firerose claimed in her counter-complaint earlier this month that she\u0026#39;d experienced verbal, emotional and psychological abuse from Cyrus.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Wife was subjected to Husband’s persistent drug use accompanied with the consumption of marijuana which made Husband unpredictable and volatile towards Wife,\u0026#34; the document reportedly read.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eReps for Cyrus declined to comment. USA TODAY has reached out to Firerose\u0026#39;s attorneys for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eBilly Ray Cyrus claims Firerose was \u0026#39;hiding\u0026#39; information \u0026#39;to induce marriage\u0026#39; \u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn May 23, Cyrus, who is \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/03/miley-cyrus-talks-friendship-beyonce-writing-ii-most-wanted-cowboy-carter/73957724007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMiley Cyrus\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#39; father, filed to divorce Firerose. In his petition, Cyrus cited irreconcilable differences and inappropriate marital conduct as the primary reasons, according to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://people.com/billy-ray-cyrus-files-for-divorce-from-firerose-alleges-inappropriate-marital-conduct-8661668\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePeople magazine\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.etonline.com/billy-ray-cyrus-files-for-divorce-from-wife-firerose-citing-inappropriate-marital-conduct-227142\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eEntertainment Tonight\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn his Monday filing, the \u0026#34;Achy Breaky Heart\u0026#34; singer claimed to have left their home after discovering in May that Hodges was not his wife\u0026#39;s maiden name. He alleges the Australian musician \u0026#34;had lied\u0026#34; about her name \u0026#34;to induce marriage\u0026#34; and that there are \u0026#34;additional things in her background she is hiding from him.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72089387007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn her counter-complaint, according to People and ET, Firerose alleged Cyrus had promised to pay for the procedure and filed his divorce petition a day before her planned double mastectomy on May 24, which caused her to delay the preventive procedure. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShe said that in 2020, she found out she was a carrier of the BRCA1 gene mutation.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCyrus responded that he did not know about this aspect of her health history until after they were married and asserted that while she had a doctor\u0026#39;s appointment scheduled for May 24, her surgery was not until June 6. He denied offering to pay for uncovered expenses related to the procedure, alleging Firerose said there would be no out-of-pocket costs.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eThrowback to the wedding: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/10/11/billy-ray-cyrus-firerose-wedding-tish-cyrus-miley-cyrus/71146103007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eBilly Ray Cyrus and Firerose had an \u0026#39;ethereal celebration\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe also says Firerose threatened that if he tried to divorce her she would \u0026#34;tell everyone that you did it because of the double mastectomy and your career will be over.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn April 2022, ex-wife Tish Cyrus-Purcell \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2022/04/11/billy-ray-cyrus-wife-tish-cyrus-file-divorce/7276538001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003efiled to divorce\u003c/a\u003e Billy Ray Cyrus, citing irreconcilable differences. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThey share children Braison, Noah and Miley Cyrus as well as Trace and Brandi Cyrus, Tish\u0026#39;s children from a prior relationship. Billy Ray Cyrus also has a 32-year-old son, Christopher Cody, with ex-girlfriend Kristin Luckey.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Edward Segarra\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

