    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eAn unnamed woman has sued \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2020/05/11/diplo-confirms-he-has-son-former-miss-universe-contestant/3112068001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eDiplo\u003c/a\u003e, claiming she is a victim of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/02/29/rachel-leviss-sues-tom-sandoval-ariana-madix-revenge-porn/72791449007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003erevenge pornography\u003c/a\u003e distributed by the Grammy-winning \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/04/03/travis-kelce-kelce-jam-lineup-tickets/73188801007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eDJ and music producer\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
