    "value": "\u003cp\u003eOne of Jane Doe\u0026#39;s attorneys, Helene M. Weiss, said in a statement shared with USA TODAY, \u0026#34;Tragically, this is not the first time the defendant has shamed and violated a woman by disseminating intimate images without her consent.\u003c/p\u003e"
