  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eCourt records reviewed by USA TODAY show Diplo filed a civil harassment petition against Auguste in August 2023. The following month, according to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://pitchfork.com/news/diplo-accused-of-distributing-revenge-porn-in-new-police-report/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePitchfork\u003c/a\u003e, Auguste filed a lawsuit against Diplo accusing him of revenge porn. Court records show several different ongoing cases between the two.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
