    "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn response to Auguste\u0026#39;s accusations, in October 2021 Diplo \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CUtHQ1is-5H/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eposted on Instagram\u003c/a\u003e detailing his denials of her various claims. He called her \u0026#34;an obsessed fan of mine.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eAfter I relinquished all contact with her, it appears that her only purpose in life has been to disrupt my work, my business, harass me and my close friends and attack me and threaten my family.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
