body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73285712007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/11/jk-rowling-responds-harry-potter-stars-criticism-anti-trans-views/73293111007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJ.K. Rowling\u003c/a\u003e is beefing with another \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2021/11/16/harry-potter-sorcerers-stone-20th-anniversary-daniel-radcliffe-emma-watson/8629518002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Harry Potter\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e star. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/tech/reviewed/2023/04/19/harry-potter-tv-series-max-everything-we-know-so-far/11687365002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Harry Potter\u0026#34; franchise author\u003c/a\u003e is calling out \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2021/11/16/harry-potter-sorcerers-stone-20th-anniversary-daniel-radcliffe-emma-watson/8629518002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Harry Potter and The Goblet of Fire\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e star and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/05/10/doctor-who-ncuti-gatwa-interview/73611231007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Doctor Who\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e alum \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/tv/2017/06/27/david-tennant-broadchurch-final-season/103202668/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eDavid Tennant\u003c/a\u003e, one of Britain\u0026#39;s most outspoken trans advocates. Tennant is dad to a transgender son.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe called out anti-LGBTQ+ activists in his speech at \u003ca href\u003d\"https://britishlgbtawards.com/2024/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe British LGBT Awards\u003c/a\u003e, including conservative British politician Kemi Badenoch, one of the most anti-trans leaders in the country, who he said should \u0026#34;shut up.\u0026#34; He added that Pride is about \u0026#34;common sense\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;human decency.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBut that didn\u0026#39;t sit right with the outspoken bestselling author.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73176220007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;But the utterances of the Gender Taliban receive special dispensation, for they are a holy caste,\u0026#34; \u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/jk_rowling/status/1805981959459307901\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eRowling posted on X, formerly known as Twitter.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJ.K. Rowling says \u0026#39;Harry Potter\u0026#39; stars  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/11/jk-rowling-responds-harry-potter-stars-criticism-anti-trans-views/73293111007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ewho\u0026#39;ve criticized her anti-trans views \u0026#39;can save their apologies\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShe continued \u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/jk_rowling/status/1806599936504467891?ref_src\u003dtwsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1806599936504467891%7Ctwgr%5E0afb6f75f3a76bf05c3d4723d67aaa8a656cc803%7Ctwcon%5Es1_\u0026ref_url\u003dhttps%3A%2F%2Fdeadline.com%2F2024%2F06%2Fjk-rowling-david-tennant-gender-taliban-trans-harry-potter-1235985749%2F\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ein a separate X post: \u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34;This man is talking about rape survivors who want female-only care, the nurses currently suing their health trust for making them change in front of a man, girls and women losing sporting opportunities to males and female prisoners incarcerated with convicted sex offenders.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to reps for Tennant for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn late April, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/11/jk-rowling-responds-harry-potter-stars-criticism-anti-trans-views/73293111007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Harry Potter\u0026#34; star Daniel Radcliffe\u003c/a\u003e opened up to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.theatlantic.com/magazine/archive/2024/06/daniel-radcliffe-merrily-we-roll-along-jk-rowling/678219/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Atlantic\u003c/a\u003e in an interview about Rowling\u0026#39;s anti-trans views and his own work for LGBTQ+ rights, including \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/nation/2021/07/13/lgbtq-nonbinary-study-trevor-project/7946858002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewith LGBTQ+ youth\u003c/a\u003e advocacy organization \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.thetrevorproject.org/?c_src\u003dUMCOF240010260\u0026c_src2\u003dNebo-Paid-Search\u0026msclkid\u003dd0c552d25a501ea577c434e017e8ecf8\u0026utm_medium\u003dfundraising\u0026utm_source\u003dbing\u0026utm_campaign\u003dgeneraleffort\u0026utm_source\u003dbing\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Trevor Project\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It would have seemed like, I don\u0026#39;t know, immense cowardice to me to not say something,\u0026#34; Radcliffe told the outlet. \u0026#34;I wanted to try and help people that had been negatively affected by the comments and to say that if those are Jo\u0026#39;s views, then they are not the views of everybody associated with the \u0026#39;Potter\u0026#39; franchise.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "9071733002"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74015042007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eRowling previously responded to a fan\u0026#39;s \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/StAustellAdam/status/1778108054581494069\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003epost on X\u003c/a\u003e about feeling \u0026#34;safe in the knowledge\u0026#34; that she would forgive \u0026#34;Harry Potter\u0026#34; stars such as \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/04/25/daniel-radcliffe-erin-darke-welcome-first-baby/11735261002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eRadcliffe\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2021/03/27/seth-rogen-emma-watson-walked-off-this-end-set/7030113002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eEmma Watson\u003c/a\u003e, who have denounced the author\u0026#39;s \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/03/07/india-willoughby-reports-jk-rowling-to-police-anti-trans-post/72888640007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eanti-trans rhetoric\u003c/a\u003e. Rowling wrote, \u0026#34;Not safe, I\u0026#39;m afraid.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Celebs who cosied up to a movement intent on eroding women\u0026#39;s hard-won rights and who used their platforms to cheer on the transitioning of minors can save their apologies for traumatised detransitioners and vulnerable women reliant on single sex spaces,\u0026#34; \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/jk_rowling/status/1778124467027267804\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eher post\u003c/a\u003e continued.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Naledi Ushe\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73285712007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/11/jk-rowling-responds-harry-potter-stars-criticism-anti-trans-views/73293111007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJ.K. Rowling\u003c/a\u003e is beefing with another \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2021/11/16/harry-potter-sorcerers-stone-20th-anniversary-daniel-radcliffe-emma-watson/8629518002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Harry Potter\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e star. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/tech/reviewed/2023/04/19/harry-potter-tv-series-max-everything-we-know-so-far/11687365002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Harry Potter\u0026#34; franchise author\u003c/a\u003e is calling out \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2021/11/16/harry-potter-sorcerers-stone-20th-anniversary-daniel-radcliffe-emma-watson/8629518002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Harry Potter and The Goblet of Fire\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e star and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/05/10/doctor-who-ncuti-gatwa-interview/73611231007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Doctor Who\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e alum \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/tv/2017/06/27/david-tennant-broadchurch-final-season/103202668/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eDavid Tennant\u003c/a\u003e, one of Britain\u0026#39;s most outspoken trans advocates. Tennant is dad to a transgender son.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe called out anti-LGBTQ+ activists in his speech at \u003ca href\u003d\"https://britishlgbtawards.com/2024/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe British LGBT Awards\u003c/a\u003e, including conservative British politician Kemi Badenoch, one of the most anti-trans leaders in the country, who he said should \u0026#34;shut up.\u0026#34; He added that Pride is about \u0026#34;common sense\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;human decency.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBut that didn\u0026#39;t sit right with the outspoken bestselling author.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73176220007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;But the utterances of the Gender Taliban receive special dispensation, for they are a holy caste,\u0026#34; \u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/jk_rowling/status/1805981959459307901\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eRowling posted on X, formerly known as Twitter.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJ.K. Rowling says \u0026#39;Harry Potter\u0026#39; stars  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/11/jk-rowling-responds-harry-potter-stars-criticism-anti-trans-views/73293111007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ewho\u0026#39;ve criticized her anti-trans views \u0026#39;can save their apologies\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eShe continued \u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/jk_rowling/status/1806599936504467891?ref_src\u003dtwsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1806599936504467891%7Ctwgr%5E0afb6f75f3a76bf05c3d4723d67aaa8a656cc803%7Ctwcon%5Es1_\u0026ref_url\u003dhttps%3A%2F%2Fdeadline.com%2F2024%2F06%2Fjk-rowling-david-tennant-gender-taliban-trans-harry-potter-1235985749%2F\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ein a separate X post: \u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34;This man is talking about rape survivors who want female-only care, the nurses currently suing their health trust for making them change in front of a man, girls and women losing sporting opportunities to males and female prisoners incarcerated with convicted sex offenders.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eUSA TODAY has reached out to reps for Tennant for comment.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn late April, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/04/11/jk-rowling-responds-harry-potter-stars-criticism-anti-trans-views/73293111007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Harry Potter\u0026#34; star Daniel Radcliffe\u003c/a\u003e opened up to \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.theatlantic.com/magazine/archive/2024/06/daniel-radcliffe-merrily-we-roll-along-jk-rowling/678219/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Atlantic\u003c/a\u003e in an interview about Rowling\u0026#39;s anti-trans views and his own work for LGBTQ+ rights, including \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/nation/2021/07/13/lgbtq-nonbinary-study-trevor-project/7946858002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewith LGBTQ+ youth\u003c/a\u003e advocacy organization \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.thetrevorproject.org/?c_src\u003dUMCOF240010260\u0026c_src2\u003dNebo-Paid-Search\u0026msclkid\u003dd0c552d25a501ea577c434e017e8ecf8\u0026utm_medium\u003dfundraising\u0026utm_source\u003dbing\u0026utm_campaign\u003dgeneraleffort\u0026utm_source\u003dbing\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eThe Trevor Project\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;It would have seemed like, I don\u0026#39;t know, immense cowardice to me to not say something,\u0026#34; Radcliffe told the outlet. \u0026#34;I wanted to try and help people that had been negatively affected by the comments and to say that if those are Jo\u0026#39;s views, then they are not the views of everybody associated with the \u0026#39;Potter\u0026#39; franchise.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "9071733002"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74015042007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eRowling previously responded to a fan\u0026#39;s \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/StAustellAdam/status/1778108054581494069\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003epost on X\u003c/a\u003e about feeling \u0026#34;safe in the knowledge\u0026#34; that she would forgive \u0026#34;Harry Potter\u0026#34; stars such as \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2023/04/25/daniel-radcliffe-erin-darke-welcome-first-baby/11735261002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eRadcliffe\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2021/03/27/seth-rogen-emma-watson-walked-off-this-end-set/7030113002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eEmma Watson\u003c/a\u003e, who have denounced the author\u0026#39;s \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/03/07/india-willoughby-reports-jk-rowling-to-police-anti-trans-post/72888640007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eanti-trans rhetoric\u003c/a\u003e. Rowling wrote, \u0026#34;Not safe, I\u0026#39;m afraid.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Celebs who cosied up to a movement intent on eroding women\u0026#39;s hard-won rights and who used their platforms to cheer on the transitioning of minors can save their apologies for traumatised detransitioners and vulnerable women reliant on single sex spaces,\u0026#34; \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/jk_rowling/status/1778124467027267804\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eher post\u003c/a\u003e continued.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Naledi Ushe\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

contentBody:
