      "value": "74266741007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eStill others posted a version of a joke comedy writer Jim Downey \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dGKfHcas_cZg\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003emade on Conan O\u0026#39;Brien\u0026#39;s podcast\u003c/a\u003e where he pretended to only know sex offender \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/politics/2024/01/12/jeffrey-epstein-list-trump-clinton-money/72095338007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJeffrey Epstein\u003c/a\u003e as a New York financier. \u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m talking about OJ Simpson the NFL Running Back?\u0026#34; \u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/LocalSoundwave/status/1807620437850886597\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eone X user posted\u003c/a\u003e alongside a screenshot from Downey\u0026#39;s bit. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
