    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe even threw his arms open and shouted \u0026#34;Cats!\u0026#34; (his term of endearment). The night continued with a sober Davis pouring drinks from behind the sunken bar in his living room and regaling the group with stories. Davis was a fan of the generation of young actors taking over Hollywood who would have the reductive Brat Pack label thrust upon them.\u003c/p\u003e"
