    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I remember this like it was yesterday,\u0026#34; says McCarthy. \u0026#34;Sammy was like, \u0026#39;I got my eye on you, cats. I love what you do.\u0026#39; And he was smoking. It was like, \u0026#39;Oh, my God, Sammy Davis Jr. is doing his point at me.\u0026#39; \u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
