  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eLove movies? Live for TV? USA TODAY\u0026#39;s Watch Party newsletter has all the best recommendations, delivered right to your inbox. \u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eSign up now\u003c/a\u003e and be one of the cool kids.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
