  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eNow let\u0026#39;s get to the good stuff:\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eSee Will Smith and Martin Lawrence\u0026#39;s top cops in \u0026#39;Bad Boys: Ride or Die\u0026#39;\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73954478007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
