  "contentBody": [{
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74008865007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eSpoiler alert! We\u0026#39;re discussing plot points in Netflix\u0026#39;s new fake assassin movie \u0026#34;Hit Man.\u0026#34; Stop reading now if you haven\u0026#39;t seen it yet and don\u0026#39;t want to know.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/06/07/hit-man-movie-2024-glen-powell-interview/73953847007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2024/06/07/hit-man-movie-2024-glen-powell-interview/73953847007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Hit Man\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e is a romantic comedy that aims to kill your notion of who a hit man can be.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
