  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003ePowell co-wrote \u0026#34;Hit Man,\u0026#34; which is based on a 2001 \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.texasmonthly.com/true-crime/hit-man-2/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTexas Monthly article by Skip Hollandsworth\u003c/a\u003e, with director Richard Linklater (\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/movies/2014/07/09/boyhood-richard-linklater-ethan-hawke-astros/12377511/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/movies/2014/07/09/boyhood-richard-linklater-ethan-hawke-astros/12377511/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Boyhood,\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/movies/2016/03/31/richard-linklater-blake-jenner-everybody-wants-some/82425704/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/movies/2016/03/31/richard-linklater-blake-jenner-everybody-wants-some/82425704/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Everybody Wants Some!!\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e). Powell, 35, told USA TODAY that he dove into the script in order to grab a role he didn\u0026#39;t think he\u0026#39;d otherwise get. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJoin our Watch Party!  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSign up to receive USA TODAY\u0026#39;s movie and TV recommendations right in your inbox\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74040193007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The one thing that you realize about Hollywood is no one\u0026#39;s ever going to give you the role that you\u0026#39;ve dreamed of,\u0026#34; he said. \u0026#34;You have to bake it up yourself.\u0026#34;  \u003c/p\u003e"
