  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eDid the murders in the Netflix movie \u0026#39;Hit Man\u0026#39; really happen?\u003c/h2\u003e"
