body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "899753002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe Colemans are back and getting freaky again!\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAfter more than two decades, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/08/bette-midler-sue-lindsay-lohan-sitcom/73617780007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLindsay Lohan\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/03/11/jamie-lee-curtis-in-n-out-oscars-tradition/72928335007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eOscar-winner Jamie Lee Curtis\u003c/a\u003e are reuniting for a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2023/05/11/freaky-friday-sequel-jamie-lee-curtis-lindsay-lohan-movie-explained/70206661007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003esequel to \u0026#34;Freaky Friday.\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eWalt Disney Studios released images of Lohan, 37, and Curtis, 65, on the set of the untitled sequel to the 2003 classic \u0026#34;Freaky Friday.\u0026#34; The two actors held hands and naturally posed in front of each other\u0026#39;s trailers for the body-switching comedy sequel.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCurtis starred as overworked mother Tess Coleman and Lohan as her teenage daughter Anna who wake up to discover they have switched bodies in the 2003 comedy \u0026#34;Freaky Friday.\u0026#34; Chaos ensues as the two try to live each other\u0026#39;s lives until they figure out a solution.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74195016007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn the sequel, adult Anna now has a daughter of her own and a soon-to-be stepdaughter. \u0026#34;As they navigate the myriad challenges that come when two families merge, Tess and Anna discover that lightning might indeed strike twice,\u0026#34; Disney said in a statement on Monday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;We are freaking out because the Colemans are getting freaky again,\u0026#34; Curtis \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/jamieleecurtis/?hl\u003den\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewrote on Instagram \u003c/a\u003eon Monday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74194338007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"marker\"\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.usatoday.com/newsletters/watch-party/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJoin our Watch Party!\u003c/strong\u003e Sign up to receive USA TODAY\u0026#39;s movie and TV recommendations right in your inbox\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003e\u0026#39;Freaky Friday\u0026#39; sequel cast\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOther returning cast members from the original film include Mark Harmon (who played Tess Coleman\u0026#39;s fiance Ryan), \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/entertainthis/2019/04/22/jamie-lee-curtis-chad-michael-murray-made-out-during-freaky-friday/3539726002/\"\u003eChad Michael Murray\u003c/a\u003e (who played Anna\u0026#39;s boyfriend Jake), Christina Vidal Mitchell (Maddie), Haley Hudson (Peg), Lucille Soong (Pei-Pei’s Mom), Stephen Tobolowsky (Mr. Bates), and Rosalind Chao (Pei-Pei). The returning crew are joined by Julia Butters, Sophia Hammons, Manny Jacinto (\u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2022/08/23/top-gun-maverick-tom-cruise-training-flight/7869620001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTop Gun: Maverick\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#34;), and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2021/07/19/mindy-kaling-maitreyi-ramakrishnan-never-have-i-ever-season-2-interview/7987438002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eMaitreyi Ramakrishnan\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eJordan Weiss (\u0026#34;Doll Face\u0026#34;) is the screenwriter, and Nisha Ganatra will direct the new film.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73185236007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWhen does \u0026#39;Freaky Friday 2\u0026#39; come out?\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe new film with be directed by Nisha Ganatra and is due in theaters next year. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWhere to watch \u0026#39;Freaky Friday\u0026#39;\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCurtis and Lohan\u0026#39;s 2003 version of \u0026#34;Freaky Friday\u0026#34; is available to watch on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.disneyplus.com/movies/freaky-friday/3fHmXbluw63h\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eDisney+\u003c/a\u003e ahead of the sequel.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "11844886002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eHow many \u0026#39;Freaky Friday\u0026#39; movies are there?\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCurtis and Lohan\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;Freaky Friday\u0026#34; isn\u0026#39;t the first, nor the last rendition of Mary Rodgers\u0026#39; novel.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026#34;Freaky Friday\u0026#34; (1976):\u003c/strong\u003e The original film adaption starred \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0076054/\"\u003eJodie Foster and Barbara Harris\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026#34;Freaky Friday\u0026#34; (2003):\u003c/strong\u003e Curtis and Lohan played mother and daughter.\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026#34;Freaky Friday\u0026#34; (2018)\u003c/strong\u003e: Disney made a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/allthemoms/2018/08/03/freaky-friday-cozi-zuehlsdorff-heidi-blickstaff-disney/893154002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003emusical adaptation\u003c/a\u003e with Cozi Zuehlsdorff as daughter Elle and Heidi Blickenstaff as mother Katherine.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Naledi Ushe\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "899753002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe Colemans are back and getting freaky again!\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAfter more than two decades, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/08/bette-midler-sue-lindsay-lohan-sitcom/73617780007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLindsay Lohan\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/03/11/jamie-lee-curtis-in-n-out-oscars-tradition/72928335007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eOscar-winner Jamie Lee Curtis\u003c/a\u003e are reuniting for a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2023/05/11/freaky-friday-sequel-jamie-lee-curtis-lindsay-lohan-movie-explained/70206661007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003esequel to \u0026#34;Freaky Friday.\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eWalt Disney Studios released images of Lohan, 37, and Curtis, 65, on the set of the untitled sequel to the 2003 classic \u0026#34;Freaky Friday.\u0026#34; The two actors held hands and naturally posed in front of each other\u0026#39;s trailers for the body-switching comedy sequel.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
