      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe Colemans are back!\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAfter more than two decades, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/05/08/bette-midler-sue-lindsay-lohan-sitcom/73617780007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLindsay Lohan\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/03/11/jamie-lee-curtis-in-n-out-oscars-tradition/72928335007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eOscar-winner Jamie Lee Curtis\u003c/a\u003e are reuniting for a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/movies/2023/05/11/freaky-friday-sequel-jamie-lee-curtis-lindsay-lohan-movie-explained/70206661007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003esequel \u0026#34;Freaky Friday.\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e"
