      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCurtis starred as overworked mother Tess Coleman and Lohan as her teenage daughter Anna who wake up to discover they have switched bodies in the 2003 \u0026#34;Freaky Friday.\u0026#34; Chaos ensues as the two try to live each other\u0026#39;s lives until they figure out a solution.\u003c/p\u003e"
