    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Joe was my support system,\u0026#34; Nyong\u0026#39;o says. \u0026#34;He was very in tune with me in a way that was so sweet and respectful.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "74207711007"
