body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73539754007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/entertainment/music/taylor-swift/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTaylor Swift\u003c/a\u003e brought her massive \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/17/a-year-of-the-eras-tour-a-look-back-at-taylor-swifts-unprecedented-show/72972730007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eEras Tour\u003c/a\u003e and acoustic set to Lyon, France, for two special nights.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFor \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/03/taylor-swift-breaks-attendance-record-for-female-artist-in-lyon-france/73948990007/#:~:text\u003dTaylor%20Swift%20broke%20an%20attendance,the%20Groupama%20Stadium%20on%20Monday.\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003enight two\u003c/a\u003e, Swift combined \u0026#34;Glitch\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Midnights\u0026#34; with \u0026#34;Everything Has Changed\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Red (Taylor\u0026#39;s Version).\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Glitch\u0026#34; was the last song off \u0026#34;Midnights\u0026#34; Swift has never before performed live. She\u0026#39;s now done every song off of \u0026#34;Speak Now (Taylor\u0026#39;s Version)\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;Midnights.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73963994007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;This is another song I\u0026#39;ve never performed live before,\u0026#34; she said when sitting at the piano to perform a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/04/18/taylor-swift-tortured-poets-album-release-updates/73149372007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Tortured Poets\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e track.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe singer-songwriter sang \u0026#34;Chloe or Sam or Sophia or Marcus.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003e\u0026#39;Long story short\u0026#39; there was a piano glitch\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn night one, the singer-songwriter began with a mashup of \u0026#34;The Prophecy\u0026#34; from \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/04/18/taylor-swift-tortured-poets-album-release-updates/73149372007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;The Tortured Poets Department\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e and \u0026#34;Long Story Short\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Evermore.\u0026#34; It was the first time Swift had performed the song off of \u0026#34;Tortured Poets\u0026#34; during this leg of her Eras Tour. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThen came a couple more tracks for her acoustic set, but not without some technical glitches. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Something\u0026#39;s wrong with the piano,\u0026#34; Swift said, sitting down at her flower-painted instrument. One of her production crew members opened the lid to check the inside. After a quick delay, she began singing \u0026#34;Fifteen\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Fearless (Taylor\u0026#39;s Version)\u0026#34; and the crowd inside the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/02/taylor-swift-sings-in-rain-eras-tours-lyon-france/73948698007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eGroupama Stadium\u003c/a\u003e erupted.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73950119007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFinally, she dove into her most performed acoustic song, \u0026#34;You\u0026#39;re On Your Own Kid\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Midnights.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFans screamed the bridge as Swift played before finishing the mashup with the final lines of \u0026#34;Fifteen.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73627073007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/02/07/taylor-swift-eras-tour-setlist-complete-list-of-surprise-songs/72484807007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eClick here\u003c/a\u003e for a complete list of her surprise songs, including the tunes she\u0026#39;s never done.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eDon\u0026#39;t miss any Taylor Swift news; sign up for the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.tennessean.com/newsletters/this-swift-beat/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003efree, weekly newsletter This Swift Beat.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eFollow Taylor Swift reporter Bryan West on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/bryanwesttv/\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@bryanwesttv\"\u003eTikTok\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/bryanwesttv\"\u003eX as @BryanWestTV\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73539754007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/entertainment/music/taylor-swift/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eTaylor Swift\u003c/a\u003e brought her massive \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/03/17/a-year-of-the-eras-tour-a-look-back-at-taylor-swifts-unprecedented-show/72972730007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eEras Tour\u003c/a\u003e and acoustic set to Lyon, France, for two special nights.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFor \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/03/taylor-swift-breaks-attendance-record-for-female-artist-in-lyon-france/73948990007/#:~:text\u003dTaylor%20Swift%20broke%20an%20attendance,the%20Groupama%20Stadium%20on%20Monday.\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003enight two\u003c/a\u003e, Swift combined \u0026#34;Glitch\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Midnights\u0026#34; with \u0026#34;Everything Has Changed\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Red (Taylor\u0026#39;s Version).\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Glitch\u0026#34; was the last song off \u0026#34;Midnights\u0026#34; Swift has never before performed live. She\u0026#39;s now done every song off of \u0026#34;Speak Now (Taylor\u0026#39;s Version)\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;Midnights.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73963994007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;This is another song I\u0026#39;ve never performed live before,\u0026#34; she said when sitting at the piano to perform a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/04/18/taylor-swift-tortured-poets-album-release-updates/73149372007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;Tortured Poets\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e track.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe singer-songwriter sang \u0026#34;Chloe or Sam or Sophia or Marcus.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003e\u0026#39;Long story short\u0026#39; there was a piano glitch\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn night one, the singer-songwriter began with a mashup of \u0026#34;The Prophecy\u0026#34; from \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/04/18/taylor-swift-tortured-poets-album-release-updates/73149372007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;The Tortured Poets Department\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e and \u0026#34;Long Story Short\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Evermore.\u0026#34; It was the first time Swift had performed the song off of \u0026#34;Tortured Poets\u0026#34; during this leg of her Eras Tour. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThen came a couple more tracks for her acoustic set, but not without some technical glitches. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Something\u0026#39;s wrong with the piano,\u0026#34; Swift said, sitting down at her flower-painted instrument. One of her production crew members opened the lid to check the inside. After a quick delay, she began singing \u0026#34;Fifteen\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Fearless (Taylor\u0026#39;s Version)\u0026#34; and the crowd inside the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/06/02/taylor-swift-sings-in-rain-eras-tours-lyon-france/73948698007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eGroupama Stadium\u003c/a\u003e erupted.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73950119007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFinally, she dove into her most performed acoustic song, \u0026#34;You\u0026#39;re On Your Own Kid\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Midnights.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFans screamed the bridge as Swift played before finishing the mashup with the final lines of \u0026#34;Fifteen.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73627073007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/02/07/taylor-swift-eras-tour-setlist-complete-list-of-surprise-songs/72484807007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eClick here\u003c/a\u003e for a complete list of her surprise songs, including the tunes she\u0026#39;s never done.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eDon\u0026#39;t miss any Taylor Swift news; sign up for the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.tennessean.com/newsletters/this-swift-beat/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003efree, weekly newsletter This Swift Beat.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eFollow Taylor Swift reporter Bryan West on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/bryanwesttv/\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tiktok.com/@bryanwesttv\"\u003eTikTok\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://twitter.com/bryanwesttv\"\u003eX as @BryanWestTV\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

