    "value": "\u003cp\u003eFinally, she dove into her most performed acoustic song, \u0026#34;You\u0026#39;re On Your Own Kid\u0026#34; from \u0026#34;Midnights.\u0026#34; \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
