      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;We can’t wait to see everyone! Thank you all for all the love and support,\u0026#34; drummer Rob Mailhouse commented under the band\u0026#39;s Instagram post. \u0026#34;We can feel it every time we take the stage. ❤️\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
