    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eRanked: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2024/05/12/best-new-broadway-shows-2024-ranked/73587655007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003e10 best new Broadway plays and musicals you need to see, including \u0026#39;Illinoise\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
