body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/01/22/jennifer-hudson-common-show-relationship/72309104007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eCommon\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/04/18/daytime-emmy-awards-2024-nominations-list/73378046007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJennifer Hudson\u003c/a\u003e are \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/09/jennifer-hudson-common-relationship/74037948007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003egoing strong\u003c/a\u003e, so much so that she\u0026#39;s featured on his new album.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn Tuesday, the rapper announced his upcoming collab album with producer and DJ Pete Rock, \u0026#34;The Auditorium, Vol. 1,\u0026#34; dropping July 12.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eGuest appearances on the album including Bilal, Posdnuos of De La Soul and the EGOT winner, the latter featured on the song \u0026#34;A God (There Is).\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74067671007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eLast month, Common and Rock released the album\u0026#39;s first single, \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dWjBLMxCeAJY\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eWise Up\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026#34; A second single, \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dWX1oqItQOqg\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eDreamin\u003c/a\u003e,\u0026#39;\u0026#34; was released Tuesday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;For me, this all started with A Dream,\u0026#34; the Grammy Award winner wrote on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8FRswgJhMS/?hl\u003den\u0026img_index\u003d1\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e Tuesday. \u0026#34;A Dream to let the world know I’ve been here. A dream to be a part of Hip Hop. A Dream to MC at a level where De La Soul, A Tribe Called Quest, KRS-One and Ice Cube knew who I was. It’s been a dream of mine to work with the LEGENDARY @realpeterock (on more than just one song). I’ve been Dreamin’ my whole life.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74067668007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCommon\u0026#39;s last studio album was 2021\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;A Beautiful Revolution (Pt. 2),\u0026#34; produced by long-time collaborator Karriem Riggins.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eRock is a legendary producer known for his work with Heavy D, Public Enemy, Nas, Slick Rick, De La Soul, Ghostface Killah and the hip-hop collective Griselda.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHudson gushed about her rapper beau during an interview with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://people.com/jennifer-hudson-says-everything-is-wonderful-dating-common-daytime-emmys-exclusive-8660524\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePeople\u003c/a\u003e at the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/06/08/dick-van-dyke-daytime-emmy-awards-oldest-winner/74026017007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e2024 Daytime Emmy Awards\u003c/a\u003e on Friday. But the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/05/02/every-american-idol-winner-ranked-worst-best/9617596002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;American Idol\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e alum was mum in offering any specific details on the couple’s relationship.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Everything is wonderful,\u0026#34; Hudson told the outlet. \u0026#34;That\u0026#39;s all you need to know.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJennifer Hudson  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/09/jennifer-hudson-common-relationship/74037948007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003egives update on romance with Common: \u0026#39;Everything is wonderful\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72187682007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHudson\u0026#39;s comments follow Common’s appearance on the singer\u0026#39;s talk show, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2022/09/12/jennifer-hudson-daytime-talks-new-egot-star-reveals-big-challenges/8005881001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;The Jennifer Hudson Show,\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e earlier this year, a conversation that drew attention after the two had been the subject of dating rumors. During the interview, Hudson and Common coyly discussed their dating lives without naming who they were involved with.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Let\u0026#39;s get down to business, Mr. Common,\u0026#34; Hudson said at the time. \u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m a host, and so I have to ask you this question because everybody always wants to know this. Are you dating anyone?\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eAre Jennifer Hudson, Common  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/01/22/jennifer-hudson-common-show-relationship/72309104007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003econfirming their relationship? Rapper talks dating EGOT winner\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe crowd cheered as the Grammy-winning rapper laughed nervously. \u0026#34;So, yes,\u0026#34; he said. \u0026#34;And I\u0026#39;m in a relationship that is (with) one of the most beautiful people I\u0026#39;ve ever met in life.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe continued, clarifying he was talking about Hudson: \u0026#34;She\u0026#39;s talented. But I set my standard kind of high because she had to have an EGOT. She had to win an Oscar on her first movie. I set my standard high. She had to get her own talk show.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73930374007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The Light\u0026#34; emcee then asked Hudson about her own love life, and she confirmed she\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;dating as well\u0026#34; and is \u0026#34;very happy.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCommon later discussed the interview on the \u0026#34;Today\u0026#34; show, stressing that he is \u0026#34;very private\u0026#34; about his relationships, which are \u0026#34;not for public consumption.\u0026#34; But \u0026#34;at the end of the day,\u0026#34; he added, \u0026#34;we were on her show. We had a good time.\u0026#34; He also said he has realized he is the \u0026#34;marrying type\u0026#34; and is open to tying the knot \u0026#34;at some point in my life.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Edward Segarra\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/01/22/jennifer-hudson-common-show-relationship/72309104007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eCommon\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/04/18/daytime-emmy-awards-2024-nominations-list/73378046007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eJennifer Hudson\u003c/a\u003e are \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/09/jennifer-hudson-common-relationship/74037948007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003egoing strong\u003c/a\u003e, so much so that she\u0026#39;s featured on his new album.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn Tuesday, the rapper announced his upcoming collab album with producer and DJ Pete Rock, \u0026#34;The Auditorium, Vol. 1,\u0026#34; dropping July 12.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eGuest appearances on the album including Bilal, Posdnuos of De La Soul and the EGOT winner, the latter featured on the song \u0026#34;A God (There Is).\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74067671007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eLast month, Common and Rock released the album\u0026#39;s first single, \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dWjBLMxCeAJY\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eWise Up\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026#34; A second single, \u0026#34;\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dWX1oqItQOqg\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eDreamin\u003c/a\u003e,\u0026#39;\u0026#34; was released Tuesday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;For me, this all started with A Dream,\u0026#34; the Grammy Award winner wrote on \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8FRswgJhMS/?hl\u003den\u0026img_index\u003d1\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eInstagram\u003c/a\u003e Tuesday. \u0026#34;A Dream to let the world know I’ve been here. A dream to be a part of Hip Hop. A Dream to MC at a level where De La Soul, A Tribe Called Quest, KRS-One and Ice Cube knew who I was. It’s been a dream of mine to work with the LEGENDARY @realpeterock (on more than just one song). I’ve been Dreamin’ my whole life.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74067668007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCommon\u0026#39;s last studio album was 2021\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;A Beautiful Revolution (Pt. 2),\u0026#34; produced by long-time collaborator Karriem Riggins.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eRock is a legendary producer known for his work with Heavy D, Public Enemy, Nas, Slick Rick, De La Soul, Ghostface Killah and the hip-hop collective Griselda.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHudson gushed about her rapper beau during an interview with \u003ca href\u003d\"https://people.com/jennifer-hudson-says-everything-is-wonderful-dating-common-daytime-emmys-exclusive-8660524\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ePeople\u003c/a\u003e at the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2024/06/08/dick-van-dyke-daytime-emmy-awards-oldest-winner/74026017007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e2024 Daytime Emmy Awards\u003c/a\u003e on Friday. But the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/music/2022/05/02/every-american-idol-winner-ranked-worst-best/9617596002/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;American Idol\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e alum was mum in offering any specific details on the couple’s relationship.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Everything is wonderful,\u0026#34; Hudson told the outlet. \u0026#34;That\u0026#39;s all you need to know.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eJennifer Hudson  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/06/09/jennifer-hudson-common-relationship/74037948007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003egives update on romance with Common: \u0026#39;Everything is wonderful\u0026#39;\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "72187682007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHudson\u0026#39;s comments follow Common’s appearance on the singer\u0026#39;s talk show, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/tv/2022/09/12/jennifer-hudson-daytime-talks-new-egot-star-reveals-big-challenges/8005881001/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u0026#34;The Jennifer Hudson Show,\u0026#34;\u003c/a\u003e earlier this year, a conversation that drew attention after the two had been the subject of dating rumors. During the interview, Hudson and Common coyly discussed their dating lives without naming who they were involved with.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Let\u0026#39;s get down to business, Mr. Common,\u0026#34; Hudson said at the time. \u0026#34;I\u0026#39;m a host, and so I have to ask you this question because everybody always wants to know this. Are you dating anyone?\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eAre Jennifer Hudson, Common  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/entertainment/celebrities/2024/01/22/jennifer-hudson-common-show-relationship/72309104007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003econfirming their relationship? Rapper talks dating EGOT winner\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe crowd cheered as the Grammy-winning rapper laughed nervously. \u0026#34;So, yes,\u0026#34; he said. \u0026#34;And I\u0026#39;m in a relationship that is (with) one of the most beautiful people I\u0026#39;ve ever met in life.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHe continued, clarifying he was talking about Hudson: \u0026#34;She\u0026#39;s talented. But I set my standard kind of high because she had to have an EGOT. She had to win an Oscar on her first movie. I set my standard high. She had to get her own talk show.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73930374007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The Light\u0026#34; emcee then asked Hudson about her own love life, and she confirmed she\u0026#39;s \u0026#34;dating as well\u0026#34; and is \u0026#34;very happy.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCommon later discussed the interview on the \u0026#34;Today\u0026#34; show, stressing that he is \u0026#34;very private\u0026#34; about his relationships, which are \u0026#34;not for public consumption.\u0026#34; But \u0026#34;at the end of the day,\u0026#34; he added, \u0026#34;we were on her show. We had a good time.\u0026#34; He also said he has realized he is the \u0026#34;marrying type\u0026#34; and is open to tying the knot \u0026#34;at some point in my life.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eContributing: Edward Segarra\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

