    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003ePILOT proponents, including Dover Mayor James Dodd, claim they are necessary and effective tools to entice developers to transform vacant or abandoned properties into revenue-generating entities for the town.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
