    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I think PILOTs are the only way do development now,\u0026#34; Dodd said at a January council meeting while discussing another residential project on Blackwell Street. \u0026#34;There has to be a benefit for the municipality and the developer as well. It has to be a win-win for both.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
