    "value": "\u003cp\u003eBarberio says he has already shaken up Parsippany and put the township back on \u0026#34;sound financial footing\u0026#34; after what he termed poor fiscal mismanagement by the Soriano administration, compounded by the COVID lockdown.\u003c/p\u003e"
