    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eA day later, the state said, the roadway \u0026#34;exhibited distress and NJDOT made the decision to fully close the bridge to traffic out of an abundance of caution and to ensure the safety of the public and workers.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

