body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73715985007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIt\u0026#39;s time to vote for the Morris/Sussex Athlete of the Week!\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eRead about the performances that stood out and let us know who you think should be the Athlete of the Week in the poll at the bottom of this page.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNominations were provided by coaches and are presented in alphabetical order. Voting closes at 6 p.m. Thursday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eBrady Bonser\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWallkill Valley senior pole vaulter\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBonser cleared 14 feet to win the Group 1 pole vault. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eLuke Gouse\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWest Morris sophomore attack\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eGouse had two goals and an assist as West Morris lost, 14-7, to eventual Group 2 champion Summit in the Group 2 North final. He also won 22 of 25 faceoffs (88%). \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eKate Heslin\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMorris Catholic senior catcher\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHeslin went 4-for-7 with a walk, a double, a home run and six RBI as Morris Catholic beat St. Mary\u0026#39;s and then \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.dailyrecord.com/story/sports/high-school/softball/2024/06/06/nj-softball-morris-catholic-wins-third-non-public-b-state-title-in-four-years/73962100007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.dailyrecord.com/story/sports/high-school/softball/2024/06/06/nj-softball-morris-catholic-wins-third-non-public-b-state-title-in-four-years/73962100007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ewon the NJSIAA title against St. Joseph\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eMore: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.dailyrecord.com/story/sports/high-school/softball/2024/06/06/nj-softball-morris-catholic-wins-third-non-public-b-state-title-in-four-years/73962100007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eMorris Catholic softball gets revenge on St. Joseph Academy to win Non-Public B title\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eJames Kahn\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMorris Knolls senior pitcher/first base\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eKahn earned the victories in both the NJSIAA North 1, Group 3 final on June 3 and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.dailyrecord.com/story/sports/high-school/baseball/2024/06/08/morris-knolls-nj-baseball-wins-group-3-state-championship-repeat/74000142007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.dailyrecord.com/story/sports/high-school/baseball/2024/06/08/morris-knolls-nj-baseball-wins-group-3-state-championship-repeat/74000142007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ethe Group 3 championship game \u003c/a\u003eon June 8. He allowed 10 hits, five walks and six earned runs, striking out 17, in 11 innings. At the plate, he was 6-for-10 with a walk and three RBI in Morris Knolls\u0026#39; three postseason wins.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eMore: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.dailyrecord.com/story/sports/high-school/baseball/2024/06/08/morris-knolls-nj-baseball-wins-group-3-state-championship-repeat/74000142007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eMorris Knolls baseball becomes county\u0026#39;s first team to win back-to-back state titles\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAaliyah Murphy\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMorristown senior sprinter/hurdler\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMurphy won the Group 4 100-meter hurdles (14.38) and placed second in the 400-meter hurdles, advancing to the Meet of Champions in both events.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eRedjee Nonez\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHackettstown senior jumper/hurdler\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNonez set a school record of 45 feet, five inches while finishing second in the Group 2 triple jump, and also placed sixth in the high hurdles (15.02).\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eRohan Tucker\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMadison sophomore sprinter\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eTucker broke the school record in the 100 meters (10.71) and 200 meters (21.79) while finishing second in both events at the Group 2 championships. He also anchored the Dodgers\u0026#39; 4x100 to fourth place in a school-record 43.13.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eCade Zeolla\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWest Morris junior pole vaulter\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eZeolla cleared 16 feet on his first attempt to win the Group 3 pole vault. It is a four-inch personal best and tied for the best mark in New Jersey this spring.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eVote!\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eNote: If you can\u0026#39;t see the poll, try refreshing the link or clearing your browser cache. If you are viewing the poll in the Twitter app, try viewing it on the Daily Record app or on DailyRecord.com.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
