    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eJane Havsy is a storyteller for the Daily Record and DailyRecord.com, part of the USA TODAY Network. For full access to live scores, breaking news and analysis, \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://cm.dailyrecord.com/specialoffer/?gps-source\u003dCPNAVBARBBB\u0026utm_medium\u003dONSITE\u0026utm_campaign\u003d2019SLJP10\u0026utm_content\u003dCPNAVBARBBB\u0026utm_source\u003dCPNAVBARBBB\u0026onSuccessRedirectURL\u003dhttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.dailyrecord.com%2F\"\u003e\u003cem\u003esubscribe today\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
