    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003ePS: If you want to spike this and make it boozy (Grandma \u003cem\u003eis \u003c/em\u003ean adult, after all), we think it pairs best with rum.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eKara VanDooijeweert is a food writer for NorthJersey.com and The Record. If you can\u0026#39;t find her in Jersey\u0026#39;s best restaurants, she\u0026#39;s probably off running a race course in the mountains. Catch her on Instagram: \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/karanicolev/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e@karanicolev\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e \u0026amp; \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/northjerseyeats/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e@northjerseyeats\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e, and sign up for her \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.northjersey.com/newsletters/north-jersey-eats\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNorth Jersey Eats newsletter\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

contentBody:
{
  "contentBody": [{
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73731669007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eAre you a fan of butterscotch and nostalgia, but not of desserts made with unidentified ingredients and mystery \u0026#34;caramel-colored syrup\u0026#34;?\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThen you\u0026#39;re probably stuck in a little dilemma over whether or not to try McDonald\u0026#39;s new \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.northjersey.com/story/entertainment/dining/2024/05/18/mcdonalds-grandma-mcflurry-taste/73733363007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eGrandma McFlurry\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eOn the one hand, you\u0026#39;d love to savor vanilla ice cream infused with \u0026#34;the candies Grandma used to hide in her purse\u0026#34; (don\u0026#39;t worry; they meant Werther\u0026#39;s, not spearmint Life Savers). \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eBut, on the other, you\u0026#39;re not totally sold on the nameless goo they blend into it, or the fact that long term research on the effects of eating McDonald\u0026#39;s corn syrup-y desserts has not yet been conducted.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eWell, good news! You don\u0026#39;t have to visit the Golden Arches to try the limited-edition cryptic treat.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eWith this simple DIY recipe, you can make the Grandma McFlurry — in whatever quality your tastebuds desire — right at home.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eHow to make McDonald\u0026#39;s Grandma McFlurry at home\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "73734293007"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eMcDonald\u0026#39;s McFlurrys are known for their creamy texture, in addition to the toppings blended into them. To recreate that thin consistency, then, you will need more than just ice cream.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eAnd, as for the flavor of the Grandma version? \u0026#34;Syrup\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;crushed candies\u0026#34; give it a butterscotch taste.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eHere\u0026#39;s what you need to make both of those things happen.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eRecipe to make McDonald\u0026#39;s Grandma McFlurry at home\u003c/h2\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eIngredients:\u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4 cups vanilla ice cream\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003e4 tablespoons milk (to thin the consistency)\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003e6 ounces Cool Whip (to create that light, airy texture)\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eButterscotch syrup (we recommend a thick one, like \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/Smucker-s-Sundae-Syrup-Butterscotch/827270459?wmlspartner\u003dwlpa\u0026selectedSellerId\u003d101458479\u0026gclsrc\u003daw.ds\u0026\u0026adid\u003d22222222227827270459_101458479_166291823447_21295629803\u0026wl0\u003d\u0026wl1\u003dg\u0026wl2\u003dc\u0026wl3\u003d699952701032\u0026wl4\u003dpla-2370949807437\u0026wl5\u003d9003506\u0026wl6\u003d\u0026wl7\u003d\u0026wl8\u003d\u0026wl9\u003dpla\u0026wl10\u003d5075057065\u0026wl11\u003donline\u0026wl12\u003d827270459_101458479\u0026veh\u003dsem\u0026gad_source\u003d1\u0026gclid\u003dCj0KCQjwu8uyBhC6ARIsAKwBGpSRX7ihZmwcm8g1wy1rZGI4garzFzKQHngkXrr5Ij2CRCHxplArHI8aAohgEALw_wcB\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eSmucker\u0026#39;s\u003c/a\u003e, before a barista-style one. If unavailable, caramel syrup suffices)\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eEnglish Toffee Bits (Heath makes a \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.acmemarkets.com/shop/product-details.113400257.html?productId\u003d113400257\u0026psrc\u003dg\u0026CMPID\u003dps_acm_acmd_ecom_goo_20200329_71700000081452342_58700007109446219_92700063958588311\u0026gad_source\u003d1\u0026gclid\u003dCj0KCQjwu8uyBhC6ARIsAKwBGpQwpEh5hj7PJ3FDK9R2-KFDcSpM2sLWRBdq8_l4DClM0vMbSEmPIRIaAnA9EALw_wcB\u0026gclsrc\u003daw.ds\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003ebagged version of these\u003c/a\u003e that you can get on Amazon or at ACME, or you can pre-crush some toffee yourself)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003ch3 class\u003d\"presto-h3 wp-block-heading\"\u003eInstructions:\u003c/h3\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdd the ice cream, milk and Cool Whip to a blender and blend until smooth. *If you don\u0026#39;t have a blender, use a mixer and a bowl.*\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eAdd in the butterscotch syrup and toffee pieces, mixing until you attain a light golden brown color. For a true McDonald\u0026#39;s experience, you barely need to mix at all (lately, the chain has just been pouring the candy and syrup over the top, but we don\u0026#39;t think that tastes so great).\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003ePour into a cup and enjoy with a spoon.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYield\u003c/strong\u003e: 2 servings.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003ePS: If you want to spike this and make it boozy (Grandma \u003cem\u003eis \u003c/em\u003ean adult, after all), we think it pairs best with rum.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eKara VanDooijeweert is a food writer for NorthJersey.com and The Record. If you can\u0026#39;t find her in Jersey\u0026#39;s best restaurants, she\u0026#39;s probably off running a race course in the mountains. Catch her on Instagram: \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/karanicolev/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e@karanicolev\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e \u0026amp; \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/northjerseyeats/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e@northjerseyeats\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e, and sign up for her \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.northjersey.com/newsletters/north-jersey-eats\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNorth Jersey Eats newsletter\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "11641903002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eWhat do Lee Trevino, Marcus Samuelsson and CC Sabathia have in common? All have been spotted at Alpine Country Club\u0026#39;s \u003ca href\u003d\"https://ccfgtt24.eventlify.com/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eCelebrity Chefs \u0026amp; Friends Golf and Tennis Tournament\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHeld annually at North Jersey\u0026#39;s most posh golf venue, the event — which is known more as being a \u0026#34;day camp\u0026#34; for top chefs than a cutthroat athletic competition — attracts all the region\u0026#39;s biggest celebrities; from culinary icons to sports legends.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAnd, at the end of the evening? All of the proceeds are donated to New York\u0026#39;s biggest food rescue organization, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.cityharvest.org/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eCity Harvest\u003c/a\u003e, which helps deliver meals to people in need.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHere\u0026#39;s everything we know about the upcoming \u0026#34;food and wine festival that happens to take place on a golf course\u0026#34; — and how you can get in on it.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "11826630002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eA star-studded food festival on a lavish golf course\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCelebrity Chefs \u0026amp; Friends Golf and Tennis Tournament is an all-day charity event during which golf foursomes (AKA, you guys) are joined by a fifth player (a chef, celebrity or sports personality) on the manicured grounds of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.alpinecc.org/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eAlpine Country Club\u003c/a\u003e. Tennis players will be accompanied by renowned chefs and restaurateurs.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThis year\u0026#39;s event will be held on Monday, June 24.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "11826634002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThroughout the afternoon, athletes will duke it out for the top titles on the court/course, with both tournaments culminating in a lavish reception — hosted by 65(+) celebrity chefs and acclaimed restaurants.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIn other words? You don\u0026#39;t need to know anything about sports to attend.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eYou just need a big appetite.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "11826626002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAn exquisite reception for a worthy cause\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe country club\u0026#39;s annual tournament is always hosted by big names, who, this year, will be golf superstar \u003ca href\u003d\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lee_Trevino\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLee Trevino\u003c/a\u003e and tennis great \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/reillyopelka/?hl\u003den\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eReilly Opelka\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eSet to begin at 9:30 a.m., the day will open with the sports competitions, followed by the food reception at 5:30 p.m. Tickets can be purchased for both parts or (if you\u0026#39;re more of a foodie, like most attendees) the reception only.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eDuring the reception, guests will be treated to a luxurious spread of food and cocktails from New York City and Bergen County\u0026#39;s top chefs and most highly decorated restaurants. In the past, gastronomic stars from \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/lebernardinny/?hl\u003den\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eLe Bernardin\u003c/a\u003e, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/restaurantdaniel/?hl\u003den\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eRestaurant Daniel\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/cotekoreansteakhouse/?hl\u003den\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eCOTE\u003c/a\u003e have attended, alongside Food Network personalities like \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/geoffreyzakarian/?hl\u003den\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eGeoffrey Zakarian\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "11826639002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eSome menu highlights have included soy-marinated short ribs, lamb lollipops and thousands of dollars of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.snakeriverfarms.com/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eSnake River Farm\u003c/a\u003e steaks, to name a few.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eSo, if you have $1,000 to spare for a ticket — or you\u0026#39;re willing to splurge in the name of once-in-a-lifetime eats and guaranteed celebrity elbow brushes — hurry up and grab your ticket; because the popular event is expected to sell out soon.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"https://ccfgtt24.eventlify.com/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eCelebrity Chefs \u0026amp; Friends Golf and Tennis Tournament\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003ewill be hosted at 80 Anderson Ave. in Demarest\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eon Monday, June 24. Tickets can be purchased at \u003ca href\u003d\"https://ccfgtt24.eventlify.com/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eccfgtt24.eventlify.com\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eKara VanDooijeweert is a food writer for NorthJersey.com and The Record. If you can\u0026#39;t find her in Jersey\u0026#39;s best restaurants, she\u0026#39;s probably off running a race course in the mountains. Catch her on Instagram: \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/karanicolev/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e@karanicolev\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e \u0026amp; \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/northjerseyeats/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e@northjerseyeats\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e, and sign up for her \u003c/em\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://profile.northjersey.com/newsletters/north-jersey-eats\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNorth Jersey Eats newsletter\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
