    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eThe results are in: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.northjersey.com/story/news/local/201-mag/2024/03/07/best-of-bergen-county-restaurants-2024-specialty-food-shops/72727604007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eSee the Best of Bergen Food and Drink winners for 2024\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe Edgewater location does not have their own website yet, but customers can get a sneak peak of what is to come at the chain\u0026#39;s \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.tommystavernandtap.com/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.tommystavernandtap.com/\"\u003eother locations\u003c/a\u003e. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eTommy\u0026#39;s Tavern will join other shops and restaurants at the City Place Promenade, including Fleming\u0026#39;s steakhouse, Greek Taverna, The Original Pancake House, Chipotle, Panera Bread and Haagen-Dazs. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
