      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eA walk amongst culinary stars\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;This is amazing,\u0026#34; I said, passing the table where \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/danielboulud/?hl\u003den\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eDaniel Boulud\u003c/a\u003e\u0026#39;s sous chef was preparing a geometrically flawless pâté en croûte. \u0026#34;I\u0026#39;ve never seen so much caviar and foie gras in the same place.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
