    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e∎ June 27. Propelify Innovation Festival, powered by TechUnited: NJ. 11 a.m. to 9 p.m. Maxwell Place Park, 1 11\u003csup\u003eth\u003c/sup\u003e Street, Hoboken\u003c/p\u003e"
