    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e∎ July 26. A Conversation with Stephen Colbert \u0026amp; Paul Giamatti. 8 p.m., NJPAC,  Newark. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eFor more information...\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
