    "value": "\u003cp\u003e∎ June 26. The Lincoln Park Jazzy Soul Series: North to Shore Edition starring TRAPJAZZ. 6:30 p.m. Newark Symphony Hall, Terrace Ballroom.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e∎ June 26. A Day to Remember. 7 p.m. Prudential Center, 25 Lafayette St, Newark.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
