    "value": "\u003cp\u003e∎ June 27 to 30. Montclair Film Summer Showcase, including include \u0026#34;Super/Man: The Christopher Reeve Story,\u0026#34; \u0026#34;Sing Sing\u0026#34; and \u0026#34;Luther: Never Too Much.\u0026#34; 8 p.m., The Clairidge, 486 Bloomfield Ave, Montclair. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e∎ June 27. Propelify Innovation Festival, powered by TechUnited: NJ. 11 a.m. to 9 p.m. Maxwell Place Park, 1 11\u003csup\u003eth\u003c/sup\u003e Street, Hoboken\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e∎ June 27. Felix Hernandez Rhythm Revue Dance Party. 6 p.m., Chambers Plaza, NJPAC, Newark. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e∎ June 27. Rah Digga\u0026#39;s Lyrics Matter: The Salon Series. 6 p.m. Clement\u0026#39;s Place.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e∎J une 27. Matchbox Twenty with special guest Andy Grammer. 7 p.m. Prudential Center.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e∎ June 28. Jazz and Joy featuring Lynette Sheard Experience \u0026amp; N.J. Mental Health Players. 6 p.m. Clement\u0026#39;s Pace, Newark.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
