  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e∎ June 28. Zarna Garg. 7 p.m. Victoria Theater, NJPAC,  Newark. (SOLD OUT).\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e∎ June 28. Brick City Jam x All Points West Distillery Spirit Fest. 7 p.m., 73 Tichenor Street, Newark.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e∎ June 28. The Amethyst \u0026amp; Amber Griot Gala: A Celebration of Newark Poetry. 7 p.m. Kruger-Scott Mansion, 601 Dr Martin Luther King Jr Blvd., Newark. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e∎ June 28. Broadway in the Bricks 7 p.m.  Military Park, 93 Park Place, Newark. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
