body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74104553007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<p>Broadway&#39;s biggest night is here! </p>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<p>Follow along for a running list of the 2024 Tony Awards winners.</p>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<p>Winners are listed in bold at the top of their category, followed by all the nominees.</p>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<p><span class="exclude-from-newsgate"><strong style="margin-right:3px;">More: </strong><a href="https://www.northjersey.com/story/entertainment/theater/2024/06/13/2024-tony-awards-stereophonic-and-hells-kitchen-lead-nominations/73973928007/" target="_blank">Who will win at the 2024 Tony Awards? Our critics go toe-to-toe</a></span></p>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<h2 class="presto-h2 wp-block-heading">Best Musical</h2>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<ul>
<li>&#34;Hell&#39;s Kitchen&#34;</li>



<li>&#34;Illinoise&#34;</li>



<li>&#34;The Outsiders&#34;</li>



<li>&#34;Suffs&#34;</li>



<li>&#34;Water for Elephants&#34;</li>
</ul>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<h2 class="presto-h2 wp-block-heading">Best Play</h2>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<ul>
<li><strong>&#34;Stereophonic&#34;</strong></li>



<li>&#34;Jaja&#39;s African Hair Braiding&#34;</li>



<li>&#34;Mary Jane&#34;</li>



<li>&#34;Mother Play: A Play in Five Evictions&#34;</li>



<li>&#34;Prayer for the French Republic&#34;</li>
</ul>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<h2 class="presto-h2 wp-block-heading">Best Revival of a Play</h2>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<ul>
<li><strong>&#34;Appropriate&#34;</strong></li>



<li>&#34;An Enemy of the People&#34;</li>



<li>&#34;Purlie Victorious: A Non-Confederate Romp Through the Cotton Patch&#34;</li>
</ul>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<h2 class="presto-h2 wp-block-heading">Best Revival of a Musical</h2>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<ul>
<li><strong>&#34;Merrily We Roll Along&#34;</strong></li>



<li>&#34;Cabaret at the Kit Kat Club&#34;</li>



<li>&#34;Gutenberg! The Musical!&#34;</li>



<li>&#34;The Who&#39;s Tommy&#34;</li>
</ul>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<h2 class="presto-h2 wp-block-heading">Best Performance by an Actress in a Leading Role in a Musical</h2>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<ul>
<li><strong>Maleah Joi Moon, &#34;Hell&#39;s Kitchen&#34;</strong></li>



