    "value": "7799415002"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eBergen County residents have a new opportunity to engage in friendly competition, where swimmers need to put their running shoes on — and runners need to bring a bathing suit.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe River Edge Swim Club holds its first-ever Splash N’ Dash Biathlon on Saturday, June 22. All Bergen County residents are welcome to compete in the event. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eContestants will swim laps in the 25-meter-laned pool, then run on the swim club grounds and nearby athletic field.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eStory continues below photo gallery\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "asset",
    "value": "872241002"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003eThere are 14 events, and ages range from 5 to 18 and over. The number of pool laps and running distance is based on the seven different age brackets. For each age group, there is a male and female race. \u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
