body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73977049007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe newest ride at \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.legoland.com/new-york/\"\u003eLEGOLAND New York\u003c/a\u003e opens soon.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHere’s what to know about the Minifigure Skyflyer.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eLEGOLAND ride New York opens soon\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eImagine you and your friends are partying in a flying gondola as it sweeps across and through LEGOLAND New York’s themed worlds. That’s the Minifigure Skyflyer.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "74154454007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The party starts on the ground with an immersive queuing experience filled with disco tune music and inviting guests to get in the groove with the signature Minifigure Skyflyer Dance,” ds,\u0026#34; read a news release from LEGOLAND New York. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWhen can I ride the \u0026#39;Minifigure Skyflyer\u0026#39; at LEGOLAND New York?\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eYou\u0026#39;ll have your chance to party on LEGOLAND New York\u0026#39;s Minifigure Skyflyer during a special disco dance party on Monday, June 24.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe party will double as an attempt to break a world record.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eLEGOLAND New York is \u0026#34;aiming to break the World Record for the Largest Disco Dance party with thousands of disco-clad fans in attendance,\u0026#34; read LEGOLAND New York\u0026#39;s news release. \u0026#34;Guests are encouraged to dress in their disco best: glitter/sequin apparel, sparkly tutus, disco ball themed accessories, and other disco-themed duds.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eTo that end, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.legoland.com/new-york/promotions/disco-dance-party/#form\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.legoland.com/new-york/promotions/disco-dance-party/#form\"\u003ethe first 2,500 people who register online for LEGOLAND\u0026#39;s Minifigure Skyflyer\u003c/a\u003e and show up in disco-themed garb will receive free passes for same-day access.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eLEGOLAND New York\u0026#39;s Minifigure Skyflyer has seven party pods\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe Minifigure Skyflyer has seven party pods featuring popular LEGOLAND characters:\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePirate Shindig, featuring Calico Jade and Scallywag.\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eDinner Party, featuring a food tour by Hot Dog Man\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eParty Animals, with comedians Chicken Suit Guy and Racoon Costume Fan\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eCity, featuring the No Limits crew\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eDisco Pod, featuring Hip Hop Girl\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eBrick Party, feating super fans Mike and Amy\u003c/li\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cli\u003eLEGO Galaxy world party, featuring Alien Dancer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eLEGOLAND New York Resort sits on 500 acres in Goshen, New York.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": " "
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
