      "value": "<p>Ten municipalities in Bergen County had contested primary races on Tuesday. </p>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "<p>There were contested Democratic races in Alpine, Bogota, Englewood and Tenafly and contested Republican races in Franklin Lakes, Oakland, Old Tappan, Ridgefield and Wyckoff. Palisades Park was the only borough to have contested races on both sides of the aisle. </p>"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
