    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eCouncilman David May spoke during the public hearing section of the meeting. He stated the original plan for the site was not just one 24-story building but \u0026#34;two more just like that.\u0026#34; A previous proposal for a town village, 800 affordable housing units and 350,000 square feet of retail space was a more intense use. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
