    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBogdansky, vice president of the Wyckoff Republican Club, said she was \u0026#34;deeply concerned that our Wyckoff Republican Party was tested,\u0026#34; adding \u0026#34;we work together to unite, not only as Republicans, but also as neighbors.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eWYCKOFF PRIMARY \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.northjersey.com/story/news/bergen/2022/10/21/politics-top-concern-in-ramapo-indian-hills-school-board-races/69574942007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003ePolitics are a top concern in Ramapo Indian Hills nonpartisan school board races\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Thank you to the many friends who pushed for us in these past few months and to the Wyckoff voters for their support and faith in us,\u0026#34; Bogdansky said.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
