      "value": "\u003cp\u003eVotes for Madigan and Bogdansky signal continued community support for their \u0026#34;parents\u0026#39; rights\u0026#34; views and their blurring of the line traditionally separating municipal and educational agencies. Both are frequent attendees and commenters at meetings of the Ramapo Indian Hills Regional High School\u0026#39;s Board of Education, where Bogdansky\u0026#39;s husband Tom is a Wyckoff member and Madigan previously served 14 years as trustee.  \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
