      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMadigan was at the May 30 board meeting to praise the trustees for their unanimous vote on the newly hired Superintendent Ronnie Tarchichi. He has declared himself a \u0026#34;believer in family values\u0026#34; in this year\u0026#39;s election. Bogdansky is a founder of \u003ca href\u003d\"https://wsnj.org/\"\u003eWomen United for a Stronger New Jersey\u003c/a\u003e encouraging \u0026#34;moderate Republican and Independent women\u0026#34; to run for office,  and sponsoring a mix of Republican and nonpartisan board candidates together at meet-and-greets during election season.\u003c/p\u003e"
