      "value": "\u003cp\u003eProsecutors accused Angst of conspiring with Michael McFadden, 54, of New Milford, an insurance agent with Insuranze Associates in Hasbrouck Heights, charging the men via summonses in September 2023, according to the Morris County Prosecutor\u0026#39;s Office.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eMorris County NJ \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.dailyrecord.com/story/news/2024/06/25/bettylou-decroce-lawsuit-dover-mayor-james-dodd/74202404007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eFormer NJ assemblywoman files $15M whistleblower lawsuit against Dover, mayor\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMcFadden allegedly created false documents saying Angst had a workers\u0026#39; compensation coverage policy for his company, C\u0026amp;E Professional Painting LLC, in Long Valley. The business did not have a workers\u0026#39; compensation policy, officials said.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAngst had allegedly falsely presented his company to a client as being insured and the client unknowingly submitted the fake documents to an insurance carrier, according to officials.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAngst was also accused of gifting McFadden a gold Police Benevolent Association card in exchange for the documents, authorities said.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
