body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73970952007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThere are only a handful of contested primaries in Essex County municipalities this year and on the county level.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eOne of the major races is in the Essex County sheriff primary, where two Democrats and two Republicans are vying for their party\u0026#39;s nomination to replace retiring Armando B. Fontoura. The longest serving sheriff in New Jersey history, Fontoura at age 81 announced in March that he will not seek a 13th term.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe other hotly-contested race is the Democratic primary for the Bloomfield mayoral race. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFor the presidential, senate and congressional races in New Jersey, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.northjersey.com/story/news/politics/elections/2024/06/03/nj-primary-election-2024-results-president-senate-congress/73962146007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.northjersey.com/story/news/politics/elections/2024/06/03/nj-primary-election-2024-results-president-senate-congress/73962146007/\"\u003ethe results can be found here.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFor county committee and other races in Essex County, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://results.enr.clarityelections.com/NJ/Essex/121716/web.317647/#/summary\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://results.enr.clarityelections.com/NJ/Essex/121716/web.317647/#/summary\"\u003echeck the results on the county website.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHere are the results from select county and municipal primaries on Tuesday, June 4:\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
