      "value": "\u003cp\u003eFor the presidential, senate and congressional races in New Jersey, \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.northjersey.com/story/news/politics/elections/2024/06/03/nj-primary-election-2024-results-president-senate-congress/73962146007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.northjersey.com/story/news/politics/elections/2024/06/03/nj-primary-election-2024-results-president-senate-congress/73962146007/\"\u003ethe results can be found here.\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
