      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe fire was reported on the southbound side by exit 151 shortly before 5 p.m., per the DOT. The two right lanes were blocked but an alert about the closures was gone by about 6:15 p.m. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73941026007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNo one was injured but what caused the Nissan to catch fire remains under investigation, a New Jersey State Police spokesperson said. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

