      "value": "\u003cp\u003eA \u0026#34;Travel For Teens\u0026#34; trip to Japan had been planned for last June, but a spate of stormy weather scuttled that adventure. He would not be denied a trip to Asia and ended up on a three-week summer excursion to Vietnam, Thailand, Cambodia and Laos.\u003c/p\u003e"
