body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "1685273001"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eRoxbury, Morris County and state authorities continued their search on Monday morning for an older man \u0026#34;who entered Lake Hopatcong and did not return\u0026#34; Saturday night.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eRoxbury police confirmed on Monday there is a search and ongoing investigation of a possible drowning that began at 7:31 p.m. Saturday for a man believed to be in his 70s. The Roxbury Fire Department, New Jersey State Police and Morris County Sheriff\u0026#39;s Department have joined the search.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eCheck back for updates to this story.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
