      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eMore:  \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.northjersey.com/story/news/transportation/2024/06/05/route-15-closed-nj-when-reopen-expected-delays-morris-sussex/73984900007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eWhen will Route 15 reopen? Here\u0026#39;s the latest as Morris, Sussex drivers battle huge delays\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
