    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73745646007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe full bar list announced Thursday includes one other New Jersey location: \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C8fL6mUgKKJ/?hl\u003den\u0026img_index\u003d1\"\u003eBarnacle Bill\u0026#39;s in Rumson\u003c/a\u003e. The eateries are spread across 15 states, including four in Bryan\u0026#39;s native Oklahoma, along with one in Toronto, Canada.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
