      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAT\u0026amp;T customers may be experiencing issues contacting users of other wireless carriers, the company acknowledged on Tuesday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;There is a nationwide issue that is affecting the ability of customers to complete calls between carriers,\u0026#34; AT\u0026amp;T posted on X, formerly Twitter, around 4 p.m.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAT\u0026amp;T stated it is working to \u0026#34;diagnose and resolve the issue.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eCheck back for more on this developing story\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAT\u0026amp;T customers may be experiencing issues contacting users of other wireless carriers, the company acknowledged on Tuesday.\u003c/p\u003e"
