  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e Every 80 years, the dwarf star of T Coronae Borealis blows off its outer shell, leaving the core. Then it starts bingeing again. Then it purges. And so on, and on. It sounds odd, but it\u0026#39;s not uncommon, Swangin said.\u003c/p\u003e"
  }, {
    "type": "text",
    "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;Since we know that a significant number of stars in the universe belong not only to a binary system but multiple star systems, it\u0026#39;s not that unusual to have this take place,\u0026#34; he said. \u0026#34;We\u0026#39;ve seen this in other galaxies.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
  }]
}

body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "73626545007"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eIt\u0026#39;s a debate as old as time: how much to spend on an engagement ring? Different websites offer different averages of what couples typically spend on engagement rings, but one thing is for certain: the prices are not cheap. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eAverage price of an engagement ring\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.jared.com/how-much-to-spend-on-an-engagement-ring#:~:text\u003dIn%20reality%2C%20the%20average%20engagement,more%20and%20some%20spending%20less.\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.jared.com/how-much-to-spend-on-an-engagement-ring#:~:text\u003dIn%20reality%2C%20the%20average%20engagement,more%20and%20some%20spending%20less.\"\u003ejewelry store Jared\u003c/a\u003e claims the average price for an engagement ring can range from anywhere between $1,000 to $5,000 with some spending more and some spending less. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe store on its website debunks the \u0026#34;most common engagement rule\u0026#34; which came from a 1930s marketing campaign that you should spend roughly three months salary on an engagement ring. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "6740798001"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.fidelity.com/learning-center/smart-money/how-much-money-should-you-spend-on-a-wedding-ring#:~:text\u003dAnd%20despite%20the%20%246%2C000%20national,%244%2C000%20on%20an%20engagement%20ring.\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.fidelity.com/learning-center/smart-money/how-much-money-should-you-spend-on-a-wedding-ring#:~:text\u003dAnd%20despite%20the%20%246%2C000%20national,%244%2C000%20on%20an%20engagement%20ring.\"\u003efinance corporation Fidelity\u003c/a\u003e call the national average of an engagement ring $6,000, but added that one in three couples spend between $1,000 to $4,000. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe average price for engagement rings in \u003ca href\u003d\"https://worldpopulationreview.com/state-rankings/engagement-ring-cost-by-state\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://worldpopulationreview.com/state-rankings/engagement-ring-cost-by-state\"\u003eNew Jersey\u003c/a\u003e is set at $8,842 according to World Population Review. The Garden State is on the higher end of average prices as we land at the fifth-highest even above New York. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eFactors for engagement ring prices\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eBoth the jewelry store and the finance group say what determines the price of an engagement ring are the four Cs: cut, clarity, carat and color. Jared states 14-18K white gold or platinum are the most popular choices but can be expensive, while 10k gold in rose, white and yellow are other alternatives that give the ring a vintage vibe. Other options include sterling silver that may be more affordable. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNearly all of the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.jared.com/engagement/c/7000000033?q\u003d*%3A_relevance_Ascending\u0026cid\u003dSEM-goo-engagement+ring-E-Commerce+-+NB+-+Bridal+-+Engagement\u0026gad_source\u003d1\u0026gclid\u003dEAIaIQobChMIkcrm2o7ZhgMVPGpHAR0HxAAWEAAYASAAEgJGpPD_BwE\u0026gclsrc\u003daw.ds\u0026loadMore\u003d1\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.jared.com/engagement/c/7000000033?q\u003d*%3A_relevance_Ascending\u0026cid\u003dSEM-goo-engagement+ring-E-Commerce+-+NB+-+Bridal+-+Engagement\u0026gad_source\u003d1\u0026gclid\u003dEAIaIQobChMIkcrm2o7ZhgMVPGpHAR0HxAAWEAAYASAAEgJGpPD_BwE\u0026gclsrc\u003daw.ds\u0026loadMore\u003d1\"\u003eengagement ring options\u003c/a\u003e at Jared are over $1,000. Some engagement ring options at Helzberg Diamonds at Garden State Plaza start at $500. Fidelity suggests to shop around at multiple different shops and locations to compare the prices to ensure you are getting a good deal. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"exclude-from-newsgate\"\u003e\u003cstrong style\u003d\"margin-right:3px;\"\u003eBuying jewelry for someone special?   \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.northjersey.com/story/news/local/201-mag/2024/02/14/north-jersey-jewelry-designers-bracelets-rings-necklances-earrings/72483933007/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eMeet the makers behind these local designs\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eNorth Jersey jewelry stores\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eJewelry stores in North Jersey include more than just the mainstream Jared, Kay Jewelers, Tiffany and CO. and Helzberg Diamonds. Some local shops include Paramus Jewelry Exchange, Clifton Jewelers and James Diamond of Hackensack. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": " "
    }],
