body:
{
  "body": {
    "desktop": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "7715536002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAre you working Wednesday?\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/politics/2021/06/17/juneteenth-bill-marking-end-slavery-us-signed-biden/7717031002/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/politics/2021/06/17/juneteenth-bill-marking-end-slavery-us-signed-biden/7717031002/\"\u003eJuneteenth\u003c/a\u003e — the federal holiday codified in 2021 that commemorates the day that the last African American slaves were told they had been freed — falls on Wednesday, June 19, but not every state recognizes the holiday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAccording to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://sgp.fas.org/crs/misc/R44865.pdf\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://sgp.fas.org/crs/misc/R44865.pdf\"\u003eCongressional Research Service\u003c/a\u003e, at least 28 states and the District of Columbia have designated Juneteenth as a permanent paid or legal holiday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHere\u0026#39;s what you need to know.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eFederal government, banks closed on Juneteenth\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefing-room/speeches-remarks/2021/06/17/remarks-by-president-biden-at-signing-of-the-juneteenth-national-independence-day-act/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefing-room/speeches-remarks/2021/06/17/remarks-by-president-biden-at-signing-of-the-juneteenth-national-independence-day-act/\"\u003ePresident Joe Biden signed the Juneteenth National Independence Day Act on June 17, 2021\u003c/a\u003e, establishing Juneteenth as a federal holiday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe federal government also confirmed via a post on X, the social media platform formerly known as Twitter, that federal courts will be closed on Juneteenth.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;U.S. courts will be closed June 19 for the Juneteenth holiday,\u0026#34; \u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/uscourts/status/1800898351392538651\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://x.com/uscourts/status/1800898351392538651\"\u003eread the U.S. Court\u0026#39;s Juneteenth post on X\u003c/a\u003e. \u0026#34;E-filing will be available. Contact your local federal court for more info.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "7677767001"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/money/2024/06/17/bank-post-office-ups-fedex-juneteenth-2024/74059432007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/money/2024/06/17/bank-post-office-ups-fedex-juneteenth-2024/74059432007/#\"\u003eBank of America, Capital One, Citibank, JP Morgan Chase and Truist have all confirmed that its branches will be closed on Juneteenth\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMost driver license agencies will be closed on Juneteenth as well.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWill mail be delivered on Juneteenth?\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe United States Postal Service confirmed its branches will be closed on Juneteenth.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;U.S. Postal Service retail locations will be closed, and there will be no regular mail delivery, except for holiday premium Priority Mail Express, on Wednesday, June 19, in observance of the Juneteenth holiday,\u0026#34; read a portion of a press release from USPS. \u0026#34;Customers are still able to order stamps, shipping supplies, print shipping labels, and request package pickups 24/7, including holidays, \u003ca href\u003d\"http://www.usps.com/\"\u003eonline\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eDo I have to work on Juneteenth?\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe short answer is, mostly likely, no. Only first-responders and essential staff are mandated to work on Juneteenth. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMost retail outlets and restaurants will remain open, so if you work in those industries, chances are you will be clocking in on Juneteenth.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNon-essential employees in the local branches of government will be off for Juneteenth, as will most 12-month public education staff. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003ePrivate businesses and industry make their own holiday calendars and may or may not observe Juneteenth as a holiday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }],
    "mobile": [{
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "7715536002"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAre you working Wednesday?\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/politics/2021/06/17/juneteenth-bill-marking-end-slavery-us-signed-biden/7717031002/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/news/politics/2021/06/17/juneteenth-bill-marking-end-slavery-us-signed-biden/7717031002/\"\u003eJuneteenth\u003c/a\u003e — the federal holiday codified in 2021 that commemorates the day that the last African American slaves were told they had been freed — falls on Wednesday, June 19, but not every state recognizes the holiday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eAccording to the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://sgp.fas.org/crs/misc/R44865.pdf\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://sgp.fas.org/crs/misc/R44865.pdf\"\u003eCongressional Research Service\u003c/a\u003e, at least 28 states and the District of Columbia have designated Juneteenth as a permanent paid or legal holiday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eHere\u0026#39;s what you need to know.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eFederal government, banks closed on Juneteenth\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefing-room/speeches-remarks/2021/06/17/remarks-by-president-biden-at-signing-of-the-juneteenth-national-independence-day-act/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/briefing-room/speeches-remarks/2021/06/17/remarks-by-president-biden-at-signing-of-the-juneteenth-national-independence-day-act/\"\u003ePresident Joe Biden signed the Juneteenth National Independence Day Act on June 17, 2021\u003c/a\u003e, establishing Juneteenth as a federal holiday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe federal government also confirmed via a post on X, the social media platform formerly known as Twitter, that federal courts will be closed on Juneteenth.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;U.S. courts will be closed June 19 for the Juneteenth holiday,\u0026#34; \u003ca href\u003d\"https://x.com/uscourts/status/1800898351392538651\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://x.com/uscourts/status/1800898351392538651\"\u003eread the U.S. Court\u0026#39;s Juneteenth post on X\u003c/a\u003e. \u0026#34;E-filing will be available. Contact your local federal court for more info.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "asset",
      "value": "7677767001"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/money/2024/06/17/bank-post-office-ups-fedex-juneteenth-2024/74059432007/\" data-type\u003d\"link\" data-id\u003d\"https://www.usatoday.com/story/money/2024/06/17/bank-post-office-ups-fedex-juneteenth-2024/74059432007/#\"\u003eBank of America, Capital One, Citibank, JP Morgan Chase and Truist have all confirmed that its branches will be closed on Juneteenth\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMost driver license agencies will be closed on Juneteenth as well.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eWill mail be delivered on Juneteenth?\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe United States Postal Service confirmed its branches will be closed on Juneteenth.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;U.S. Postal Service retail locations will be closed, and there will be no regular mail delivery, except for holiday premium Priority Mail Express, on Wednesday, June 19, in observance of the Juneteenth holiday,\u0026#34; read a portion of a press release from USPS. \u0026#34;Customers are still able to order stamps, shipping supplies, print shipping labels, and request package pickups 24/7, including holidays, \u003ca href\u003d\"http://www.usps.com/\"\u003eonline\u003c/a\u003e.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003ch2 class\u003d\"presto-h2 wp-block-heading\"\u003eDo I have to work on Juneteenth?\u003c/h2\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eThe short answer is, mostly likely, no. Only first-responders and essential staff are mandated to work on Juneteenth. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eMost retail outlets and restaurants will remain open, so if you work in those industries, chances are you will be clocking in on Juneteenth.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003eNon-essential employees in the local branches of government will be off for Juneteenth, as will most 12-month public education staff. \u003c/p\u003e"
    }, {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "\u003cp\u003ePrivate businesses and industry make their own holiday calendars and may or may not observe Juneteenth as a holiday.\u003c/p\u003e"
    }]
  }
}

